<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Hettui Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">CEEPAW</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ceepaw ha Binyak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ceepaw</para>
  <para style="toc3">Cee</para>
  <para style="mt1">CEEPAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ceepaw ha Binyak</para>
  <para style="imt">Cawphuannyak</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Ceepaw ha Binyak</char> ce Jesuh huankhu lyamma khoi bua hluanna y hngulawnglyktih ha eyng hyau hnguːt bawva, Jerusalem ma kuːhthuh Judah pee, Samaria pee ja Jummeitihpuːpaw acuːk phun nyak kuithai a si (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1.8</ref></char>). Luka ce y pumhngaw dy cyppei theila Sityang Poai y jok hnguːt. Yn ce Sibawi si theila poaijaa syambuːei nyak kyng a hlyija sathih tawvei tih y si. Luka ce ynih sityang poai la ceethai cawuk pahngih dyn Griik khyang juː “<char style="it">Theophilus</char>” tyng hnguːn hnguːt, ynbawlaakhy cawuk ha ce Griik la Judah khyangjuː pahngih dyn pui theila Khritjan bawngbe ha tawk hnguːn hnguːt tijyng uːttei nyak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1">1.1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ceethai cawuk ce Khrit myi pynnyng khukum 60–64 kikawvyng Pawluh phehimm kuːh lytluu hluan na cawuk khuːnkawh hnguːt khiannyng jokkei hnguːt tih si nyn. Luka khycee Ceepaw Pawluh dy punga zet hnguːt hah theila Antiawk luh a Ceethai ha y jok hnguːt. Ceethai ha ce Luka sityang poai jyng shoijei theila, Jesuh huankhu lyamma khoi bua khyang ngyng acuːk phun hnguːt. Luka na y jok hluː khyang ce ynih sityang poai jok khyang dy a cyppei kat. Yn na Theophilus la Khritjan na thawnlu tih ha kawng lu khyang tawk nyangmi cawksyangei hnguːt khyang ha y si tyngtyng syak khiannyng, Jesuh syakom la Khritjan ha kawnglu khyang ahngoan tih pahuat y jok hnguːt.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ceethai cawuk ce mymi tawk acuːk jummeitihpuːpaw myicuh nyak la Jesuh jummeinyak bawva, syak hiyang khyang ha y cypkyp hnguːt. Ceepaw ha syak hiyan cypkyp nyak ha ce, aciya ha eyng sityang poai khyaukhaw phyatjyat nawva Muikhaw Cim phunggan ibawva umpaw nyak lawh tinyak khyang myni jyng y duan hnguːt.</para>
  <para style="iot">Tomti Dukkuːh Dynnyak</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Acuːkkyng, Muikhaw Cim ce lawnglyktih ha huan na komlu theila Jummeitihpuːpaw ce kawng luvy phun <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 1:1-8:1">1.1—8.1</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Atha, Jummeitihpuːpaw ce phehphaei khyammei theila Jerusalem luh lyamma pungpau jok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 8:2-12:23">8.2—12.23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Yn pynnyng, Pawluh ce ynih acuːk nyak mission khuːtbi jy y zet <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 12:24-14:28">12.24—14.28</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pynnyng, jummei tha tih ha luːei khyang khuːnkawh haija kongci khyanglian ha ce Jerusalem luh a ym kommei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15.1–35</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Atha, Pawluh ce ynih hngih nyak mission khuːtbi zetnyak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15.36—18.22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">6. Yn pynnyng, yn ce ynih pathum nyak mission khuːtbi zetnyak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 18:23-20:38">18.23—20.38</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">7. Pynnyng, Pawluh ce Jerusalem luh a muan khyammei nyak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 21:1-26:32">21.1—26.32</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">8. Apyihnyak kyng, Pawluh ce Roma thyak khyammei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 27:1-28:31">27.1—28.31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk 1.1–4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ky khiat khyang Theophilus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Acuːk ky cawuk dukka ky jok hnguːt khyang tomti ha ce Jesuh na y cai hnguːt khyang la y cawk hnguːt khyang <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />huankhu lyaamma y zet bya pyn cyp, y luihngyahei hnguːt khyang ceepaw ha eyng Muikhaw Cim na hnguishin hnguːt khyang y si. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Ynih byt pynnyng, y hiyang khyang yn ha cengnga y pumhngaw y duannei voih. Yn ha cenga khuhnguːp phikip podyang theila Nuatpaw teengpe bawng y saih hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luk 24.49</ref></char></note>Yn ha dy eiou hah hnguva,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yn ha dy eiou hah hnguva; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yn ha dy y myi hnguːt hah hnguva, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yn ha dy eiou hah hnguva.</char></note> yn ha eyng yn hnguishin ha y bei hnguːt “Jerusalem kuːh zet bya kawva, ky Pawaw bei jy khyang setzaw zong ngyt, yn ce nyangmi jyng ky saih pyn khyang a si. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mar 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Jaw 1.33</ref></char></note>Jawhan na tuii jyng baptisma y bei, ynbawlakhy khuhnguːp div kawva Muikhaw Cim myng baptisma nym khyammei lawh ey,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Huankhu Lyamma Khuainyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Yn pynnyng Jesuh kika a huattyng khawmmei lutih ceepaw ha na, “Mawhpaw vo, tuh cuːn na Isreal pe ny thooh bya vy vei?” tila ym hngii.<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Jesuh na yn ha eyng, “Paw na ynih uppyng ngy khyang khuhnguːp la acuːn nyangmi na hnguat ty luː jo. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28.19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mar 16.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luk 24.47</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:48">48</ref></char></note>Ynbawlakhy phungan nym dynnei hnguva Muikhaw Cim ce nyangmi huan na lu vy. Ynpynnyng nyangmi ce Jerusalem la Judah pee tomti, Samaria pe la somdek pyihnyak cyp kei tawk saksi ja nym thawn giah ey,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Luk 24.50</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:51">51</ref></char></note>Yn y hyau pynnyng, yn ha hngoaimaw va Mawhpawaw ce huankhu va zehei y khyam lawh. Ynpynnyng yn ha mikjawm hnguva khusiat na ynih kyyn.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ynbawva Mawhpawaw huankhu lyaamma zet bya khyang ym to hnguva apoktih phaang vuvei tih hyih khyang pahngih saisikung yn ha ka a ym tungei. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />“Galilee khyang ha aw, Ibawthawnnyng mynija tung zawla nei lyaam nym to ma? Nyangmi cengkuːh huankhu va zehei khyam lawh tih yn Jesuh ce huankhu va zet bua khyang nym hnguh bawva yn tyng shyak hyang tih a y lu bya ey,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Duːn Nyng Matthia Luijei Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ynpynnyng Olive cung tinyak khyang yn cung kuːh Jah hnguːp pyng Jerusalem luh a ceepaw ha ym hlei bua. Yn cung ce Jerusalem luh eyng mile khoi byang a kauvei. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat 10.2–4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar 3.16–19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luk 6.14–16</ref></char></note>Ym phawlu hnguva, imm akhyn huanna koi awla ynija ym myi. Kunglu tih ha ce, Pitar, Jawhan, James la Andrew; Philip la Thomas; Barthomew la Matthai; Alphaeus na zawpawaw James, juːkhiat Simon la James zawpawaw Judah ha ym si. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Yn ha tomti ce Jesuh nu Marih la hngutawaw ha ce y benau ha dy huattyng duːm kawva ym hngihminnei.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Yn hnguːp pyng phawhuat sila khua myi tih jummeitih ha khawmmei awla benau duːduːm myng Pitar tung <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />theila y hyau, “Benau la Cinau tih ha aw, Jesuh muantih ha lyam duantih Judah hnguːn theila, Muikhaw Cim na David tyng y hyau hnguːt jyai khyang khutjokcaw a kuːm. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yn ce mymi dukkuːh pahuat theila mymi khutbi nawva susaihtih y si.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18,19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mat 27.3–8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>(Yn na tala tih kaw eyng y lawh khyang tyangkhaw vyng Judah na lai pahuat y hleih, ynija y luke shutung tih a y byt. Y hngynnu ark theila y kya tomti hawkei giah. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Yn khiannyng Jerusalem ma myitih khyang ha na yn sityang ym jyak. Yn khiannyng yn lai ce ym be hngaw a Akeldama ym tinyak. Yn ce “Thii punyak lai,” a si.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Psalm cawuk dukka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘Y duːn ce khyang hievnyak thawn seh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">ynija ukhy myi kaw seh,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Yn khy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Ynih duːn aciya na loovei seh,’ tila a jok hnguːt.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.21–22 a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mar 1.9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3.21</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">Luk 24.51</ref></char>
    </note>“Yn khiannyng Mawhpaw Jesuh thoo bya khyang mymi dy saksi khyam hai Judah duːn na aciya pahuat huat my hngyah lawh ey. Yn na Jesuh ce Jawhan na bei khyang baptisma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21–22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jawhan na bei khyang baptisma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ynih eyng Jawhen na Baptisma bei hnguːt.</char></note> khyammei cuːn nyng kuːhthuh mymi cengkuːh huankhu va zehei khyam cyp mymi dy bawngei tih thawn lawh ey.”<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ynkhiannyng khyang pahngih dukkuːh pahuat ym hngyah, Barsabbas tinyak khyang Josep, yn ce Justus tila ym hyau khyang la Matthia tinyak khyang pahngih ce ym tun shyak. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Yn pynnyng hngihminnei nyak ym cai, “Mawhpaw aw, khyang tomti lungbawng ny hnguat, yn khiannyng ym luihngyahei khyang pahngih dukkuːh ubyang ny hngyah tinyak khyang duan piat. <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />Judah na duːn khyamtyak pyn khiannyng, Judah myih hnguːt na duːn na ceepaw pahuat bawva khutpi hai duan piat,” ym hngihminnei. <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Yn pynnyng yn hyih tawk zungkiak eh ym hiyah hnguva Matthia huanna zungkiak eh khyang a khaw, khiannyng yn ce ceepaw kulaihuat tyng ym bawng.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Pentekuk ka Muikhaw Cim Lunyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Pentekuk hnguːp phawlu hnguva, duːn huat pyttyng jummeitih tomti ym dyynnei. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Yn hnguva cacatnawva huankhu kuːh thai ce pyibuki thai dy cyppei theila yn ha ngoah nyak imm tomti a luih. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Yn hnguva yn ha na kakei tih mei lei byang kawlu theila yn ha pahuat cuːm huanna y awmmei. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Yn hnguva yn ha tomti ce Muikhaw Cim myng kuːm awla Muikhaw na bei bawva acya be ja khyau vy ym phuːn.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Yn hnguva huankhu dyang nga myitih pe tomti kuːh Nuatpaw kyhtih Judah khyang ha ce Jerusalem luh a ym myi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Yn thai ym jyak hnguva, khyangpuː ha huattyng dyynnei awla ym muːnnyak, ibawthawnyngma tijyngcee jummeitih ha pahuat la pahuat ym be hngaw vyng khyauvei khyang ym jyak. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Yn ha tomti na ym muːnnyak: “Myn hyautih ha ce Galilee be ja khyau tih ha kaw vei? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Yn pynnyng ni ce ibaw ma, mymi tomti na pahuat cuːm na my be hngaw my jyak lawh si? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Parthia pe, Media pe la Elamit pe, Mesopotamia pe kuːh ha na khy, Judah pe la Cappadocia pe, Pontus pe la Asia pe, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Phrygia pe la Pamphulia pe, Egypt pe la Lipya kika Cyrene lyaamma khy, Rom kuːh lynglutih ha khy, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Judah ha la Judai jum nyak kyng jummei lutih ha khy, Cretan la Arap ha na khy mymi be ja Nuatpaw puhcai khyang muːnnawsetih ha yn ha cenga my jyak lawh,” ym ti. <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Muːnnaw theila ym lucing, pahuat la pahuat, “Myn ce ibaw ma?,” tila ym hngiei tong.<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Khyang ciya ha na, yn ha nuih naw awla, “Yn ha ce miksu ju ym moih,” tila ym hyau.<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar na Susaihnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Yn hnguva Pitar ce hngulawnglyktih kulaihuat dy tung theila, khyangpuː ha eyng yn nih na, “Judah khyang la Jerusalem luh a myitih tomti, nyangmi jyng ni khyaukhaw ky saih maw vy, kei na i hyau vy khyang poaija ngei byih jyt. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Myn khyang ha nyangmi uːtnyak bawva outih si joaw. Ni ce angu acuːn gu myi hngyh. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Hngawpaw Joel na susaih hnguːt khyang ha ce:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“ ‘A pyih hnguːp pyng Nuatpaw na,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">khyang tomti huanna ky Muikhaw ky hlyn nyak khy.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Nyangmi zawehngu la zawpaw ha na khy kei khyau ym saih jy;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Nyangmi compyang khyang ha na khy hnguːnn khyang ym hnguh ey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">nyangmi khyang lianzang ha na khy ym myaang nga myaang nyak ky.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ky ma ha hngutaw la putaw huanna khy si seh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">yn hnguːp pyng ky Muikhaw hlyn naw thei nga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ym hngawei giah ey.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Kei na huan na myitih huankhu va muːnnawseetih la</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">dyangnga myitih somdek huanna mikhnguh khyang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">thii, mei la meikhu ha ky duan ny.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Mawhpaw phungan hnguːp</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">phawlu hngyh ey hnguva khumik khy hung theila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">khawtha khy thii bawva thawn ny.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Yn hnguva Mawhpaw ming biat tih khyang tomti ce lilovei nyak ym lawh ey.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Isreal khyang ha aw, myn khyau ngei jyt. Nazareth luh zaw Jesuh ce khyang pahuat ta Nuatpaw na nyangmi cenga y thuːhlu khyang ce, nym hnguat bawva ynih khiannyng nyangmi dukka y cai hnguːt khyang ce muːnnawseetih la nuːtnyak khyang Nuatpaw na nyangmi jyng y duan hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat 27.35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mar 15.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luk 23.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Jaw 19.18</ref></char></note>Yn khyang ce Nuatpaw hnguːnn khyang la y hnguat jyai nyak kyng nyangmi cenga yap theila khyang see ha phui nyak kyng tala kawva tangtyng huanna kha eyng shun awla ym tuk. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mat 28.5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mar 16.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luk 24.5</ref></char></note>Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na ynih byt nyak kyng kuːh lyt shyak theila bytnyak kuːh thoo bya shyak. Bytnyak kyng kuːh ynih thoo bya vy, ibawthawnyngma tijyngcee yn ce bytnyak na ynih khawnhyan nyn ti jo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />David na ynih bawng y saih:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“ ‘Mawhpaw ce kei dy y myi hah shoi khyang ky hnguh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Ibawthawnyngma tijyngce yn ce kei khep lyaama y myi, kei na kyhkhiyan jonga.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Yn khiannyng ky lung ce jy theila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ky mong khyce jyjo nyak kyng kuːm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Ynpynnyng ce ky pum khy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">uːtnyak kyng duːm my,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />ibawthawnyngma tijyngce Mawhpaw na kei muikhaw ngalai duːn nyng dyyi hai si jo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">ny khyang cim khyce thuuhli shyak hai si jo tii.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kei jyng syak hiyan lyam hnguat nyak ny bei hnguːt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ny hngoaimaw va jyjo nyak kyng kei ny hluihhlem shyak.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Benau ha aw, nyangmi jyng kei na ky hyau nyn, mymi shyaa David ce byt theila ym khuːh hnguːt. Ynih zu ce tuhhnguːp cyp mynija myi hyam. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ynbawlakhy yn ce hngawpaw pahuat ta thawn khiannyng, Nuatpaw na ynih juːjawng dukkuːh pahuat tyng ynih nuanimm huanna y ngoa shyak ky tila setzaw vyng juannei hnguːt khyang hnguat pyn. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />David na ni ha y hnguat jyai khiannyng Messiah thoo bya khyang ngyng cyppei theila hyau khyang ce:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“ ‘Yn a thuuk tih ngalai pe duːn na dyyiutit hai si jo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">ynih pum thuuhli shyak jo nga,’ tila y hyau hnguːt.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Nuatpaw na Jesuh hiyang syak bya khiannyng mymi myitih tomti ce yn tawk saksi ja my thawn giah. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yn hnguva Nuatpaw khep lyaamma juːhshon khyam lawh tih ce, Mawhpaw cengkuːh setzaw tyak khyang Muikhaw Cim khyam lawh theila nyangmi hnguh nyn khyang la jyak lawh khyang mymi jyng Muikhaw Cim khuːh nyak pyn. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />David ce huankhu lyaamma khoi hnguːt jo, ynbawlakhy yn na hyau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Mawhpaw na ky Mawhpaw vyng:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">“Kei khep lyaamma ngoah<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Kei na nyang shunpui ha nyang khudyang nga ky tyak cyp,” y tinyak.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Yn khiannyng Isreal khyang tomti ha aw, tangtyng huanna nyangmi na tuk hnguːt khyang yn Jesuh ce Nuatpaw na Mawhpaw la Messiah duːn nyng y yap hnguːt khyang poaija hnguat byih jyt!” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Khyang ha na yn ym jyak hnguva, ym lung ngyamiang theila Pitar la cya ceepaw ha eyng ym hyau, “Beenau ha vo, ibaw my cai jy ma?” ym tii.<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Pitar na, “Nyangmi tomti pet hluːh nyak lawh haija jubaijei theila Jesuh Khrist ming ngyng baptisma lovei byih jyt. Ynbaw hnguce Muikhaw Cim tinyak khyang kuːtpuan nym lawh ey. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Yn setzaw ce nyangmi la nyangmi zawnau ha la apan nawva myitih tomti tawk a si. Mymi Nuatpaw Mawhpaw panneitih ha tomti tawk a si.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Peter na, “Yn ha huattyng pannei theila acya be ha panukung ngyng yn ha eyng sathih bei theila, cimpak theitih myn khyang juːjawng ha eyng kuːh nym pumhngaw lilovei jyt,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Yn khyaukhaw dynnei tih ha ce baptisma khyammei theila yn hnguːp pyng khyang 3,000 byang baptisma ym khyammei. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Yn ha ce ceepaw tih ha cawkhyau khyang dynnei theila lyngdyiuei khyang ha, phee pyi la hngihminnei nyak ym cai.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jummeitih ha Shyak hyang Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Ceepaw ha na muːnnawseetih la mikhnguh khyang ha ym duan khiannyng khyang tomti na ym kyh giah. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Cee 4.32–35</ref></char></note>Jummeitih ha tomti huattyng dynnei theila ym tyakkei khyang tomti ym phyaihjyattei hah. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Ym tyakkei khyang la utzaw ha jy theila ym lawh khyang a muat ha ce luːeitih ha eyng ym bei. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Hnguːp tyng biatimm ma huattyng ym kawmmei shoi. Yn ha ce ym imm ma phee pyi theila, jy nyak lung kyng ym ei hah. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Jummeitih ha na Nuatpaw khuːhbia awla khyang tomti cenga luhngoai ym lawh. Yn pynnyng Mawhpaw na lilovei nyak lawhtih ha hnguːp tyng y kawng shyak.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Pitar na Zekcuatih Pahuat Kangsa bya shyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Hnguːp huat ta, khusun cuːn pathum hngihminnei cuːn nyng Pitar la Jawhan biatimm ma y hngih zet. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Yn hnguva hngynnu duk kuːhthuh khucek tih khyang pahuat ce ym khynnlu, yn ce biatimm ma voangtih ha cenga y hngiei jy tawk, khyang ha na yn poaijei tih tijyng ym hyau khyang biatimm kyttung cenga hnguːp tyng ym tyak. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Pitar la Jawhan biatimm ma voang ngy khyang y hnguh hnguva, yn hyih jyng tyangkaw y hngiei. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Pitar la Jawhan na y hngih to sih. Pitar na, “Kei hngih to,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Yn khiannyng yn hyih cengkuːh juːhuat huat y lawh ey tijyng uːtnaw theila yn hyih y to sih. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Pitar na, “Kei cengnga hngaa, hyaan myi jo, ynbawlakhy nyang nyng ky bei jy khyang ce ni jyng ky tyakei. Yn ce Nazareth luh zaw Jesuh Khrit ming ngyng thoo tila zet,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Yn pynnyng kheplyam kut tyng ynih thooh theila y khu la khumik khy caang bya hlyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Yn hnguva yn ce tung theila y donglyam theila zet ty y phun. Yn pynnyng yn ce biatimm ma Nuatpaw khuːhbia vy tawk yn ha dy huattyng y zet. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Khyang ha na zet theila Nuatpaw khuːhbia khyang ynih ym hnguh hnguva, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />yn ce biatimm poaijei tih kytung nga ngoa theila hngiei tih khyang tinyak khyang yn ha na ym hnguat, pynnyng yn ha na ynih eyng ibaw thawn ma tinyak khyang muːnnaw awla tha ym lawhei.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar na Biatimm Ma Susaih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Yn ha na Pitar la Jawhan pyang theila myijei hnguva, khyang panu na muːnnaw awla Solomon immtyng ha tijyng ym hyau khyang duːn na zun lu awla ym dynei. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Pitar na yn hnguh hnguva, yn ha eyng y hyau, “Isreal khyang juː ha vo, Ithawnnyng nym muːnnyak ma. Ithawnnyng keimi nym to vei ma? Ni kym cai khyang kym phungan hngaw tijyng nym uːtnyakei sikawvyngcee ni khyang khyngnyak kyng kym zet shyak tila nym tawvei? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Abraham Nuatpaw, Isaac Nuatpaw, la Jakob Nuatpaw, mymi shyakai Nuatpaw na y maapaw Jesuh ce phunggan nyng y lian shyak pyn. Ynih tuk ky tijyng nym yap, pynnyngcee nyangmi na ynih muan theila hluːh ey tijyng cijang tih Pilat hngoaimaw va ynih dyn jozawaw. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat 27.15–23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mar 15.6–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luk 23.13–23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Jaw 19.12–15</ref></char></note>Nyangmi na Cim theila Puːnpok tih dynnei kawva khyang tu tih pahuat hluːh ey jyng nym bih. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Nyangmi na shyak mawhpaw nym tuk, ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na bytnyak kuːh ynih thooh bua. Keimi ce yn tawk saksi ha khyam si. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Jesuh ming ngyng y jummei khiannyng, myn khyang kaang bya khyang nym hnguh. Ni ce Jesuh ming la y jummeinyak na ynih eyng kangsanyak bei tijyng yn nyangmi tomti na nym hnguh.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Tuh a, benau tih ha aw, nyangmi khyanglian ha bawva, nym jyakcawk kaw khiannyng nym cai khyang ky hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ynbawlakhy Khrit sanglai cyhei khyam lawh ey tinyak khyang, hngawpaw ha tomti jyng Nuatpaw na hyau hnguːt khyang nibawva kuːm lu. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Yn khiannyng Nuatpaw na nyangmi pet hluːh ey tawk jubaijei theila yn cengnga lu vyt, yn hngucee Mawhpawe cengkuːh Muikhaw jungtha lu vy khiannyng, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />nyangmi tawkka tyakjyei khyang Mawhpaw Jesuh Khrit y tuːhlu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ahym ma kuːhthuh somdek huanna ynih hngawpaw cim ha eyng Nuatpaw setzaw hnguːt baw tynga, a kuːmkuːt atha hleijei jy cuːn cyp yn Mawhpaw ce huankhu va y myi jy. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mosee na khy, ‘Nyang Mawhpaw Nuatpaw na nyangmi benau duk kuːh kei baw myitih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei baw myitih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kei dy cyppeitih.</char></note> nyangmi tawk hngawpaw pahuat podyang shyak ky. Ynih hyau khyang tomti nyangmi na nym lyklyam lawh ey. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Yn hngawpaw khyau ngei tih kaw ukhy siseh Nuatpawaw khyang juː duk kuːh ark theila simpak y khyam lawh ey.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Yn khiannyng hngawpaw Samuel kuːhthuh, susaih tih hngawpaw ha na myn khuhnguːp ym saih hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Nyangmi shyakai ha dy Nuatpaw tyamthi tyak hnguːt khyang hngawpaw zawenau ha nym si. Abraham cenga y hyau hnguːt, ‘Nyang juːjawng khiannyng somdek kyng myi tih khyang ha tomti khunkhyi ym lawh ey.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nuatpaw na nyangmi pahuat cuːm saitnyak dyyi theila nyangmi khunkhyi bei jy tawk ynih maapaw podyang shyak theila yn nyangmi cenga acuːkka y tuːhlu,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pitar la Jawhan Kongci Mawva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Pitar la Jawhan khyang ha cenga susaih hnguva, biatimm zongtih lianzaw, Jahhenpaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jahhenpaw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjokcawvyng </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jahhenpaw lian, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi.</char></note> ha la Saddusee ha ce yn hyih cenga ym lu. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Ceepaw hyih na Jesuh byt nyak kuːh thoo bya khyang, khyang ha eyng y susaih khiannyng, yn ha ce ym lungtyn pah. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Yn ha na Pitar la Jawhan ym muan, yn ce muː lyaamma thawn khiannyng atha hnguːp cyp yn hyih thong dukka ym tyak. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ynbawlaakhy yn khyaukhaw jaw tih ha jummei lu awla putaw pyt thawng pahngaw byang ym pung lu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Uptih ha ce atha hnguːp pyng, Jerusalem luh a tala cawkhyautih la lianzang tih ha dy ym dynneilu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Jahhenpaw Lian Annas khy ynija y myi, ynpynnyng Caiaphas, Jawhan, Alexander la Jahhenpaw Lian immlawng ha khy ym myi. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Yn ha na Pitar la Jawhan yn ha cenga lu theiawla yn ha na, “Ibyang phungan sikawvyngcee ibyang ming ngyng myn nym cai hnguːt ma?” tila ym hngi.<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Yn hnguva Pitar ce Muikhaw Cim myng luih khiannyng yn ce, “Uptih la khyang lianzang ha eyng, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Khuzek tih khyang pahuat kaangsa shyak khyang, yn khyang ngyng ibawva khyng tih kungnga thawn ma tila, tuhhnguːp keimi hnginyak khyammei jyngcee, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Nazareth luh zaw Jesuh Khrit ming ngyng tila nyangmi tomti la Isreal khyang tomti na hnguat byih jyt. Yn Jesuh ce nyangmi na tangtyng huanna tu lakhy byt nyak kuːh Nuatpaw na thoo shyak bya khyang y si. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Jesuh ce</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“ ‘Immshaw tih ha na summei hluː kaw khyang lung ce</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">luːei duːtih luung nga thawnlu.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Yn khiannyng liloovei nyak ce u vyngkhy myi jo, yn Mawhpaw ming tua huankhu dyanga khyang zaw vyng lilovei nyak myi jo,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Pitar la Jawhan na kyh kawva thaabei khyang ym hnguh hnguva cawtuat tih hyih si jo, khyang lala jyng thawn theila, yn hyih puhcai khyang ym hnguh hnguva ym muːnnyak. Ni khyang hyih ce Jesuh bawngpui jyng tila ym hnguattei. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ynbawlakhy yn khyang kaangsa byatih ce Pitar la Jawhan dy tung hah khyang ym hnguh hnguva kuːhthuh, yn ha na ikhy hyau nyn joaw. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Yn khiannyng yn ha na yn hyih kongci kuːh syt awla pahuat la pahuat ym lutlaijei. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Myn khyang hyih ibawva my cai jy ma? tila ym hngi. Myn hyih Jerusalem ma myi tih ha eyng muːnnawseetih ha ym duan, yn ce mymi na zah nyn jo paw. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ynbawlakhy khyang ha cenga pungpau jok kaw haija, mymi na yn ming u vyng khy saih kaw haija yn hyih jyng sathih my bei lawh ey,” ym tii.<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Yn khiannyng atha yn hyih pannei awla Jesuh ming ngyng hyau vy la cawk khy kaw khyang cai lawh tilang jozaw tila ym kawkat. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ynbawlakhy Pitar la Jawhan na, “Nuatpaw khyaukhaw ngei kawva nyangmi khyaukhaw ngei khyang ce Nuatpaw hngoaimawva hngoan nei, hngoan jo vei tinyak khyang nyangmi na khuːnkhawh byih jyt. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kei hngih hnguh hnguːt la jyak hnguːt khyang kei hngih na hyau kawva myi nyn joaw nga,” y hngih tiinyak. <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Yn ha na atha sathih bei theila yn hyih ym zet shyak. Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee Khyang tomti na thawn hnguːt tih tawk Nuatpaw ym khuːhbia khiannyng, yn ha na ibawva pet bei jy khyang khuːnkawh nyn joaw. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Yn muːnnawseetih khiannyng kangsanyak lawh byatih ce y khukum phikip tua myi hngyh.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jummeitih Ha Hngihminnei Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Pitar la Jawhan ym hluː bya pynnyng ym khyang ha cenga lu bya theila, jahenpaw lian la khyanglian ha na yn hyih jyng ym hyau khyang ha ym saih bya. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Yn ym jyak hnguva, Nuatpaw cenga huattyng hngihminnei nyak thaii ym hluːh, “Mawhpaw aw,” nyang ce huankhu, somdek la panglai kuːhthuh, ynnija myih a kuːmkuːt comtih ny si. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Kym paw David maapaw mong summei tila Muikhaw Cim myng ny hyau hnguːt khyang ce,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“ ‘Ibawthawnnyng Khyang juː cya ha ym lungtyn ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">ibawthawnnyng khyang ha na igiahtihkaw ym tintaw ma?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Somdek syamphalyang ha la uptih ha huattyng thoo theila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Mawhpaw la</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Khrist ym sunnei pui nyak,’ tila y hyau hnguːt.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Luk 23.7–11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk 23.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-29">Jaw 18.28–29</ref></char>
    </note>Yn khiannyng myn luh a Herod la Pontius Pilat huattyng khawmmei theila Khyangjuː cya la Isreal khyang juː na ny hngyahei khyang la cimcaih khyang ny maapaw Jesuh huattyng dynnei awla ahngoan kawva ym sunnei puinyak hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Yn ha na nyang phungan la khuːnkawh hnguːt bawva thawnlu haija yn bawva ym cai hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Yn khiannyng Mawhpaw aw, yn ha kyhei khyang la nyang khyaukhaw hyau vom nyak ny ma ha eyng bei piatmawh. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Kaangsa ey tawk ny kut tau hnguva cimcaihtih ny maapaw Jesuh ming ngyng muːnnyak khyang ha la mikhnguh nyak ha khy duan piatmawh byih,” tila ym hngihminnei.<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ym hngihminnei pynnyng, ym khawmmei hnguːt nyak duːn ce luːluːk theila, yn ha tomti Muikhaw Cim myng kum giah theila Nuatpaw khyaukhaw kyh kawva ym susaih.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jummeitih Ha Na ym Tyakkei khyang ym Summei Hah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44-45">Cee 2.44–45</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jummeitih tomti ce lung huat la ku huattyng ym myi. Ym tyakkei khyang uːtzaw ha u na khy ym kuːhngaw tii kawva, ym tyakkei khyang tomti ym summei hah. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Mawhpaw Jesuh thoo bya khyang ceepaw ha na phungan lian nyng saksi khyammei awla Nuatpaw khunkhyi lian ha khy yn ha huanna kumlu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Yn ha dukka sanglai tih pahuat khy myi jo. Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee ym imm, loo tawvei tih ha na ym tyakkei khyang tomti jy awla ym lawh khyang tyangkaw lu theila, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ceepaw ha cenga ym tyak, ynpynnyng yn ha na luːei tih u vyng khy si seh ym phyih giah.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Yn hnguva yn ha dukka Josep mingnaw tih pahuat y myi. Yn ce ceepaw ha na Barnabas tila ym hyau. Yn ming ce, “buipem tih” zawpaw tihyau. Yn ce Levi juː pahuat y si theila Cyprus khongphai zaw khy y si. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Barnabas na y tyakkei khyang deklai jy theila y lawh khyang tyangkaw lu theila ceepaw ha kuːt tyng y yap.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananias la Saphira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ananias mingnaw tih khyang pahuat ce, ynih pihia Saphira dy uːtzaw a voang y hngih jyh. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Y pihia dy saphawthu theila jyh lawh khyang ngyng kuːh tyangkaw avoang pumhngaw tawk y cuːmmei bua, avoang jyng lu theila ceepaw ha kuːt tyng y yap. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Pitar na, “Ananias, nyang na ibawthawnnyng khawkhawng ngyng ny lungbawng bei theila, Muikhaw Cim ny hnguhyam naw tila ny dek jyh phu tyangkaw avoang ny pumhngaw tawkka ny cuːmmei jei? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Yn dek ce ny jyh kawva myi jyngcee nyang kuːh si jo vei? Yn jyh kawva ny tyak kyng khy nyang kuːh si jo vei? Yn dek ny jyh pynnyng ny lawh khyang tyangkaw ce ny luː bawva ny cai nyn kaw vei? Ynbawlakhy ny lung dukka ni khyngtih kaw ibawthawnnyng ny khindyang ma? Nyang na keimi pyt ny hnguhyam nyak si jo, Nuatpaw ny hnguhyam nyak,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananias na yn khyaukhaw y jyak hnguva, hngyng kyng theila y byt hlyi. Yn thawntih jaw tih tomti na dekkuːt hnguva ym kyh. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Yn hnguva compyang ha lu theiawla, ynih jawk suishyak kyng ym hlom theiawla, ynih kyynnei awla ym kuːhei.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Khusun pathum diiev hnguva y pihia y lu, i thawn hnguːt tinyak khyang hnguat kawva y voang lu. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Yn hnguva Pitar na, “Kei jyng hyaucam, Ananias la nyang na yn lai ni hawh eyng ny hngih jyh ei,” y tinyak hnguva,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">“Yih, ni hawh eyng jyng ky hngih jyh hnguːt,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Pitar na, “Ibawthawnnyng Mawhpaw Muikhaw hnguhyam nyak khy ny hngih cijang hnguːt ma. Nyang putaw khuːheitih ha khy kyttung cyp ym phawlu pyn, yn ha na nyang khy ym kyynnei jy,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Yn pynnyng yn khy ce y khuco va gulau theila y byt. Yn pynnyng compyang khyang ha dukka lu awla y jawk ym hnguh hnguva, kyynnei awla y putaw ka a yn ym kuːh. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Yn khiannyng jummeitihpuːpaw ha la ycya tomti na yn thawn tih kawng ym jyak hnguva dekkuːt hnguva ym kyh.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ceepaw Ha Na Khyang Panu Ym Kaangsyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Ceepaw ha na khyang ha eyng mikhnguh nyak la muːnnawseetih ym duan. Yn pynnyng jummeitih tomti ha Solomon immtyng nga huattyng ym myi dynneilu giah. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Pahuat khy yn ha dy bawngei vom joaw. Ynbawlakhy khyang ha na yn ha ym tyihvei nyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Ynbawlaakhy Mawhpaw jummeitih hngutaw la putawe panukung ha khy pung tuː la ym pung lu. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Khyang ha na nehnyaang myitih ha lyaam ka a lu awla giyam la phawhiih eyng ym hngyn. Yn ce Pitar zet hnguva aciya khyang ha huanna ynih hia na kyaknaw haija a si. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Jerusalem luh kika a myih luh ha kuːh khyang puː ha dynnei theila kaangsatih kaw ha la muikhaw see pynnei khyamtih ha lu awla, yn nehnyaang mawh tomti ce ym kaang bya.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ceepaw Ha Phehphaei Khyam Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Yn hnguva Jahhenpaw Lian la ynih bawngpui ja thawntih Saddusee bawng ha ce myangsing lung ym tyakkei. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Yn ha na ceepaw ha muan awla thawng dukka ym tyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ynbawlakhy ajuan na Mawhpaw huankhu hlizawe ha na thawng shawt hngawng awla yn ha pumtua a y zehpui nyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Yn pynnyng yn ha eyng, “Zet theila biatimm mawva tung theila khyang tomti jyng hyang nyak khyaukhaw saih byih hngih,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Khuthuai lu hnguva ym hyau hnguːt bawtyng nga, yn ha biatimm ma voang awla khyang ha eyng ym cawk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Jahhenpaw Lian la ynih bawngpoi phawlu hnguva, Isreal khyang zang ha kongci ja huattyng pan theila ceepaw ha phehimm kuːh lawei haija zongtih ha ym tuh.<verse eid="ACT 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ynbawlakhy yn ha ce phehimm ma khyanglian phaw hnguva, ynijaa yn ha hngu joaw. Yn khiannyng yn ha zet bua awla ym saihjei bya. <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />Yn hnguva, “Phehimm ce khaaei theila zongtih ha khy kyttung cenga ym tung ngei khyang kym hnguh, ynbawlakhy shawt kym hngawn hnguva a dukka keimi na pahuat khy hngu joaw nga,” ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Biatimm zongtih la jahenpaw lian ha na yn khyaukhaw ym jyak hnguva ym lucing awla ibaw thawnlu vy ma tila ym muːnnyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Yn pynnyng khyang pahuat lu theila, “To, phehimm ma ny kyak khyang, khyang hyih na biatimm ma tung theila khyang ha eyng y hngih cawkhyau,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Yn khiannyng biatimm zongtih khyang la ynih jaapuː ha na ceepaw ha ym lu. Ynbawlakhy khyang ha na yn ha lung nyng ym khong ngy kyh khiannyng yn ha na uːtyang nyng cai joaw.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ceepaw ha lu theiawla kongci mawva tung shyak awla Jahhenpaw Lian ha na ym hngii, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat 27.25</ref></char></note>“Keimi na nyangmi jyng yn ming ngyng cawk kaw haija miang miang ym hyau, nyangmi na Jerusalem luh tomti ja nym cawk. Yn khyang thii tawk keimi jyng sengei tijyng nyangmi na pet nym tyang hluː,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Pitar la ceepaw ciya ha na, “Khyang khyaukhaw thyakka Nuatpaw khyaukhaw my lyk lawh ey. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Mymi shyakai ha Nuatpaw na tangtyng huanna nyangmi tuk hnguːt khyang Jesuh y thoo bya shyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Isreal khyang ha jubaijei shyak theila yn ha pet hluːh ey tawk Nuatpaw na y lianzaw la Liloveitih a y pumhngaw khep lyaamma y juːhshon pyn. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Mymi ha ce yn bawng tawk saksi ha ym si. Yn lyklyam tih ha ce Nuatpaw bei hnguːt khyang Muikhaw Cim khycee saksi ja thawn,” ym tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Yn ym jyak hnguva, ym lungtyn theila ceepaw ha ym tukky ym luː. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ynbawlakhy Gamaliel mingnawtih Pharisee pahuat, khyang tomti na kyhkhiat khyang tala cawktih ce kongci dukka tung theila yn khyang ha eyng pumtua lyt y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Yn pynnyng yn na kongci ja, “Isreal khyang ha aw, ni khyang ha ibaw nym cai lawh ey tinyak khyang sathih tawvei byih jyt. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Acuːk hngu khy Theudas polu theila y pumhngaw na pumhngaw liantih pahuat thawn tijyng hyau theila khyang phaw pahli byang na ynih lawng ym lyk. Ynbawlakhy yn tuk khyam lawh pynnyng, y lawnglyk ha khy kajang theila ikhy myi tijo. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ynih pynnyng, khyang ming kuːm nyak kuah hnguva Galilee kuːh Judah ce polu theila y lawnglyk haija khyang ha y hlawiei. Yn khycee tuk khyammei lawh khiannyng, y lawnglyk tomti ha khy ym kajang giah. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Ynkhiannyng nyangmi jyng ky hyau hluː khyang ce, ni khyang ha ym pythngaw taw vyt, yn ha zet seh. Khyang hnguːn khyang sikawvyngcee lupcap khyang hngucee yn cimpak ce jy. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw cengkuːh hngucee, myn khyang ha nyangmi na kawkat nyn jo, nyangmi ce Nuatpaw luːlyktih bawva pyiuvoih,” y tinyak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Yn ha na ynih hyau khyang ym dynnei. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Ceepaw ha pannei awla ym shawh. Jesuh ming ngyng susaih kaw haija kawkat theila yn ha ym tuːh bya. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Yn hnguva Jesuh ming ngyng hawhei khyam tuan tih tijyng, Nuatpaw na hnguattei khiannyng jyjo theila kongci kuːh ym zet bya. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Yn pynnyng biatimm duk la imm tuː imm ma hnguːp huat khy cawkhyau khyang duːm kawva Jesuh Khrist sityang poai ym susaih.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Khyang Syyh Hngyah Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Yn hnguːp pyng hngulawnglyktih ha konglu hnguva, Griik be<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yn ce, Griik be ha la thumcian summei tih Judah ha.</char></note> hyau tih Judah ha na ym pumhngaw dukkuːh hngeinu ha hnguːp tyng eiawk phyie jyat nawva hnguhsum khyam lawh tila Hepre be hyautih Judah khyang ha eyng pettyang khyaukhaw ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Yn khiannyng hngulawnglyktih khulaihngih huattyng dyynnei awla, “Mymi na Nuatpaw khyaukhaw hngusung naw pawla khiin, khiin khyang cai tuan jo paw. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Benau la cinautih vo, nyangmi dukka kuːh thiamva nyak la Muikhaw vyng kuːmtih khyang syyh hngya byih jyt. Yn ha puhcai nyn haija keimi na yn ha eyng kym hngyam my. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Ynbawlakhy keimi na ce hngihminnei nyak la susaih khyang khuːt poaija kym cai jy,” ym tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Yn khyaukhaw khyang bawng tomti na ym jyakhluː khiannyng, yn ha na Muikhaw Cim la jummeinyak kumtih khyang Stephen nyng kuːhthuh Philip, Prokorus, Nicanor, Timon, Parmenas la Antiawk luh kuːh Judah jummeinyak kyng kuːh hlailu tih Nikolas ym hngyah. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Yn ha ce ceepaw ha hngoaimawva tung shyak awla yn ha huanna ym kut tyang theila hngihminnei nyak ym cai.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Yn khiannyng Nuatpaw cengkuːh khyaukhaw ce pau jok theila Jerusalem luh a kuːh hngulawnglyk ha puː ce ym konglu kakai. Jahenpaw ha na khy jummeinyak khyaukhaw ym dyynnei.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stephen Muan Khyammei Nyak.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Stephen khy, Nuatpaw phungan la khunkhyi jyng kum theila khyang ha eyng muːnnawseetih la mikhnguh nyak ym duan. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ynpynnyng Sinakok kuːh bawnga thawntih maa a lytlutih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Maa a lytlutih: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Judah ha maa a thawnnei tih, ynbawlakhy luvei khyang sikawvyngcee yn ha na hluːh piat khyang.</char></note> khyang Cyrene, Alexandria, Cilicia la Asia pee kuːh lutih ha thoo theila Stephen dy ym cahei thawng. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ynbawlaakhy Muikhaw na thiamva nyak Stephen nyng bei khiannyng yn ha na hyau bya nyn joaw. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Yn hnguva, “Stephen na Mosee la Nuatpaw eyng siatnyak khyaukhaw y hyau khyang kym jyak,” tila hnguhngyam hai khyang cya ha a jupzawva ym lu. <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Yn ha na khyang ha khy siseh, khyanglian ha la tala cawktih khy ym kok pynnyng Stephen ce muan awla Kongci mawva ym lu. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Yn ha na hngoantih kaw saksi shu hai khyang cya ha pan awla, “Myn khyang na cimtih duːn la tala eyng cyppei tih kaw khyaukhaw duːm kawva y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Keimi na ynih cengkuːh ym jyak lawh khyang ce Nazareth luh zaw Jesuh na ni duːn pak theila Mosee na mymi jyng bei hnguːt khyang thumcian ha hlaijei jy, tinyak khyang keimi na Stephen cengkuːh ym jyak,” ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Kongci ja myitih tomti na Stephen to sih hnguva y hngoai ce huankhu ceepaw hngoai bawva thawn khyang ym hnguh.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Stephen na Khyaukhaw Hyau Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Stephen nyng Jahhenpaw Lian na, “Nyang khyaukhaw ha ahngoan nei?” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Stephen na, “Benautih la pawetih aw, kei hyau ngei jyt. Mymi shya Abraham ce Harran luh a y myi hluana Mesopotamia pe ja y myi hnguva phunggan nyng ynih cenga Nuatpaw y duannei voih <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />theila ynih eyng, ‘Ny juːjawng la ny pe taw hnguːt tila kei na nyang ngyng duan nyak pe lyaamma zet,’ y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Yn hnguva yn na Chalte khyang ha pe taw hnguːt theila Harran luh a aduːn lovei. Y pawaw byt pynnyng Nuatpaw na yn ngyng yn duːn nyng kuːh, tuh a nym myih nyak pe ja y pawng shyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na Abraham myng ni pe ja khuleh pahuat tawk khy dek hngei tawkka bei jo. Ynbawlakhy Nuatpawe na Abraham dikzawe tyakkei hluanna yn la yn tuzaw ha cyp, ni pe ky bei jy tila setzaw y tyak hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nuatpaw na: ‘Nyang juːjawng ha ce aciya pe ja khiin na khukum 400 maa khyam theila phephaei khyam lawh ey. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na, yn ha ma khyam nyak khyang ha ky cijang ngy, yn pynnyng yn ha pe kuːh lytlu theila ni duːn nyng kei khuːhbia vy,’ y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Yn pynnyng Abraham myng vynnmonghleih khyang tyamthi y bei hnguːt. Yn khiannyng Abraham ce Isaac paw va thawnlu theila y myi pynnyng shat hnguːp hnguva yn khy vynnmong y hlaih. Yn pynnyng Isaac khy Jacop paw thawnlu theila, Jacop ce zaw khulaihngih paw va y thawnlu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Jacop zaw ha na ym nau Josep pyng myangsing thoo theila ynih ce maa pahuat bawva Egypt pe ja ym jyh. Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw ce ynih dy y puijei. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Yn sanglai cyhei tomti dukkuːh y lyt shyak. Ynpynnyng Nuatpaw na thiamva nyak bei theila Egypt pe uptih Pharo syamphalyang cenga luhngoai y lawhei shyak. Yn khiannyng Pharo na Josep pyng Egypt pe la syamphalyang imm khiam to tawh haija y yap. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Yn pynnyng Egypt pee tomti la Khanaan pe tomti ja khujua la sanglai cyhei phawlu khiannyng, mymi shyakai ha na ei jy khy lawh nyn joaw. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Egypt pe ja cyang myi khyang Jacop na y jyak hnguva, acuːk ka mymi shyaa ha y tuh. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />A hngih nyak ym zetbya tuː hnguva, Josep na y benautih ha eyng u tinyak khyang y siah, Josep immlawng ha kawng khy Pharo syamphalyang na y hnguat lu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yn khiannyng Josep na y paw Jacop la y immlawng shyhkip sila pahngawe tomti y pan. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yn hnguva Jacop ce Egypt pe zet theila, yn dy huattyng mymi shyaa ha khy ynija ym byt giah. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Yn ha jawk ce Shechem luh a lubya theila Abraham na Hamor zawetih cenga tangkaw vyng y hleih khyang Shechem luh kuːh zu va ym khuːh.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Nuatpaw na Abraham myng y setzaw kuːm my acuːn lawilu bawva Egypt pe ja kuːh khyang ha khycee ym punglu kakai. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Yn hnguva Josep hnguattih kaw syamphalyang tha pahuat ce Egypt pee y up lu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Yn na mymi khyang ha dy ym pumhngaw tawk mymi shyakai ha phehphaei awla myilu tha tih dikzaw ha byt haija ym dyyi tit. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Yn cuːn nyng Mosee myilu theila, yn ce Nuatpaw hngoaimawva poaijei tih dikzaw pahuat ta y thawn. Yn ce y immlawng na kkhaw thum ym lupan nyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Yn pynnyng yn pumtuaa ym tyak hnguva, Pharo zawhngu na ynih lo theila y zaw hngaw bawva ynih y cawhei. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Yn khiannyng Mosee ce Egypt paa kuːh thiam nyak tomti cawkkei theila hyau nyak la puhcai nyak nawva y vom.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Mosee khukum phikip hnguva, y pumhngaw benau thawntih Isreal khyang juː ha tovei jy y lung ngyng uattei. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Yn hnguva khyang pahuat ce Egpyt khyang na phehphaei khyammei khyang y hnguh hnguva, yn phephaei khyamtih lyamma puijei theila Egypt khyang tu theila y thawngei bya. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />(Mosee na y pumhngaw khiannyng Nuatpaw na ynih khyang juː ha hluːh haija summei tila y jyakcawk, ynbawlakhy yn ha na jawcu joaw.) <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Atha hnguːp pyng Mosee na Israel khyang hngyih ho khyang y hnguh. Yn hyih ho kaw haija, ‘Ky khyang ha aw, benau va nym thawn, ibawthawnnyng pahuat la pahuat nym khunnei ma?’ tinaw theila yn ha kaau vy y cai. <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ynbawlakhy immcengpui ho pui naw tih na Mosee pheng theila, ‘U na nyang ngyng kei hngih eyng uptih la cijangtih a y yap ma? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Jyanthuaa Egypt khyang ny tuk hnguːt bawva kei syak tuk ky ny khindyang ngei?’ y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Mosee na yn khyaukhaw jyak hnguva, Midian pe ja y zen. Ynnija khiin na thawn theila yn zawpaw pahngih y zaw nyak.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Khukum phikip cup pynnyng Sinai Cung cengkuːh khongkhuca a huankhu ceepaw pahuat ce Mosee cenga biapuːp meidawtih eyng y duan voih. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mosee na yn y hnguh hnguva y muːnnyak. Y lawi ja hnguh haija y zet hnguva, Mawhpaw na, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Kei ce nyang shyakaitih Nuatpaw, Abraham, Isaac, la Jacop tih Nuatpaw ky si.’ Mosee ce sawso lelet theila hngyaa diev tih a to vom jo. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Yn pynnyng Mawhpaw na ynih eyng, ‘Ny khuphawtyap sut, ny tun nyak duːn ce dek cimtih a thawn. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Egypt pe ja myitih kei khyang ha phehphaei ym khyam khyang ky hnguh. Yn ha nyaei khyang thai ky jyak khiannyng yn ha hluːh haija ky kom lu, tuh a luh, nyang Egpyt pe ja ky tuh ey,’ y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Mosee ce ‘u na nyang uptih la cijang tih a y yap ma?’ tila dyyi khyammei tih Mosee eyng Nuatpaw na biapuːp pyng duanvoih tih huankhu ceepaw na uptih la lilovei haija y tuhlu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Yn ce Egypt pe la panglai shen nyng khy si seh, khukum phikip cyp khongkhuca a khy si seh, mikhnguh nyak la muːnnyak khyang duan hnguːt theila Isareal khyang juː ha Egypt pe ja kuːh y lupui nyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Yn Mosee ce, Isreal khyang ha eyng hyau tih pahuat y si. ‘Nuatpaw na kei dy cyptih,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei dy cyptih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kei baw myitih.</char></note> sikawvyngcee kei baw myitih hngawpaw pahuat ky tuhlu vy, ynpynnyng yn ce nym pumhngaw khyang duk kuːh y si jy.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Yn ce Sinai Cung huanna ynih eyng khyau hyautih huankhu ceepaw dy khy si seh, mymi shyakai ha dy khy si seh, khongkhuca a jummeitihpuːpaw ha dy myi hnguːttih y si. Yn ce mymi jyng bei jy khyang hiyangtih khyaukhaw dynnei hnguːttih y si.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Ynbawlakhy mymi shyakai na ynih khyaukhaw lyklyam hluː joaw; yn dyyi awla Egypt pe ja jyng hlei bya vy lung ym tyakei. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Yn khiannyng yn ha na Aron nyng, ‘Mymi hngoaimawva zet hai nuatpaw ha keimi tawk cai piat. Mymi Egypt pe ja lupui naw tih Mosee ce ibaw thawn tinyak khyang keimi na hnguat jo,’ ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Yn khuhnguːp pyng yn ha na shya luːpzaw pahuat com awla, ym pumhngaw com khyang hluhbawn theila pyi ym cai. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Yn khiannyng Nuatpaw na yn ha hngusung naw theila huankhu easi, khawtha la khuhngi khuːhbia haija y bei, hngawpaw ha cawuk kyng jok hnguːt khyang ce:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“ ‘Isreal khyang ha aw, nyangmi na</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">khongkhuca a khukum phikip kei cenga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">hiyangsei la hluhbawn nyak nym lu saijei?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Nyangmi na khuːhbia vy com khyang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">luːpzaw thawn tih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Molech nuat tai ja nyangmi Rephan easi luːp nyangmi na nym luvei pyn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Yn khiannyng kei na khy nyangmi Babilon luh tua a ky shyt ty,’ tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Mymi shyakai tawk khongkhuca a saksi duan nyak tyamthi imm a myi. Yn ce Mosee na yn hnguh hnguːt khyang bawva, Nuatpaw na hyau hnguːt khyang baw tyng nga cai hnguːttih tyamthi imm a si. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Mymi shyakai ha na yn shawngtu dynnei awla mymi shyakai hngoaimawva Nuatpaw shyt khyang, khyang ciya juː ha pe kuːh yn ha na lawhei hnguva Jawshuh dy huattyng yn shawngtu ym kytlu. Yn ce David kut cyp myi hnguːttih a si. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />David ce Nuatpaw hngoaimawva luhngoai y lawhei khiannyng Jacop Nuatpaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jacop Nuatpaw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjokcaw ha eyng </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Israel khyang, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi.</char></note> myih nyak ky tawk biatimm shyak ky y hngihei hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw imm shawtih ce Solomon jyng y si.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Ibawlakhy khyang kut tyng com khyang imm ha dukka y Hluːngduː tih Nuatpaw myi jo. Hngawpaw na:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“ ‘Huankhu ce kei ngoah duːn nuanimm ma thawn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">yn pynnyng somdek ce kei khutyang nyak duːn na thawn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Nyangmi na kei tawk ibyang imm nym shyak khy nym taw ma tijyng Mawhpaw na y hau.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Kei duːm nyak ky ce hanijaa ma?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ni ha tomti kei kut tyng com hnguːt khyang si jo vei?’ tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Lukee cangtih khyang ha vo! nyangmi na ihngu khy nym hngaw vyng ngei jo, ynpynnyngcee nym lungbawng khy ce ihngu khy jubaijei nyak lawh jo. Nyangmi ce nym shyakai ha cai hnguːt bawva Muikhaw Cim a hnguːhnguːi nym siatnyak. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nyangmi shyakai ha na phehphaei kaw khyang hngawpaw y myi jei? Yn ha na puːnpoktih Nuatpaw lu vy khyang saih jyaitih ha khy nym tuk. Tuh a nyangmi na khy yn setzaw pak theila yn nym tuk. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Nyangmi ce huankhu ceepaw ha na bei hnguːt khyang tala dyynei lakhy lyklyam jozaw,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stephen Luung Ngyng Ym khong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Yn bawva ym hyau khyang kongci ha na ym jyak hnguva, ynih eyng lungtyn theila hngamsi khyammei. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ynbawlakhy Stephen ce Muikhaw Cim myng kuːm theila, huankhu lyam to hnguva Nuatpaw phunggan la Nuatpaw khep lyaamma tungtih Jesuh y hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Ynhnguva, “To vyt! Kei na huankhu hngongei theila Khyang Zawpaw ce Nuatpaw khep lyaamma tung khyang ky hnguh,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Yn hnguva yn ha ce tha eyng pang awla hngaw buːmmei theila, yn cenga tha eyng huattyng ym tymmei, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Yn pynnyng ynih luh thua lawttei awla luung ngyng ym khong. Saksi khyam tih ha na ym suishyak sut awla Sawluh mingnawtih thawizaw khyang pahuat tyng ym yappei. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Yn ha na yn luung ngyng ym khong hlu hnguva, Stephen na, “Mawhpaw Jesuh, kei muikhaw dynnei piat mawh,” tila y hngihminnei. <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Yn pynnyng y khukdya theila tha eyng, “Mawhpaw aw, yn ha cai khyang yn pet ha khindyang piat kawh byih!” tijyng pang theila y syak jom.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Yn ym tuk hnguva Sawluh khy luː nawva y pui.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Jummeitihpuːpaw Phephaei nyak la Shimphah Nyak</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Yn hnguːp pyng Jerusalem ma myitih jummeitihpuːpaw ha phephaei lian khyam khiannyng ceepaw ha thua jummeitih ha khy Judah pe la Samaria pe tomti jyng ym zen jok giah.<verse eid="ACT 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Nuatpaw kyhtih khyang ha na Stephen khuːhei awla yn tawk a hlyija ym khangei.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4">Cee 22.4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9–11</ref></char>
    </note>Ynbawlakhy Sawluh na jummeitihpuːpaw ha shimphah ey y phun. Imm tyng imm ma kha jok theila putawe la hngutaw tomti muan theila yn ha phehimm myng y tyak.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samaria Pe a Philip Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ynbawva kajang tih ha na ym phaw nyak duːn na zet jok awla sityang poai ym susaih jok. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Philip ce Samaria pe ja myitih luh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samaria pe ja myitih luh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciya kutjokcawvyng luh pahuat </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tijyng myi.</char></note> a zet theila Khrist bawng yn ha eyng y susaih. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Khyangpuː na Philip susaih khyang ym jyak hnguva, yn duan khyang mikhnguh nyak ha ym hnguh hnguva, i y hyau ma tijyng y lawija lu awla poaija ym ngei. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Yn hnguva muikhaw see puhei khyang, khyang ha dukkuːh muikhaw see panukung tha eyng pang awla ym lyt. Kutkhu byttih la khuzektih ha khy ym kaangsa bya. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Yn khiannyng yn luh a hlyija lungjy nyak myi.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Yn luh a Simon mingnawtih khyang pahuat ce mikphie summei theila Samaria pe ja myitih khyang tomti na ym muːnnyak. Y pumhngaw la pumhngaw liantih pahuat tila caam, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />theila bawi la sanglai khyang tomti na ynih poaija ngei awla, “Myn khyang ce aliantih tinyak khyang Nuatpaw cengkuːh phungan jyng a si,” ym tii. <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Yn ha na ynih ym lawnglyk ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee yn na mikphie eyng yn ha acuːn byangveih kung muːnnyak khyang duan hnguːt khiannyng a si. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ynbawlakhy Philip na susaih khyang Nuatpaw teengpe la Jesuh Khrist sityang poai ym ngei khiannyng jummei lutih putaw la hngutaw ha baptisma ym khyammei. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simon pumhngaw na khy jum theila baptisma y khyammei. Philip zeh naw tomti ja y lyk jok, mikhnguh nyak la muːnnawseetih y hngu hnguva y muːnnyak.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Jerusalem luh a myitih ceepaw ha ce Samaria pe kuːh ha na Nuatpaw khyaukhaw ym dyynei khyang jyak hnguva, Pitar la Jawhan Samaria a ym tuh. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Yn ha ym phawlu hnguva, jummei thaatih ha na Muikhaw Cim dynnei jy tawk ym hngihminnei piat. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee yn ha ce Mawhpaw Jesuh ming ngyng baptisma khyammei pyntih a ym thawn; Muikhaw Cim ce u huanna khy phawlu hngyam kaw vyng si. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Yn pynnyng Pitar la Jawhan na yn ha huanna ym kut tyang hnguva, yn ha na Muikhaw Cim ym lawhei.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Ceepaw ha kut tyang pyttyng Muikhaw ym lawhei khyang Simon na hnguh hnguva, yn ceepaw hyih jyng tyangkaw bei <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />theila, “Myn cainyak nyn khyang kei jyng khy bei zawla kut ky tyang nyak tomti na Muikhaw Cim lawhei seh awh,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Pitar na yn ngyng, “Nuatpaw na kutpuan tyangkaw vyng hleih jy ny khindyang khiannyng, ny tyangkaw ce nyang dy cimpaknyak myi seh. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ny lungbawng ce Nuatpaw hngoaimaw va hngoan kaw khiannyng nyang ce ni khuːt tyng pui lawh jo. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Yn khiannyng ny khyng kaw khyang jubaijei tila Mawhpaw cenga hngihminnei byih. Ynbaw hngucee ny lung seetih khindyang khyang ha hluːh hngu hluːh nyn nyy. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee nyang lung ce hnguːuːt bawva khaw khiannyng khyngtih kaw na kuːn khyang ky hnguh,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simon na, “Nyangmi hyau hnguːt khyang ikhy kei huanna thawn kaw haija Mawhpaw cenga kei tawk hngihminnei piatmawh hngih,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Pitar la Jawhan ce Mawhpaw khyaukhaw susaih nyak la saksi y hngih khyam pynnyng, Jerusalem luh a zet bua awla Samaria naam ha a sityang poai y hngih saih jok.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philip la Ethiopian Khyang Lian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mawhpaw huankhu ceepaw na Philip pyng y hyau, “Zet, Jerusalem ma kuːhthuh Gaza luh lyamma kom nyak tyng a pyang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a pyang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">khusun na.</char></note> lyamma kom y tinyak.” (Yn lyam ce khongkhuca lyam a si.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yn lyam ce khongkhuca lyam a si; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Myn ce khongkhuca lyam a si.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Yn khiannyng Philip thoo theila y zet. Ethiopia Syamphalyangnu Kandake khyanglian na thawn theila syamphalyangnu uːtzaw ha jung nga uptih Ethiopia pe shaw pahuat ce, khuːhbia haija Jerusalem luh a y lu. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Y imm lyaamma zet bya hnguva saagali dukka ngoa theila hngawpaw Isaiah cawuk y phuattei. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Yn hnguva Muikhaw na Philip pyng, “Yn saagali jyng lawijeitih a tymmeih,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Philip ce zet theila yn khyang na hngawpaw Isaiah cawuk phuattei khyang y jyak. Yn ngyng, “I ny phuat tinyak khyang ny jyakcawk kei,” tila y hngi.<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Yn na, “Kei jyng saihtih myi kawva ibaw ky jyakcawk ky ma?” y tinyak. Yn khiannyng Philip na y cenga pannei theila ynih ngoah pui nyak. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Yn ny phuat khyang cawlik ce:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Yn ce tuk ky zehei khyang hluzaw bawva zehei khyammei theila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">yn hluzaw ce a hngua vyihtih mawva jaadik zawva a myijei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Yn ce ynih moung khy gala jo.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Yn ce lungniammei nyak y tyakkei hnguva, ynih talatih a cijang joaw.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ynih syak ce somdek kyng syt khyam lawh khiannyng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">u na ynih juːjawng hyau nyn ny ma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Yn khyanglian na Philip pyng, “hngawpaw Isaiah na i bawng y hyau ma? Y pumhngaw bawng ngei? Yciya pahuat pahuat bawng ngei?” tila y hngi. <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Yn hnguva Philip na yn cawlik duk kuːh Jesuh sityang poai ynih eyng saih jy y phun. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Yn bawva lyam myng zeh hnguva, tuii myi nyak duːn phaw hngucee khyang lianzaw na, “Do, mynija tuii myi. Kei baptisma lovei jy kawkattih bawng i myi ma?” tila y hngi. <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" pubnumber="[37]" sid="ACT 8:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciya kutjokcawvyng a dik 37: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Philip na ynih eyng y hyau, “Ny lungbawng tomti jyng ny jummei jyngcee baptisma ny khyammei nyn.” “Ky jummei,” y hyau bua; “Kei na yn Jesuh Khrit ce Nuatpawe zaw tijyng ky jummei.” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng bawngei.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Yn hnguva yn na saagali duːm haija y hyau. Yn pynnyng yn khyanglian dy tuii dukka kom theila Philip na baptisma y bei. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Tuii jyng kuːh lyt lu bua hnguva, Philip ce Mawhpaw muikhaw na zehei theila, khyang lianzaw na ynih hngu ti jo. Ynbawlaakhy yn ce jyjo nyak kyng lyam y zet. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Philip ce, Azotus luh a lyttei theila yn luh eyng kuːhthuh Caesarea luh cyp luh tomti voang theila sityang poai y susaih.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sawluh Hlaijei Nyak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Ceepaw 22.6–16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Yn hnguva, Sawluh ce Mawhpaw hngulawnglyktih ha tuk kyy y lung thoo theila Jahhenpaw Lian cenga y zet. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Damascus luh a myitih sinakok ka shin caw ha bei theila Nuatpaw lawnglyktih putaw sikawvyngcee hngutaw ha lyam myng nym hnguh khyang tomti muan zawla Jerusalem ma kuːh phehimm myng kyak ky y shin.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Sawluh ce Damascus luh cengga y lawijei lu hnguva, ynih cenga cacatnawva huankhu kuːh a angtih daw lu. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Yn ce dek kyng hngyng kyng theila athaii pahuat ynih eyng, “Sawluh, Sawluh, kei ibawthawnnyng ny phehphaei ma?” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Ynhnguva, Sawluh na, “Mawhpaw aw, Nyang u ma?” tinyak hnguva,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">“Nyang phehphaei khyang kei Jesuh ky si. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Tuh a thoo tila luh dukka voang ngeih, pynnyng nyang i cai lawh ey khyang nyang ngyng ky hyau vy,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Sawluh dy zet hah tih khyang ha na thaii ce ym jyak tya, ynbawlakhy yn ha na u khy hngu joaw. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sawluh dek kyng kuːh thoo theila y mik dei hnguva, yn na ikhy hngu nyn ti jo. Yn khiannyng yn ha na Damascus luh lyaamma ym khut tyng hyijei awla ym zeh. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Khuhnguːp hnguːp thum y mik hung theila ikhy ei sikawvyngcee ou kawva myi jei.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Damascus luh dukka Ananias mingnawtih hngulawnglyktih pahuat y myi. Mawhpaw na ynih eyng lunghnguːn ngyng, “Ananias!” tila y pannei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">“Yih, Mawhpaw aw, kei mynija,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mawhpaw na ynih eyng, “Lyam puːntih lyam tyng zet tila Judah imm ma Tarsus luh a kuːh khyang pahuat Sawluh mingnawtih shuijei byih, yn ce hngihminnei nyak y cai jei. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Ananias mingnaw tih khyang pahuat ce lu theila mik hnguh nyn bya haija yn huanna kut tyng ngy khyang lunghnguːn nyng y hnguh pyn,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananias na khy, “Mawhpaw vo, yn khyang na Jerusalem ma kuːh nyang khyang cim ha eyng a kyng tih kaw i hawh cai hnguːt tinyak khyang, khyang panukung cenga y jyak. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Yn khiannyng nyang ming biattih ha tomti muan haija jahenpaw lian cenga uːtyang y lawh,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ynbawlakhy Mawhpaw na Ananias tyng, “Zet, Ni khyang ce Isreal khyang ha, yn ha syamphalyang ha la, khyang juː cya ha eyng kei ming ngyng susaih haija ky hngyahei khyang lawkla y si. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Kei ming tawk i hawh cyhei khyam lawh tinyak khyang kei na yn nyng ky duan ny,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Yn khiannyng Ananias ce imm ma zet theila y voang. Sawluh huanna y khut tyang theila, “Ky nau Sawluh aw, mynija ny lu hnguva lyaamma nyang cenga polu tih Mawhpaw Jesuh na nyang mik hngu bya nyak khy la Muikhaw Cim myng ny kuːm my tawk kei nyang cenga y tuhlu,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Saisikung, juːhuat byang ce Sawluh mik kyng kuːh ngawlip byang hlaijei lu theila atha y hnguh nyn bya. Yn ce thoo theila baptisma y khyammei. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Ynpynnyng eiou bya theila y tha luih lu bya.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sawluh Na Damascus luh a Y Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sawluh ce Damascus luh a hngulawnglyktih ha dy hnguːp syh y myi hah.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Mawk huat pyttyng Sawluh na Jesuh ce Nuatpaw Zawpaw y si tinyak khyang sinakok ka y susaih.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Y susaih khyang jaw tih tomti na muːnaw awla, “Ni khyang ce Jerusalem luh a yn ming biattih ha phehphaei tih si jo vei? Jahenpaw lian ha na thawng nga khaw haija zeh ey luːtih si jo vei,” ym tii.<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ynbawlakhy Sawluh ce tha lawhei theila Jesuh ce Khrist tinyak khyang Damascus ta myitih Judah ha na muːnnyak kakai.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.23–25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2 Kor 11.32–33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Khuhnguːp diev pynnyng Judah ha na yn ym tuk ky ym khiangvoi, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ynbawlakhy Sawluh na yn ha cijang khyang y hnguat. Hnguːp la juan yn ha na khy Sawluh ym tuk nyn ny tawk luh kyt ha cenga ym zong. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ynbawlakhy yn hngulawnglyktih ha na amuː a ynih lyangok dukka shan theila hngawngei tih luh vong tyng ym hawn.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawluh na Jerusalem Luh a Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Jerusalem luh a y lu hnguva, hngulawnglyktih ha dy bawngei jy y cai, ynbawlakhy yn ha tomti na ynih ym kyh giah, yn khyang hngulawnglyktih pahuat y simu tinyak khyang u na khy jum joaw. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ynbawlakhy Barnabas na ynih zeh theila ceepaw ha cenga y lu. Yn ha eyng y saih Sawluh na lyaam ma y lu hnguva Mawhpaw y hnguh hnguːt khyang, Mawhpaw na ynih eyng khyau hyau hnguːt khyang la Damascus luh a khy Jesuh ming ngyng kyh kawva y susaih hnguːt khyang y saih. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Yn hnguva Sawluh ce yn ha dy myi hah theila Jerusalem ma y luː bawva zet jok theila, Mawhpaw ming ngyng kyh kawva y susaih. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Yn ce Griik be hyautih Judah ha dy ym sumsa, ynbawlakhy yn ha na ynih tuk ky ym cijang. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Yn hnguva yn bawng jummeitih ha na ym jyak hnguva, Sawluh Caesarea luh a zeh awla Tarsus lyamma ym thuh.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Yn hnguva Judah pe, Galilee pe la Samaria pe tom myng jummeitihpuːpaw ha ce jadyam theila ym cihngia lu. Mawhpaw kyh nyak kyng shyak hyang awla, Muikhaw Cim buibem nyak kyng shyak hyang theila jummeitih ha khy ym kong lu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aeneas La Dorcas Kaangsanyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Pitar ce pe ha a y zet jok theila, Lydda luh a myitih Mawhpaw khyang cim ha cenga y zet. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ynija khukum kum shat ipnyak duːn nyng kutkhu byttih Aeneas mingnaw tih khyang pahuat y hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Pitar na, “Aeneas, Jesuh Khrist na nyang y kaangsa shyak pyn. Thoo tila ny phawhiih toom,” y tinyak hnguva Aeneas ce saisikung y thoo hlyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Lydda luh la Sharon doo va myitih tomti na Aeneas hngu awla Mawhpaw cenga ym hlaijei lu giah.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Joppa luh a Thapitha mingnawtih hngulawnglyk pahuat y myi. (Griik ming nga ce Dorkas y ming nyak. Dorkas tinyak khyang ce “sawhug” a si). Yn ce sanglaitih ha phui theila y khyngtih caitih y si. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Yn hnguːp pyng yn ce kua theila y byt, y pum ce tuii hluh awla a huan khyn na ym tyak. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lydda luh ce Joppa luh eyng lawijei; yn khiannyng Pitar ce Lydda luh a phawlu khyang jummeitih ha na ym jyak hnguva, yn cenga khyang pahngih thuh awla, “Keimi cenga y jyanga lu piatmawh,” tila ym kawhei. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Yn khiannyng Pitar ce yn ha dy y zet hah. Imm y phawlu hnguva a huan khyn na ym zehpui nyak. Hngeinu tomti ce yn ka tung awla ym gap. Yn dy huattyng ym myi khyang la Dorkas na y tawh piat khyang suishyak ha ym duan. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Pitar na a kyn dukkuːh khyang ha tomti y lyt shyak; ynpynnyng y pumhngaw ce khukdya theila hngihminnei. Pitar ce hngutaw jawk cenga tannei theila, “Tabitha, thoo,” y tinyak. Tabitha ce y mik dei hnguva Pitar ngoaei khyang y hnguh, ynih khy thoo theila y ngoa. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Pitar na y kut tyng do theila yn y thooh. Ynpynnyng jummeitih la hngeinu ha pan theila yn ha eyng syak hiyang byatih yn hngutaw y yap. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Yn sityang ce Joppa luh tomti ja pau jok giah theila, khyang panukung na Mawhpaw ym jummei lu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Pitar ce Joppa luh shaw hlawhpa caitih Simon mingnawtih cenga khuhnguːp byang veih y myijei.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Pitar la Cornelius</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Caesarea luh a Cornelius mingnaw tih khyang pahuat myi. Yn ce Italian na jaapuː phawhuat uptih Roma khyanglian pahuat y si. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Yn la yn immlawng tomti ce Nuatpaw kyh theila jumnyak kyng ciat tih khy ym si. Acya khyang ha eyng tyakei jyngcee tyakei bawva bei theila Nuatpaw cenga hngihminnei nyak cai shoi tih ym si. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Hnguːp huat hnguːp acuːn pathum hnguva Nuatpaw huankhu ceepaw pahuat ce yn cenga lu theila, “Cornelius” tijyang y hyau khyang y lunghnguːn nyng y hnguh.<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Cornelius na y kyh. “Mawhpaw vo, ni i ma?” y tinyak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Yn hnguva huankhu ceepaw na, “Nyang hngihminnei khyang la ny bei khyang kutpuan ha Nuatpaw hngoaimawva shyhei pyn. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Tuh a Joppa luh a khyang thuh tila Pitar tijyng ym hyau khyang Simon lawvei. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Yn ce hlawhpa khutbi tih Simon imm ma y myi. Yn imm ce panglai ka a myi,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Yn bawva yn ngyng hyautih huankhu ceepaw zetbua pynnyng, Cornelius na y ma pahngih la y pumhngaw cenga setzaw vyng khutbi theila Nuatpaw kyhkhiat tih jaapaw pahuat y pan. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Yn na yn ha eyng a thawn tih tomti saih theila Joppa luh a yn ha y tuh.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Hnguːp cya hnguːp pyng yn ha ce lyam zet awla luh eyng lawijei lu theila khusun na Pitar ce hngihminnei haija immtih huanna y koi. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Yn hnguva Pitar ce coijei lu theila juːhuat huat ei jy y luː, khyang ha na ei jy khyang ym cijang hnguva Pitar na lunghnguːn y hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Y hnguh khyang ce huankhu hngongei theila a giv pahli jyng somdek kyng kaw lu hiahpoai lian tih hlawnlu khyang y hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Yn duk kyng somdek kyng zetjok tih kutkhu pahli mawh hiyangsei kuːm tomti, zet jok tih hiyangsei la huankhu hngaw ming kuːm a shyp. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Yn hnguva, “Pitar vo thoo, tu tila ei,” tijyng huankhu ceepaw cengkuːh thai y jyak.<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ynbawlakhy Pitar na, “Thawn nyn jo Mawhpaw vo, kei na thahseetih sikawvyngcee cimtih kaw ihngukhy ei sai jo nga,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Pitar eyng hngih nyak hyau thai cee, “Nuatpaw na cim shyak khyang ha ce ikhy a thahsee ti kawh,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Yn bawva mawk thum hyau pynnyng, yn ce saisikung huankhu lyamma y zehei bya.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Pitar na y lunghnguːn nyng y hnguh hnguːt khyang y khindyang hnguva, ibaw ma tila y muːnnyak. Cornelius na y tuh khyang, khyang ha ce Simon imm sui awla imm kyt ta ym tungei. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Yn ha na, “Pitar tijyng ym hyau khyang Simon ce myn imm ma myi jei?” tila ym hngii.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Pitar ce y lunghnguːn khyang y khindang hnguva, Muikhaw na, “Ngeih! Nyang khyang pathum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pathum; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjok cawvyng myi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aciya; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kutjokcawvyng pahuat tijyng myi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pahngih.</char></note> na ym sui jok. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Yn khiannyng thoo theila dyanga kommeih. Kei na yn ha ky tuːhlu, shunshyang kawva yn ha dy lykkei byih,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Yn hnguva Pitar ce yn khyang ha cenga kommei theila, “Kei ce nyangmi shuijok khyang ky si. Ibawthawnnyng nym lu ma,” y hngi.<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Yn khyang ha na, “Khyang lianzaw Cornelius cengkuːh kym lu. Yn ce puːnpok theila Nuatpaw kyh tih si theila Judah pe kuːh khyang tomti na khy ym kyhkhiat khyang y si. Yn imm ma nyang pannei theila nyang na saksi jyng ny saih jy khyang khyaukhaw ha jaw haija Nuatpaw huankhu ceepaw na yn ngyng y shin hnguːt.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Yn pynnyng Pitar na yn khyang ha y khiin nyak ky tawk imm dukka y pannei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Aciya hnguːp pyng Pitar ce yn ha dy y zet hnguva, Joppa luh a kuːh aciya jummeitih ha a khy ynih dy ym lykkei. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Atha hnguːp pyng Caesarea luh a y phawlu. Cornelius cee ynih juːjawng ha eyng lawijei tih uːtshu ha huattyng pannei theila Pitar tih zong awla ym myijei. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Pitar imm duk voang hnguva, Cornelius ce yn dy kommei theila ynih hngoaimaw va khukdya theila y munnei. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ynbawlakhy Pitar na ynih thooh. “Tung, kei pumhngaw khy ce khyang jyang ky si,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Yn dy khyau theila Pitar ce imm dukka y voang, yn hnguva khyang panu dynnei khyang y hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Pitar na yn ha eyng, “Judah khyang pahuat ce ycya khyang juː ha cenga lynglu khyang ce, mymi thumcian nyng cyppei kaw khyang nyangmi na nym hnguat. Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na kei jyng y duannei pyn, yn ce kei na ukhy thahseetih sikawvyngcee cimtih kaw tijyng hyau dat jonga. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Yn khiannyng nyangmi na kei nym pannei hnguva, kei na ikhy zah kawva ky lu. Yn khiannyng ibawthawnnyng nyangmi na kei nym pannei ma tijyng ky hngi hluː,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Cornelius na, “A pyih hnguːt tih hnguːp thum myng khusun acuːn pathum myng ky imm ma kei hngihminnei theila ky myi hnguːt.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hngihminnei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">acya kutjokcaw vyng myi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jahei la hngihminnei.</char></note> Yn hnguva angtih suishyak vuei tih khyang pahuat ce kei hngoaimaw va tung <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />theila, ‘Cornelius, nyang hngihminnei khyang Nuatpaw na jyak pyn. Nyang na sanglai tih ha eyng ny bei khyang kutpuan ha khy y khindang pyn. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Yn khiannyng Joppa luh a khyang tuːh tila Pitar tijyng hyau khyang Simon lawei. Yn ce hlawhpa caitih Simon imm ma khiin pahuat y si, ynih imm ce panglai khyam ma y myi,’ y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Yn khiannyng nyng kei na nyang cenga saisikung khyang ky tuːhlu. Tuh a nyang ngyng Mawhpaw hnguishin hnguːt khyang tomti keimi jyng saih haija Nuatpaw hngoaimawva tomti kym myi pyn,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar Susaihnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Yn pynnyng Pitar na hyau vy khyang y phun, “Nuatpaw ce khyang hngoaihlei tih si kaw khyang kei na hngoan na ky jyakcawk. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ynbawlakhy khyang juː tomti ynih kyh theila a hngoan na caih tih u khy si seh, Nuatpaw cenga luhngoai ym lawhei. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Nuatpaw ce a kuːmkuːt Mawhpaw thawntih Jesuh Khrist khiannyng jadyam nyak Isreal khyang ha eyng bei khyang sityang poai nyangmi na nym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Jawhan na Baptisma bawng saih pynnyng, Galilee pe ja kuːhthuh Judah pe tomti ja athawn hnguːt tih ha nyangmi na nym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Nuatpaw na Nazareth luh zaw Jesuh eyng Muikhaw Cim la phungan ibawva hngyahei y bei hnguːt khyang nyangmi na nym hnguat. Nuatpaw ce Jesuh dy puijei khiannyng y khyngtih cai theila tusee ha bynnei khyam lawhtih ha kangsashyak bya theila aduːn tomti jaa y zet jok. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Mymi ce Judah pe la Jerusalem luh a y cai hnguːt khyang tomti tawk saksi ja my thawn giah. Yn ha na Jesuh tangtyng huanna tang awla ym tuk hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na Jesuh byt nyak kuːh khuhnguːp hnguːp thum hnguva thoo shyak bya theila y podyang shyak. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ynbawlaakhy Khyang tomti jyng y duannei hnguːt si jo. Nuatpaw pumhngaw na saksi ha thawn haija y hngyahei hnguːt khyang mymi cengnga y duannei. Jesuh byt nyak kuːh thoo bya pynnyng mymi khy ce yn Mawhpaw dy my ei ou hah. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Jesuh na y pumhngaw syak hiyang khyang la byttih ha eyng tala cijangtih a Nuatpaw na lup shyak khyang pahuat y si tinyak khyang, khyang ha eyng saksi susaih jy mymi jyang y hnguishin hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Jesuh jummeitih tomti ce yn ming ngyng pet duk kuːh hluːh khyammei lawh ey tijyng hngawpaw tomti na saksi ym khyam hnguːt,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khyangjuː Cya Na Muikhaw Cim Dynnei nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Yn khyaukhaw ha Pitar na susaih hnguva, Muikhaw Cim ce yn tala jawtih tomti huanna y komlu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Yn bawva Muikhaw Cim kutpuan ce aciya khyang juː ha na khyam lawh awla yn ym khyam lawh khyang Pitar dy Joppa luh lutih Judah khyang juː vuːnmonghleih jummeitih ha na ym muːnnyak. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee khyang juː cya ha na aciya be jyng Nuatpaw tyivei khyang khyau ym jyak hnguva ym lung jy. Yn hnguva Pitar na, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Keimi bawva Muikhaw Cim dynneitih myn khyang ha tuii jyng baptisma bei jy khyang u na kawkat nyn ny ma,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Yn khiannyng Jesuh Khrit ming ngyng baptisma khyammei jy y hyau. Yn pynnyng Pitar eyng yn ha dy khuhnguːp meihzaw myi jy ym kawhei.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Pitar Naa Jerusalem Luh Kuːh Jummeitihpuːpaw Haa Eyng Saih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Aciya khyang juː ha na khy Nuatpaw khyaukhaw ym dynnei khyang Judah pe ja myitih ceepaw ha la jummeitih ha na ym jyak. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Yn khiannyng Pitar ce Jerusalem luh lyamma y zet hnguva, ynih eyng vuːnnmonghleih khyammeitih jummeitih ha na, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Nyang ce vuːnmonghleih tih kaw khyang ha imm dukka zet tila yn ha dy ny eiou hah,” ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Yn hnguva Pitar na yn bawng tomti yn ha eyng acuːk kyng kuːhthuh saih khyang cee,<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Kei Joppa luh a hngihminnei theila ky myi hnguva, jyjo nyak myi theila lunghnguːn pahuat ky hnguh. Huankhu kuːh giv pahli jyng muan theila hiah lian bawva myitih kei myi nawva kikhiang nga a hawnlu. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Kei na dukka ky do hnguva somdek huanna kutkhu pahli mawh hiyangsei tih, a saw eitih hyangsei haa, zetjoktih hiyangsei ha la hngaw ming kuːm ky hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Yn pynnyng thaii pahuat ky jyak bua thuːh, ‘Pitar, thoo, tu tila ei,’ y tii. <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ynbawlakhy kei na, ‘Mawhpaw vo, thawn nyn jo! Kei ce butih la cimtih kaw ha ihngukhy ei jonga,’ y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Ynbawlaakhy huankhu kuːh a hngih nyak thaii ce, ‘Nuatpaw na cim shyak khyang buːtih tila hyau kaw,’ y tii. <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Yn bawva mok thum thawn pynnyng, yn ha tomti ce huankhu lyamma y zehei bua. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Yn hnguva Caesarea luh kuːh kei cenga tuhlu khyang, khyang pathum kei myih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">acya kutjokcawvyng myi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">keimi.</char></note> nyak imm ma ym phawlu pyn. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Yn pynnyng Muikhaw na kei jyng sunshyang kawva yn ha dy lykkei jy y hyau. Yn benau shawk khy ce kei dy zet hah theila, yn khyang imm ma kym voang. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Yn hnguva Cornelius na huankhu ceepaw ce yn imm dukka ibawva polu khyang, ‘Joppa luh a khyang pahuat tuh theila Pitar tinyak khyang Simon pannei byih. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Yn ce nyang la nyang immlawng lilovei khyammei jy khyang tala khyaukhaw y lu vy,’ tinyak khyang keimi jyng y hyau bya. <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Kei na khyau ky phun hnguva, Muikhaw Cim ce acuːk hnguva keimi huanna komlu bawva, yn ha huanna khy komlu. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Cee 1.5</ref></char></note>Yn pynnyng Mawhpaw na hyau hnguːt khyang ce ‘Jawhan na tuii jyng baptisma bei lakhy, nyangmi ce Muikhaw Cim myng baptisma nym khyammei jy,’ tinyak khyang khyaukhaw ky khindyang lubya. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Yn khiannyng Mawhpaw Jesuh Khrit mymi na my jum hnguva Nuatpaw na mymi jyng bei jy khyang kutpuan ce, yn ha eyng khy y bei khiannyng kei ce u tijyng Nuatpaw ky kawkat nynny ma?” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Yn bawng ha yn ha na ym jyak hnguva jadyam theila, “Ni bawva hyau hngucee, Nuatpaw na khyang juː ciya ha eyng hnguːnom syak hiyang ngy tawk jubaijei nyak y bei pyn,” tila Nuatpaw ym khuːhbia.<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antiawk Luh Kuːh Jummeitihpuːpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Cee 8.1–4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Stephen ym tuk pynnyng thawnlu tih phehphaei khiannyng kalaktih ha ce Phoenicia pee, Cyprus pe la Antiawk luh cyp phaw jok theila Judah khyang ha eyng sityang ym saih jok. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Yn ha dukkuːh aciya ha ce Cyprus phai la Cyrene luh khyangjuː ciya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyangjuː ciya; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ycya kutjokcawvyng myi </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Griik be hyautih Judah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Griik be hyautih khyang.</char></note> pui awla Antiawk luh lyaamma zet awla Griik be hyautih khyang ha eyng Mawhpaw Jesuh sityang poai bawng ym susaih. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Mawhpaw phungan ce yn ha dy myi hah khiannyng khyang panukung ce jummei lu awla Mawhpaw cenga ym hleijei lu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Jerusalem ma myitih jummeitihpuːpaw ha na yn sityang jaw theila, Antiawk ka Barnabas ym tuh. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Barnabas ce phawlu theila Nuatpaw khunkhyi y hnguh hnguva, jyjo awla yn ha tomti ciatmuat nyak lungbawng ngyng Mawhpaw ym uːmnyak kyng myi shoijy tawk thabei hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnabas ce khyang poai y si, yn cee Muikhaw Cim la jummeinyak kyng kuːmtih y si. Yn khiannyng khyang panukung ce Mawhpaw lyamma ym hleijei lu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Yn pynnyng Barnabas ce Sawluh suijei haija Tarsus lyamma zet <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />theila, yn y hnguh hnguva, Antiawk luh a y lupui nyak. Yn luh a Barnabas la Sawluh ce jummeitihpuːpaw ha dy kommei theila khyang panukung y cawkhyau. Jummeitih ha ce Antiawk luh a Khritjan tijyang cuːkka ming sui ym khyammei lawh.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Yn cuːn na aciya hngawpaw ha ce Jerusalem luh kuːh Antiawk luh a ym komlu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Cee 21.10</ref></char></note>Yn ha duk kuːh pahuat Agapus mingnawtih thoo theila, somdek tomti ja khujua khyang thawn ny tila Muikhaw duan nyak kyng y saih. (Yn ce Claudius syamphalyang up hnguva athawn.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Yn khiannyng jummeitih ha na ym tuat nyn zaw bawva, Judah pe ja myitih jummeitih ha phui nyak ym san ny ym cijang. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Jummeitih ha na Barnabas la Sawluh lawng nga jummeitihpuːpaw lianzang ha eyng kuːtpuan ym shan.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Phephaei Panu Khyamnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Yn cuːn nyng syamphalyang Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">syamphalyang Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Agrippa Pahuat, Palestine pee tomti uptih.</char></note> na aciya jummeitihpuːpaw kuːh khyang ciya ha muan theila phephaei jy y cijang. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Yn na Jawhan be James, cicom myng y tuk. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Yn ce Judah khyang ha dukka thalawhei khyang y hnguh hnguva, yn na Pitar khycee muanny y cai. Yn ce heenpui kawtih phe pyi cuːn nyng a si. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ynih muan pynnyng phehimm dukka khaw theila, to haija jaabawng pahli jyng bawng ngeitih bawng pahli cenga y yap. Pahtyak pyi cyng pynnyng Pitar cee khyang ha hngoaimawva lu theila hngica ey tawk Herod na y cijang. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Pitar ce phehimm dukka khaw hnguva, jummeitihpuːpaw cee ynih tawk Nuatpaw cenga tha eyng ym hngihminnei piat.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar Phehimm Duk kuːh Lyt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Herod na Pitar pumthua a hluːh bua hnguːp phawlu hluan na amuː a, Pitar ce jaapuː hyih kikawvyng y ip, thijooi pahngih eyng ym khawn, yn pynnyng zongtih ha khy phehimm kyt tyng ym zong. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Cacatnawva Mawhpaw huankhu ceepaw ce polu theila phehim dukka ava anglu. Y pa paa theila, “A jyanga thoo,” y tinyak. Yn hnguva thijoii ha ce Pitar kut tyng kuːh galak giah. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ynpynnyng huankhu ceepaw na, “Ny khuphawtyap la phangshau ha vuveih tinaw theila Pitar na hyau bawva y cai.” Ynpynnyng huankhu ceepaw na Pitar eyng, “Ny phang shau vuveih tila kei lawnglykluh,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Pitar ce phehimm duk kuːh lyt theila hngulawng y lykkei. Ynbawlaakhy huankhu ceepaw cai khyang ahngoan na thawnlu muː tinyak khyang, hnguat kawva lunghnguːn jyang ky hnguh lawh tila y uːtnyak. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Yn ha na pahuat nyak la pahngih nyak zongtih hngyih pahtyak pynnyng luh kyt cenga ym phawlu. Yn shawt ce yn ha tawk a luː bawva hngawng ngei theila, yn ha khy cee pumtua ym lyt. Yn ha laam pahuat tyng ym zet hnguva, cacatnawva huankhu ceepaw na ynih zehtyak.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Yn hnguva Pitar ce y pumhngaw sathih lawh theila, “Mawhpaw na y huankhu ceepaw tuhlu theila Herod kut tyng kuːh la Judah khyang ha tintaw khyang ngyng si seh kei y lyt shyak pyn tinyak khyang tuh a kei na ahngoan na ky hnguat pyn,” y tii.<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ynih na yn y hnguat la hnguat Jawhan Marka nu Marih imm ma y zet. Ynija khyang panukung dynnei awla hngihminnei nyak ym cai. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Pitar na shawt y kok hnguva, Rhoda mingnaw tih maanu pahuat ce shawt hngawng haija y lu. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Yn na Pitar thai jyak hnguva y hnguat. Yn khiannyng jyjo theila shawt hngawng kawva a dukka zon theila shawt hngoaimawva, “Pitar tungei,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Yn ha na yn nyng, “Ny ngungawk,” ym tinyak. Yn hngutaw na si tengteng tijyang y hyau, yn ha na, “Yn ce Pitar huankhu ceepaw jyang thawn ny,” ym tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ynbawlakhy Pitar na shawt y kok shoi khiannyng yn ha na shawt ym hngawn hnguva ynih ym hnguh hngucee ym muːnnyak. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Pitar na yn ha eyng lingso kawva myi haija kut duan theila Mawhpaw na yn phehimm duk kuːh ibawva lyt nyak bei tinyak khyang yn ha eyng y saih. Ynpynnyng yn na, “James la aciya benau la cinau ha eyng yn bawng hyau bua yt,” tinaw theila aciya duːn na y zehtyak.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Khuthuai hnguva Pitar ibawva thawn hnguːt khyang jaapuː ha kikawvyng ym sawsolelet giah. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herod na Pitar sui lakhy hnguh kaw hnguva, zongtih ha hngi theila byt lawh ey tijyng uːtyang y bei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Yn pynnyng Herod ce Judah pe ja kuːhthuh Caesarea pe cyp zet theila yn luh a y myijei.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herod Syamphalyang Bytnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Yn hnguva Herod Agrippa ce Tyre luh shaw ha la Sidon luh shaw ha eyng y lungtyn. Yn khiannyng yn ha ce huattyng kawhei awla Blastus mingnawtih myang khutbitih dyn theila, jadyam nyak ym bih. Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee yn ha pe ce eiawk ky tawk syamphalyang pe ym uːmnyak khiannyng a si.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Herod na y hnguːn hnguːp pyng, myang suishyak vuvei theila, y nuanimm duːn nyng ngoa theila khyang ha eyng khyau y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Khyang ha na, “Ni ce khyang thai si jo, nuatpaw pahuat thai jyng!” tila ym pang. <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Yn hnguva Herod na Nuatpaw phunggan tyihvei kaw khiannyng, Mawhpaw huankhu ceepaw na saisikung pet bei theila, yn ce kyat ei theila y byt.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw tala khyaukhaw ce pungpau jok theila jummeitih ha ym konglu.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabas la Sawluh Hngya Theila Ym Tuːh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Barnabas la Sawluh na y hngih khuːtbi khyang ha cyng pynnyng Jawhan Marka ce yn ha dy lupui naw theila, Jerusalem luh kuːh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kuːh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjokcawvyng </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">cengnga, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi.</char></note> ym lu bya.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Sirija pe Antiawk luh a jummeitihpuːpaw dukka hngawpaw ha la cawkhyautih ha ym myi. Yn ha ce Barnabas, Niger tinyak khyang Simeon, Cyrene luh zaw Lucius, Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas, Galilee uptih (to </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luk 3.1</ref></char>).</note> khypui Manaen la Sawluh a ym thawn. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Yn ha na Mawhpaw khuːhbia theila jahei hnguva, Muikhaw Cim na, “Kei yap khyang khuːt cai haija Barnabas la Sawluh hyih hngya byih jyt,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Yn hnguva jahei theila ym hngihminnei pynnyng, yn hngyih huanna kut tyang awla ym tuːh.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Acuːk Khutbi Zetnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Yn hngyih pahngih ce Muikhaw Cim na tuh khyammei lawh theila, Seleucia luh zet awla yn nyng kuːhthuh Cyprus phai lyamma ym cun. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Salamis luh cyp ym phawlu hnguva, Judah ha sinakok ha a Nuatpaw khyaukhaw ym susaih. Jawhan Marka khycee yn ha khut phui haija ym zehpui nyak.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Panglai phai tomti zetjok awla Paphos luh a ym lu cyp ym phaw hnguva, ynija Bar-Jesuh mingnawtih hngoantih kaw hngawpaw Judah mikphie summeitih pahuat ym khawmmei. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Yn cee lunguatih luh up myang Sergius Pawluh khyi y si. Yn luh up myang cee Nuatpaw khyaukhaw jyak hluː khiannyng Barnabas la Sawluh y hyauvei. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ynbawlakhy mikphie sala Elymas mingnawtih yn ce Barnabas la Sawluh luːei kaw theila yn luh up myang jummeinyak kuːh lyaam mau haija y cai. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Yn hnguva Pawluh tinyak khyang Sawluh ce Muikhaw Cim myng kuːm theila yn Elymas to sih theila, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Nyang cee hnguhngyam tih, seelup pyng kuːmtih tusee dikzawe! Puːnpoktih tomti shunpui. Nyang ce Mawhpaw lyam puːnpoktih kalek haija cai nyak kyngkuːh duːm nyn jo ti jei. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Tuh a Mawhpaw kut tyng nyang pet bei theila nyang ce acuːn pahuat div cyp ny mik hung theila khuhngi va hnguh kawva ny myi lawh ey,” y tinyak. Saisikung y mik hung theila y kut tyng lawt hai sui theila myijei.<verse eid="ACT 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Luh up myang na yn hnguh hnguva, Mawhpaw bawng cawkhyau khyang muːnnaw theila y jummei lu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antiawk Luh a Pawluh Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Yn pynnyng Pawluh la y bawngpui ha ce Paphos luh a kuːhthuh cun awla Pamphylia pe Perga luh a ym phawlu, ynija Jawhan Marka ce yn ha cengkuːh ga theila Jerusalem luh a y hleibua. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Yn ha ce Perga luh zehtaw awla Pisidian pe Antiawk luh a ym zet. Jah hnguːp pyng khuːhbia nyak sinakok ka voang theila ym ngoa. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Yn hnguva Hngawpaw ha la Tala vyng kuːh ym phuat pynnyng, sinakok kuːh khyang lianzaw ha na khyang tuːh awla, “Benau ha aw, nyangmi cenga kuːh khyang ha tawk thabei nyak khyaukhaw myi jyngcee hyau cam,” ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Yn hnguva Pawluh ce tung theila y khuːt tau:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Isreal khyang juː ha eyng kuːhthuːh Nuatpaw khuːhbia tih Khyang juː ciya ha aw, kei cenga ngei jyt! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Isreal khyang juː ha Nuatpaw ce mymi shyakai hngyahei hnguːt theila; Egypt pe jaa khiin na ym myi hnguva hluːng la niam myi kawva juːkshon theila khyang juː ciya ha y khong shyak; phunggan lian nyng yn pee kuːh yn ha y zehpui nyak. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Yn pynnyng yn ha khongkhuca a kum phikip<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">y zongu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjokcawvyng </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">y zongu piat, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi.</char></note> y zongu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Canan pe kuːh khyangjuː juː shyh simpak theila, yn ha eyng ym hngei jy y phyih. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Yn tomti ce khukum 450 div.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Yn pynnyng,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yn tomti ce khukum 450 div. “Yn pynnyng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aciya khukum 450 kum pynnyng.</char></note> Nuatpaw na cijangtih ha eyng y bei khyang ce hngawpaw Samuel acuːn cyp a si. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Yn pynnyng yn khyang ha na syamphalyang pahuat hngyh ey bih awla Nuatpaw na Benjamin juː Kish na zaw Sawluh ce syamphalyang ym lui, Sawluh na yn ha kum phikip y up. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Nuatpaw na Sawluh y pheng pynnyng David ce yn ha syamphalyang nga y thawnlu. Nuatpaw na ynih eyng cyppei nyak saksi bei theila, ‘Jesse zawe David kei na ky hnguh pyn, yn khyang ce kei lung ngyng cyppei khiannyng kei luː tomti y puhcai jy,’ y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Nuatpaw na setzaw y tyak hnguːt bawva, David juːjawng ngyng Isreal khyang ha tawk Liloveitih Jesuh pahuat y bei. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk 3.3</ref></char></note>Jesuh lu hluanna, Jawhan na Isreal khyang tomti jyng baptisma la jubaijei nyak bawng y susaih jyai. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jaw 1.20</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mar 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Jaw 1.27</ref></char></note>Jawhan na y khuːt cyng hngyhtian hnguva, ‘Nyangmi na kei u tijyang nym utnyak ma? Kei ce nyangmi sui khyang si jonga. Ynbawlakhy yn ce kei pynnyng y lu vy. Kei ce yn mawhpaw khuphaw vyng kuːh khuphawtyap jooi shut ty tuan jonga,’ y tii.<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Abraham zawnau ha la Nuatpaw kyhtih Khyang juː ciya ha aw, Nuatpaw na ni lilovei nyak sityang mymi jyng bei pyn. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Jerusalem luh a myitih ha la ym khyanglian ha na yn Jesuh khy si seh, jah hnguːp tyng ngyng ym phuat khyang hngawpaw ha khyaukhaw hnguat jawcu kaw theiawla, yn Mawhpaw pet cijang nyakkyng yn khyaukhaw ha y kuːmlu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mat 27.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13">Mar 15.13</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luk 23.21–23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Jaw 19.15</ref></char></note>Yn Mawhpaw byt khyam tuan nyak y pet hngu kaw lakhy Pilat tyng ynih tuk ky ym bih. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57–61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42–47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50–56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jaw 19.38–42</ref></char></note>Yn Mawhpaw bawng jokkei hnguːt tih tomti cai pynnyng, y jawk tangtyng huanna kuːh kom awla zuam dukka ym tyak. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na byt nyak kuːh ynih thoo shyak, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Cee 1.3</ref></char></note>theila yn mawhpaw ce Galilee pee kuːhthuh Jerusalem luh lyaamma ynih dy huattyng zettih ha eyng khuhnguːp byangveih myi hah. Tuh a yn ha ce mymi khyang ha cenga saksi jaa ym thawn. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Mymi shyakai ha eyng Nuatpaw na setzaw bei hnguːt khyang yn sityang poai nyangmi jyng ym susaih hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Nuatpaw na Jesuh thoo shyak khiannyng ym zawnau va thawntih mymi tawk yn setzaw y kuːmlu. Yn ce hngih nyak Psalm dukka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“ ‘Nyang ce kei zaw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">tuhhnguːp pa kei ce nyang paw va ky thawnlu tijyng jokkei hnguːt.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Nuatpaw na ynih byt nyak kuːh thoo shyak bya theila yn ce ihngukhy thuuhli nyak khyam shyak ti jo tinyak khyang ngyng cyppei theila, Nuatpaw naa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘David tyng Kei na cimtih la setzaw khunkhyi ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">nyangmi jyng ky bei jy,’ y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Yn khiannyng aciya psalm myng khy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Nyang cim shyak khyang pahuat nyang na thuuhli shyak hai si jo ti,’ tila shuduan hnguːt.<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Ynih pumhngaw juːjawng ngyng David na Nuatpaw luːei khyang cai hnguːt pynnyng, yn byt theila, y shyakai ha dy khuːh khyammei hnguːt theila y pum khy thuuhli hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw na byt nyak kuːh thoo shyak bya khyang, khyang pahuat cee thuuhli jo. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Yn khiannyng, ky benau tih aw, pet hluːnyak tala bawng nyangmi jyng khy si seh, Mosee tala khiannyng puːnpoktih tijyng hyau nyn kaw khyang tomti duk kyng lyt theila, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Yn Jesuh khiannyng puːnpoktih jummeitih tijyng hyau khyammei lawh khyang nyangmi na hnguat byih jyt. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Yn khiannyng hngawpaw ha na hyau hnguːt khyang ha nyangmi jyng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciya kutjokcawvyng, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nyangmi jyng, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi jo.</char></note> thawnlu kaw haija sathih taw byih jyt:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘To, Hawdawhnaw tih ha vo, muːnnaw theila cimpaknyak thawn seh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Nyangmi khuhnguːp pyng kei na juːhuat huat ky cai jy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">yn ce pahuat pahuat na nyangmi jyang hyau lakhy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">nyangmi na jum hai si jozaw,’ y tinyak.”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Pawluh la Barnabas na sinakok y hngih zehtyak hnguva, khyang ha na yn bawng ha atha Jah hnguːp pyng hyau haija yn hyih ym pannei. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Khyang puː ha sinakok kuːh ym lyt giah hnguva, Judah khyang panukung la Judah eyng kuːhthuh Nuatpaw khuːhbia tih a thawnlu tih ha na Pawluh la Barnabas hngulawng ym lykkei. Yn hyih naakhy Nuatpaw jummeinyak kyng syak hiyang ngy tha ym bei.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Atha Jah hnguːp pyng Mawhpaw khyaukhaw jaw haija luh tomti byang ym dynneilu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Judah ha na khyangpuː ym hnguh hnguva, yn ha na myangshing naw awla, Pawluh saih khyang ha kawkat theila ynih ym hawdawh nyak. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Yn hnguva Pawluh la Barnabas na kyh kawva ym hyau bua khyang cee: “Nuatpaw khyaukhaw nyangmi cenga acuːk nyak kym saih. Ynbawlakhy yn ce nyangmi na dyi zawla hnguːnom syak ce nym pumhngaw vyng tuhtuan jo tijyng cijang khiannyng, tuh a keimi na Khyang juː ciya ha lyamma kym zeh. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee Mawhpaw na mymi jyng hnguishin hnguːt khyang cee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“ ‘Khyang juː ciya tawk ava pahuat thawn haija ky cai hnguːt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">yn khiannyng nyangmi ce somdek pyih nyak cyp lilovei nyak saih haija ky hngyahei,’ tila y hyau.”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Khyang juː ciya ha na yn ym jyak hnguva, yn ha jyjo theila Mawhpaw khyaukhaw ym kyhkhiat; ynpynyng hnguːnom shyak lawh ey tijyng hngyahei khyam lawhtih tomti na khy ym jummei.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mawhpaw khyaukhaw ha ce yn pe tomti ja pungpau jok giah. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ynbawlakhy Judah khyanglian ha na Nuatpaw jummeitih hngutaw la luh uptih ha eyng Pawluh la Barnabas phehphaei haija thuːkthawn awla, ym pee kuːh ym shytlawk. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mar 6.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk 9.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10.11</ref></char></note>Yn khiannyng Pawluh la Barnabas na sathih bei bawva ym khuphaw vyng kuːh dek kawk theila Iconium luh a ym zet. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Hngulawnglyktih ha khy jy theila Muikhaw Cim myng ym kuːm.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Inconium Luh A</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Pawluh la Barnabas ce Iconium luh a y hngih susaih shoi baw tyng nga Judah sinakok dukka voang theila khiannyng Judah khyang la Griik khyang panukung ha ce jummeitih a ym thawnlu. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ynbawlakhy jummeitih kaw Judah ha na aciya khyang juː ha kok theila benautih ha huanna myangshing lung tawvei haija ym thooh. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Yn hnguva Pawluh la Barnabas ce acuːn byangveih myi awla, Mawhpaw tala khyaukhaw kyh kawva ym susaih. Mawhpaw na khy yn hyih kut tyng mikhnguh nyak la muːnawseetih ha duan shyak theila, ynih khunkhyi jyng cyptih tala khyaukhaw sitinyak khyang saksi ym duan. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ynbawlakhy luh a kuːh khyang ha cee khoijei awla; aciya ce Judah lyamma pui theila aciya ce ceepaw ha eyng ym pui.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Yn hnguva khyang juː ciya la Judah ha na yn ha khyanglian ha dy ceepaw ha phehphaei awla lung ngyng khong ngy yn ha ym cijang. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ynbawlakhy yn bawng yn ha na ym hnguat hnguva, Lycaonian pe ja myitih Lystra luh la Derbe luh eyng lawijeitih kika duːn na zenzun awla, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />yn duːn ha khy sityang poai ym susaih.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lystra Luh La Derbe Luh A Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Lystra luh a y myihngu kuːhthuh lyam zet nyn tihkaw khyang pahuat myi. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Yn na Pawluh susaih khyang y ngei. Pawluh na y do hnguva ynih na kaangsa bya hluː khyang jummeinyak y tyakkei khyang y hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Yn hnguva, “Thoo theila tung!” tila y hyau. Yn hnguva yn khyang ce dawng theila zet ty y phun. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Khyang ha na Pawluh cai khyang ym hnguh hnguva, “nuatpaw ha khyang nga shawngei theila mymi cenga kom lu pyn,” tila Lycaonian be jaa ym pang. <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Yn ha na Barnabas ce Griik nuat Zeus tila ming ym sui, Pawluh ce susaih nyak kyng liantih a thawn khiannyng Hermes tila ming ym sui. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Zeus jahenpaw biatimm ce luh tua a myi. Yn nuat jahenpaw ce khyangpuː ha dy huattyng ceepaw hyih ja thawntih Pawluh la Barnabas tyng henbawn ny ym luː khiannyng, shyashyang la papar shawm luh kyt cenga ym lu.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ynbawlakhy ceepaw Barnabas la Pawluh na yn ym jyak hnguva, y hngih suishyak shut tiak theila khyang ha puːm dukka zun theila y hngih pang. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Khyi tih ha aw, ibawthawnnyng ni byang nym cai ma? Keimi khy cee nyangmi bawva khyang kym si. Nyangmi ce a khyngtih kaw ha dyyi zawla huankhu, somdek, panglai, la yn ha dukka myitih kuːmkuːt comoatih syak hiyang tih Nuatpaw cenga lu bya ey tawk keimi ce nyangmi jyng sityang poai susaih haija kym lu. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />A pyih hnguːt tih acuːn nyng khyang juː tomti ym pumhngaw lyam zetty Nuatpaw na y hluːh. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ynbawlakhy Nuatpaw ce nyangmi jyng maannei nyak kyng huankhu kuːh khuaw shyak theila acuːn tyngngyng eiawk ky oansee ha athawn shyak. Eiawk khy ha khy panukung bei theila nyangmi lungbawng jyjo nyak kyng y kuːm shyak. Yn bawva Nuatpaw na y pumhngaw myi khyang a hnguː hnguːi saksi jyng y duan hnguːt,” tila pang awla y hngih hyau. <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Yn khyaukhaw hyau lakhy, yn pumhngaw vyng henbawn kaw haija khyang puː ha kaei tih a y hngih kawkat lawh.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Yn hnguva Judah khyang avoang ce Antiawk luh la Iconium luh kuːh ym lu. Pawluh lung ngyng khong theila y byt pyn tijyng taw awla luh tua yn ym lawt tei. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ynbawlakhy ynih kika a hngulawnglyk ha dynnei lu awla, Pawluh cee thoo theila luh dukka y zeh bya. Atha hnguːp pyng Barnabas la Pawluh ce Derbe luh kuːh y hngih zet bya.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Syria pee Kuːh Antiawk Luh A Lu bya Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Yn luh a sityang poai susaih theila hngulawnglyktih ha panukung y hngih tyak. Yn pynnyng Lystra luh, Iconium luh la Pisidia pee kuːh Antiawk luh a ym lu bua. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Yn ha na, “Mymi ce sanglaicyhei panukung khyam hyak kyng Nuatpaw teengpee ja ym voang lawh ey,” tila hyau theila, yn luh a myitih hngulawnglyktih ha lungbawng cang shyak theila jummeinyak ahngoan nyng myi shoi haiawva yn ha eyng thabei khyang y hngih hyau hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Pawluh la Barnabas na jummeitihpuːpaw pahuat cuːm myng kuːh lianzang tih ha hngyah theila ym yap. Yn pynnyng jahei theila hngihminnei nyak kyng yn ha uːmmei khyang Mawhpaw cenga ym yap.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ynpynnyng Pisidia pee lyamma zet theila Pamphylia pee jaa y hngih lu. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Perga luh a khyaukhaw susaih pynnyng Attalia luh lyamma y hngih zet. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Yn Attalia luh eyng kuːhthuh lawng ngyng cun theila, Antiawk luh lyamma y hngih zet bua. Yn luh ce tuːh a cyng hnguːt tih Nuatpaw khunkhyi jyng yap hnguːt tih luh a si.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ynija y hngih phawe hnguva, jummeitihpuːpaw huattyng dynnei theila yn ha khiannyng, Nuatpaw cai hnguːt khyang ha tomti khy si seh, aciya khyang juː ha na jummei lu haija Nuatpaw na shawt hngawn khyang khy si seh ym susaih. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Ynpynnyng yn luh a hngulawnglyktih ha dy byangveih kung y hngih myi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Ma Kommei Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Judah pee kuːh Antiawk lyamma lu tih khyang ciya ha na jummeitih khyang ha eyng: “Nyangmi ce Mosee Thumcian nyng cawk bawva, vuːnnmonghleih khyamtih kaw ce lilovei nyak lawh jo,” tila ym cawk. <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Yn khiannyng Pawluh la Barnabas cee yn ha dy tha eyng ym cahei thong. Yn hnguva aciya jummeitih ha na ym cahei thong khyang sumsa haija Pawluh la Barnabas tyng yn ha dukkuːh khyang cya ha dy Jerusalem luh a myi tih ceepaw la khyanglian ha cenga zet haija ym cijang.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Jummeitihpuːpaw na yn ha luh tua cyp ym thyaakkei pynnyng, Phoenicia pee la Samaria pee lyamma ym zet hnguva, khyang juː cya ha ibawva ym jummei lu tinyak khyang ym saih. Yn sityang ce jummeitih ha tomti ym jyak hnguva a hlyi jaa jyjo shyak. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Yn ha Jerusalem ma ym lu hnguva, yn ha na jummeitihpuːpaw, ceepaw ha la khyanglian ha ym dovei. Yn ha na ym pumhngaw eyng Nuatpaw na cai hnguːt khyang tomti ym saihjei. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ynbawlakhy Pharisee bawng jummeitih ha aciya cee thoo theila, “Khyang juː cya ha khy Mosee tala lyklyam theila vuːnmonghleih ym khyammei lawh ey,” ym tii.<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Yn hnguva ceepaw ha la khyanglian ha kommei theila yn bawng sumsa ey ym dynnei. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Cee 10.1–43</ref></char></note>Yn sumsa pynnyng, Pitar cee thoo theila, “Benau tih aw, Kei mong ngyng sityang poai khyaukhaw khyang ciya ha na jaw theila jum nynny tawk Nuatpaw na acuːk kyng nyangmi duk kuːh kei y hngyahei hnguːt khyang nyangmi na ym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">Cee 10.44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:4">Cee 2.4</ref></char></note>Khyang lungbawng hnguat tih Nuatpaw ce Muikhaw Cim mymi jyng saksi jyng bei hnguːt bawva, yn ha eyng bei theila yn ha Nuatpaw na dynnei hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Mymi la yn ha kikawvyng jummeinyak kyng lungbawng cimcyang shyak theila yn ha khoihkha hnguːt jo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Yn khiannyng tuh a, nyangmi cee mymi shyakai ha la mymi pumhngaw na my kyyt nyn kaw khyang vuhjyh ha jummeitih khyang juː ciya ha hngya huanna tyang theila ibawthawnnyng Nuatpaw nym cyam ma? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ynbawlaakhy mymi khycee yn ha bawva, Mawhpaw Jesuh khunkhyi khiannyng lilovei khyam lawh tijyng my jummei,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Yn hnguva Barnabas la Pawluh ce mymi khiannyng Khyang juː ciya dukka Nuatpaw cai khyang mikhnguh nyak la muːnnawseetih ha bawng yn ha eyng saih hnguva, khyang tomti ce ikhy ti kawva ym ngei. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ym saih cyng hnguva, James na, “Benau tih vo, kei khyau khyang ngei jyt. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Nuatpaw na y pumhngaw ming ngy tawk Khyang juː ciya duk kuːh khyang ha hngyah ey tawkka yn ha cenga acuːk hnguva kuːhthuh y do tawh lu hnguːt khyang, Simon na saih hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Hngawpaw ha khyaukhaw cee ceepaw ha susaih khyang dy a cyppei, yn ce jokkei hnguːt bawva:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“ ‘Yn ha cyng ngyng cee kei ky lu bua ey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">ynpynnyng cimpak tih David pee la imm khy ky thooh bya ey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">kei na cimpak khyam lawh tih yn pee khy thoo bya theila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">yn khy cee ky cihngia shyak bya ey,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />yn bawva gian tih ha dy kei ming ngyng pannei khyam lawh tih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">Khyang juː ciya cee Mawhpaw ym sui jy,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Yn ha bawng pyam ma kuːhthuh hnguat tih Mawhpaw na y hyau hnguːt,’ y tii.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Ni ce hnguːn khyang, Nuatpaw cenga hleilu bua tih Khyang juː cya ha tawk kaei tih mymi na cijang lawh jo. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Tala eyng cyppeitih kaw luːpzaw vyng bei khyang eiawk haa, byiunyak, hngyaa ik theila tuk khyang hiyangsei ssaw ei khyang la thii ei khyang ha tuan tila caw shan tuan tijyng ky taw. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee acuːk hngu kuːhthuh luh tyng ngyng Mosee tala susaih khyang myi khiannyng Judah ha sinakok ha a Jah hnguːp tyng ngyng ym phuat,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jummeitih Khyangjuː Ciya ha Eyng Caw Shannyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Yn pynnyng ceepaw haa, khyanglian ha dy jummeitihpuːpaw tomti cee yn ha dukkuːh y cya khyang ha hngya awla Pawluh la Barnabas dy Antiawk luh a thuːh ey ym cijang. Yn ha na jummeitih dukkuːh khyang lian na thawntih khyang Barsabbas tinyak khyang Judah la Silas hyih ym hngyah. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Yn ha dy ym shan khyang caw vyng cee:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Nym benau va thawn tih, ceepaw ha la khyang lianzang ha ce Antiawk luh, Syria luh la Cilicia pee jaa myi tih jummeitih ha eyng kym khin tijyng caw kym shan lu ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Keimi cenga kuːh zettih ha ce keimi na yn bawva cai byih tinaw kawva nyangmi jyng khyaukhaw vyng sawso naw shyak theila nyangmi lung sanglai khyang kym jyak lawh. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Yn khiannyng keimi tomti na acya khyang ha hngya theila keimi khiat khyang Pawluh la Barnabas dy huattyng nyangmi cenga thuːhlu haija lung cyppei nyak kyng ym cijang. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Yn hyih syak hiyang khyang ce mymi Mawhpaw Jesuh Khrist ming tawk syak hiyang tih ha ym thawn. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Yn khiannyng keimi i kym jok tinyak khyang khyaukhaw ha a si tijyng hyau haija Judah la Silas keimi na kym thuːh. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Yn ce Muikhaw Cim dy mymi ce adyang nga kuːh pui tih tua acya jyhju tih ha nyangmi huanna tyang kaw khyang kyng ngy tijyng shawphaw ym tu. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Nyangmi cee luːpzaw ha eyng ym hluhbon khyang eiawk, a thii ei khyang, hngya hak theila tuk khyang hyangsei ssaw ei khyang la tala eyng cyppei tih kaw byiunyak khyang ha cai lawh jo. Nyangmi ce yn ha tomti jyng nym cimcyang ngyng ce a khyng. Kaangsa byih jyt,” tila jokkei hnguːt.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Yn khiannyng yn ha ym tuːh hnguva, yn ha cee Antiawk luh lyamma zet awla jummeitih ha dynnei shyak theila caw ym bei. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Khyang ha na yn phuat theiawla yn thabei khyaukhaw vyng ahlyi ja lungjy nyak kyng ym kuːm. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Hngawpaw a thawntih Judah la Silas na jummeitih ha eyng thabei khyaukhaw hyau panu hyau awla ym cihngia shyak. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Yn hyih cee acuːn meihzaw myi pynnyng, jummeitih ha na tuhlu tih ha cenga jadyam tih a ym tuːh bya. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" pubnumber="[34]" sid="ACT 15:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciya kutjokcawvyng a dik 34: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ynbawlakhy Silas ynija myi hyammy tijyng hnguːnnei, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng bawngei.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh la Barnabas cee Antiawk luh a myi hnguːt thei hngih la, khyang aciya ha panukung ngyng Mawhpaw sityang poai susaih awla ym cawk.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh la Barnabas Ganyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Khuhnguːp div hnguva Pawluh na Barnabas tyng, “Mawhpaw khyaukhaw my hngih susaih hnguːt nyak sai luh ha myitih jummeitih ha cenga zet theila lyngei pawla ibawva ym myicuh tinyak khyang tovei pii,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Yn hnguva Marka tijyang ym hyau khyang Jawhan ce Barnabas na zehpui nyak khy y luː. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Cee 13.13</ref></char></note>Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na yn zehpui nyak khy khindang hnguːt jo, ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee Pamphylia pee ja kuːhthuh yn ha cengkuːh hlei bya theila khuːtbi nyak nawva lyk tih kaw pan tuan jo y tii. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Yn bawva khongkauvei khyang myi lu khiannyng, yn ha cee ym galak. Barnabas na Marka zehpui naw theila Cyprus khong phai lyamma y thuːh. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na Silas hngya theila y zet, jummeitih ha na Mawhpaw khunkhyi dukka yap khyammei theila ym zet. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Pawluh cee Syria pee la Cilicia pee tyng zet theila jummeitihpuːpaw ha y ciatmuat shyak.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Pawluh La Silas dy Timawte Bawngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pawluh ce Derbe luh la Lystra luh a y phawlu, ynija Timawte tinyak khyang hngulawnglyktih pahuat y myi. Y nu ce jummeitih Judah hngutawe a thawn theila y pawe cee Grik y si. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Lystra luh la Iconium luh a myitih jummeitih benau ha na tyihvei khyang y si. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pawluh na Timawte ynih lawng lyklu vy y luː, yn khiannyng ynih eyng vuːnmonghleih nyak khyang y cai piat. Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee yn pee ja myitih Judah khyang ha na y paw ce Griik khyang juː thawn tinyak khyang ym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ynpynnyng yn hyih cee luh pahuat pynnyng pahuat ym zet hnguva, Jerusalem ma myitih khyangpuː lianzang la ceepaw ha na suioat khyang khyaukhaw ha jummeitih ha na lyklyam haija ym shin hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ynbaw khiannyng khyangpuː ha cee jummeitihpuːpaw ha ce jummei nyak kyng ciatmuan nei theila hnguːp hnguii khyang ym khonglu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Macedonia Pee Kuːh Panthaii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pawluh la y bawngbuai ha Phrygia pee la Galatia pee ja ym zetjok hnguva Muikhaw Cim na yn ha Asia pee ja khyaukhaw susaih kaw haija y kawkat. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Yn ha cee Mysia pe ja ym phawlu hnguva, Bithynia pe voang ngy ym cai, ynbawlakhy Jesuh Muikhaw na voang shyak hluː jo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Yn khiannyng Mysia pee zehtaw awla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zehtaw awla; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">zehtyak.</char></note> Troas luh a ym zet. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Pawluh cee a muː ip hnguva y myaang pahuat y hnguh. Yn y myaang cee Macedonia pee kuːh khyang pahuat na tung theila, “Macedonia pee ja lu theila keimi phui piat mawh vyt,” tila y khawhei. <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Yn lunghnguːn hnguh pynnyng, yn pee ja kuːh sityang poai saih haija keimi Nuatpaw na y hngyah pyn, jummei theila Macedonia pee ja zet ty y cai hlyi.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Philipi Luh Shaw Lydia Hleijei Lunyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Keimi ce Troas luh kuːh panglai jyang tuisyamphua eyng Samothrace khongpyyi lyamma tingting zet hnguva, atha hnguːp pyng Neapolis luh a kym phawlu. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ynijaa kuːhthuh Philipi luh a kym phawlu. Yn luh cee Macedonia; pee kuːh luːei tih acuːk luh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yn luh cee Macedonia; pee kuːh luːei tih acuːk luh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjokcawvyng, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Macedonia pee kuːh luh pahuat, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi; sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Macedonia pee kuːh acuːk luh pahuat.</char></note> pahuat ta thawn theila Roma luh dyang nga kuːh luh a khy athawn. Keimi cee yn luh a khuhnguːp div va kym myi. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Jah hnguːp pyng keimi luh kyt tua lyt theila, hngihminnei nyak ky a duːn myih nyak nyn lyangkhyam ma kym zet. Yn pynnyng keimi cee ngoa theila yn duːn nyng dynneitih hngutaw ha eyng khyau hyau vy kym phun. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Thyatira luh kuːh Lydia mingnawtih hngutaw pahuat ce oale suishyak jy tih y si. Yn ce Nuatpaw khuːhbia tih pahuat y si. Pawluh na susaih hnguva poaija ngei haija Mawhpaw na y lungbawng hngawn piat. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Yn la y immlawng ha tomti cee baptisma khyammei awla, Lydia na, “Kei cee Mawhpaw ahngoan na jummeitih tijyang nym taw hngucee kei imm ma lu theila ipawm lu vyt,” tila keimi y hlawihlaing ngei lu.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh La Silas Phehimm Dukka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Hnguːp ciya eyng keimi cee hngihminnei nyak duːn na kym zet hnguva, muikhaw see voang theila hlungtinnu maanu pahuat kym hnguh. Yn ce hlungtin theila y mawhpaw ha tawk tangkaw panu y suilei piat. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Yn na Pawluh la keimi hngulawng lyk theila, “Myn khyang ha cee y hluːngduː tih Nuatpaw khuːtbi tih a ym thawn, nyangmi jyang lilovei nyak lyam susaih haija ym phawlu pyn,” tila y vuipang. <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Khuhnguːp div va yn bawva vuipang la y myijei khiannyng Pawluh cee a hlyija y lung sanglai jei. Yn khiannyng hngulyaam myangei theila, “Yn duk kuːh lyt buah, Jesuh Khrit ming ngyng nyang ky shyt,” tinyak hnguva muikhaw see cee yn duk kuːh y lyt bya. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ynbawlakhy y mawhpaw ha na ym pumhngaw tangkaw lawh nyak khy hnga ym hnguh tii kawvyng, Pawluh la Silas cee muan theila uptih myih nyak tukjyh nawva ym zehpui nyak. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Yn ha yang mawh ha cenga yn khyang hyih ym zeh hnguva, yn ha naa, “Myn hyih cee Judah khyang juː ha a thawn theila, mymi luh ym lingso hluː shyak. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Roma luh shaw khyang ha na mymi dynnei tuan kaw khyang thumcian ha bawva cai jy ym cawkhyau,” ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Khyangpuː ha khy Pawluh la Silas tyng ym bungiang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Yn hnguva luh uptih ha na Pawluh la Silas suishyak shut awla shawhciau vy ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Pawluh la Silas tyng tyangkyih tih a shawhciau awla yn ha phehimm dukka khaw theila poaija khawnhyan haija thawngpyng tih eyng yang ym bei. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Yn yang y lawh hnguva, yn hyih phehimm khyn dukka hnguan theila yn hyih khu ha tiangbyng ngyng y khawnhyan.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Khujuan duːduːm myng Pawluh la Silas cee Nuatpaw cengnga hngihminnei theila y hngih bawibiau vei. Aciya phehimm kyakpui ha na khy ym ngei. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Cacatnawva liv lu theila phehimm tomti hluːnnei theila, yn hnguva byangveizaw vyng phehimm shawt hngawngei lu, yn pynnyng phehimm kyak khyammei tih ha ym khawnhyan nyak thijooi ha sat giah. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Thawngmawh cee letlu theila thawng shawt ha hngawngei khyang y hnguh hnguva, thawngshaw ha zeen pyn tila y uːtnyak hnguva y pumhngaw tuvei jy y cimpai y jukkei. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na, “Ny pumhngaw seesawnaw kawh! Keimi tomti mynija kym myi giah,” tila tha eyng y pang.<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Phehimm mawh na meei imm pannei theila y jyanga y voangei Yn pynnyng Pawluh la Silas hngoaimaw va sawsolelet nuva y munnei voih. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Yn ha pumtua y hluːh pynnyng, “Cawkhyautih vo, lilovei nyak lawh ey tawkka, kei na i ky cai lawh ey ma?” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Pawluh la Silas na, “Mawhpaw Jesuh jyang jum byih, nyang la ny immlawng tomti lilovei nyak nym lawh ey,” y hngih tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ynpynnyng yn immlawng ha tomti jyng Mawhpaw khyaukhaw ym susaih. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Yn juan tyng ngyng phehimm mawh na yn ha pannei theila ym nehngaw ha y patpiat. Ynbawva cai piat pynnyng, yn la ynih immlawng ha tomti saisikung baptisma ym khyammei giah. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Phehimm mawh ce Pawluh la Silas y imm ma pannei theila eiawk ha puhcai theila y khiin nyak, yn dy huattyng immlawng tomti cee Nuatpaw ym jummei khiannyng a hlyija ym jyjo.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Khuthuai lu hnguva, luh uptih ha ce phehimm mawh cenga khyanglian ha tuːh theila, “Yn hngyih pahngih hluːh bua yt,” tila y shin.<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Yn hnguva thawng mawh na yn sityang Pawluh eyng hyau theila, “luh uptih ha na nyang la Silas hluːh piat bya ey y shin lu. Yn khiannyng tuh a jadyam zawva ny hngih zet bua nyn,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na khyanglian ha eyng, “Yn ha ce Roma pee shaw ha thawn tih keimi ha hngica kawva khyang puː ha hngoaimaw va shawtciau khawnhyan theila ym tyak hnguːt. Tuh a yn ha na keimi jyang amuːjuppa ym hluːh ey ei? Yn bawva cai tuan joaw! Ym pumhngaw lu theila kei hngih phehimm duk kuːh hluːh lu seh,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Khyanglian ha na khy, yn khyaukhaw khyanglian ha cenga susaih theila Pawluh la Silas cee Roma pee shaw y hngih si khyang ym hnguat hnguva, yn ha na ym kyh. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Yn khiannyng yn ha cee ym pumhngaw phehimm dukka lu theila khawhei pynnyng, yn hyih pumtua lyt shyak awla luh kuːh zet bya ey ym khawhei. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Pawluh la Silas phehimm duk kuːh lyt lu pynnyng, Lydia imm ma y hngih zet. Ynija jummeitih ha khawmmei theila thabei nyak khyaukhaw hyau theila yn luh kuːh y hngih zet bya.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Thessalonica Luh A Susaihnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pawluh la Silas ce Amphipolis luh la Apollonia luh zehtaw awla, Thessalonica luh a ym phawlu. Yn luh a Judah ha sinakok khy a myi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pawluh ce sinakok dukka voang theila y thumcian bawva cai theila Jahhnguːp hnguːp thum cyp talagamcaw umnaw theila yn ha dy y sumsa. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Messiah phehphaei khyam theila byt nyak kuːh thoo bya lawh ey tinyak khyang saksi ha dy susaih theila, “Nyangmi jyang kei susaih khyang Jesuh ce Messiah y thawn,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Aciya Judah ha ce jum awla Pawluh la Silas dy ym bawngei. Nuatpaw jummeitih Grik khyang juː ha la ming liantih hngutaw ha na khy ym jummei lu.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ynbawlakhy Judah khyang juː ycya ha ce myangshing awla, tukjyh nyak duːn na kuːh seetih ha dyn theila luh dukka ym lingso shyak. Jason imm khy von thawn awla Pawluh la Silas khyang puː ha cenga lu haija ym suijok. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ynbawlakhy yn ha na yn hyih ym hnguh kaw khiannyng Jason la ycya jummeitih ha imm duk kuːh lawthlei giah awla, luh a kuːh khyang lianzaw ha hngoaimaw va lu theila, “Myn somdek khuptua shyak tih ha tuh a myn luh a ym phawlu, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Jason na khy yn ha y imm dukka y dovei. Yn ha ce Jesuh tinyak khyang ycya syamphalyang pahuat myi tila hyau theila, Caesar samphalyang awng eyng khyaukhaw dyn joaw,” tila ym paang. <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Yn ym jyak hnguva, khyang puː la khyang lianzaw ha ce ym lungbawng awtlat nuva ym myijei. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Yn pynnyng Jason la yciya ha khyaammei khawh tangkaw bei shyak pynnyng ym tuːh bya.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Berea Luh A Pawluh la Silas Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Yn muː tyng ngyng jummeitih ha ce Pawluh la Silas Berea luh a ajyanga ym tuːh bya. Yn luh y hngih phaw hnguva, yn hyih ce Judah ha sinakok ka y hngih zet. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Berea luh shaw ha ce Thessalonia luh shaw ha thyaakka ym lungbawng poai jyng kuːmcei. Ikhiannyngma tijyngcee yn ha ce ciciat nyak kyng khyaukhaw dynnei theiawla Pawluh na saih khyang ahngoan, hngoan kaw ym hnguat ty tawk talagamcaw khuhnguːp shuːp phuat awla ym hngi. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Yn khiannyng Judah khyang juː panu ha ce jummei nyak ym tyakkei lu. Yn hnguva Greek hngutaw la putaw ha na khy jummei nyak ym tyakkei lu. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ynbawlakhy Berea luh a Pawluh ce Nuatpaw khyaukhaw susaih khyang Thessalonica luh kuːh Judah khyang ha na ym jyak hnguva, yn luh a lyklu theiawla khyang puː ha lingso haija yn ha na ym thukthawn. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Yn hnguva jummeitih ha na Pawluh cee panglai khyamma ym thyaakei hlyi. Ynbawlakhy Silas la Timawte ce yn luh a ym myi hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Pawluh thyaakei tih ha ce Athen luh cyp thyaakei theiawla Silas la Timawte hyih jyang ajyanga tymlu hai hngih a shin hnguːt khyang khyaukhaw lawh theila Berea luh cyp y hngih zet bya.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Athen Luh A Pawluh Na Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pawluh ce Athen luh a Silas la Timawte zong hnguva, yn luh ce a luːpzaw ha eyng luih khyang hnguh theila y lung sanglai. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Yn khiannyng yn ce sinakok dukka myitih Judah khyang juː ha eyng kuːhthuːh Nuatpaw khuːhbia tih Griik khyang juː ha dy ym cijang. Yn pynnyng tukjyh nyak duːn na myitih khyang ha dy hnguːp hnguːi ym sumsa. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Ephicurean bawng ha la Stoic thiamvatih ciya ha khycee ynih dy huattyng sumsa khyaukhaw ym cahei thong.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Aciya ha na, “Myn khyau cypkyapei cee ibyang hyau hluː maa? tila ym hyau. Aciya ha naakhy, yn na ce pee ciya nuat ha bawng y hyau, tila ym hyau. Yn ha na ni bawva ym hyau khyang cee Pawluh na Jesuh bawng la byt nyakkuːh thoo bya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Jesuh bawng la byt nyakkuːh thoo bya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Griik be ja cee, hngutaw nu “thoo bya khyang ce” nuat nu pahuat ming thonny tila ym jyakcawk.</char></note> khyang sityang poai susaih khiannyng a thawn,” tila ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Yn pynnyng yn ha na Pawluh cee Areopaggus junga zehpui naw theila yn ha na, “Nyang cawkhyau khyang atha tih ha keimi na hnguat ty kym luː. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Yn ha ce keimi tawkka atha tih a thawn khiannyng ibyang hyau hluː ma tinyak khyang jyak ky kym luː,” tila ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Yn hnguva Athen luh shaw ha la yn luh a myitih khyang cya shaw khiin ha tomti ce atha tih sityang poai ngeisyam khiannyng ikhy cai kawva acuːn ym summei.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Yn khiannyng Pawluh ce Areopagus junga tung theila, “Athen luh shaw ha aw, nyangmi cee jummei nyak kyng ahlyi ja nym lungeijei khyang kei na ky hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ikhiannyngma tijyngcee kei ce luh ka a ky zet hnguva nyangmi khuːhbia khyang nuat ha poai poai ky to hnguva, ‘y ming hnguat kaw khyang Nuatpaw tawk,’ tila jokkei tih nuat pyhimm pahuat ky hnguh lawh. Yn bawva nyangmi na nym hnguh hnguat kawva nym khuːhbia khyang yn nuat ha bawng tuh a kei na ky susaih. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.24–25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:48">Cee 7.48</ref></char></note>Nuatpaw na somdek la somdek huanna myitih tomti comoa theila huankhu la somdek Mawhpaw va y thawn khiannyng, khyang kut tyng shyak khyang biatimm ha eyng myi jo. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Yn bawva Nuatpaw ce ibyang khy y luːei kaw khiannyng, khyang kut tyng cawhcan khycee dynnei tih si jo. Yn Mawhpaw ce khyang tomti jyng syak hiyannyak la hianyak tomti khy bei nyn tih Nuatpaw y si. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Nuatpaw na khyang pahuat comoa theila yn khyang ngyng kuːhthuh khyang juː pungpau shyak theila somdek tomti jyng y phuaei shyak. Yn ha myih nyak acuːn ha la khujy ha khycee y hnguːtcap hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Yn bawva y puhcai khyang ce khyang ha na Nuatpaw hngupi hngubah cyamhlyam suilei nyak khy tawk thawn. Ynbawlaakhy Nuatpaw ce mymi pahuat cim dy pannei tih si jo. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Mymi ce Nuatpaw khiannyng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“ ‘Shyak hiyang luːluk tih a my thawn,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Nyangmi duk kuːh boihjei tuattih aciya ha na khy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Keimi ha ce Nuatpaw zawnau ha kym si tila ym boihjei nyak.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Yn bawva keimi ha ce Nuatpaw zawnau ha kym si khiannyng, Nuatpaw ce khyang tuat khyang ngyng lup com khyang hngaa sikawvyngcee hyaan, tangkaw, lung lyksah ha cyppei tijyang khindyang tuan jo paw. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Yn bawva pyih hnguːt tih acuːn nyng khyang ha na ym hnguh hnguat nyn kaw khyang Nuatpaw hnguat hnguːt kaw lakhy, tuh a cee aduːn tyng ngyng myitih tomti jyang jubaijei nyak lawh haija hnguishin hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ibawma tijyngcee Nuatpaw ce y pumhngaw na y yap hnguːt nyak khyang, khyang ngyng somdek ahngoan na cijang ngy tawk khuhnguːp hnguːp huat y hnguːtcap hnguːt. Yn mawhpaw khy byt nyak kyng kuːh ynih thoo bya shyak theila yn bawva thawnlu haija khyang tomti jyng saksi y shuduan pyn,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Byt nyak kuːh thoo bya khyang bawng ym jyak hnguva, aciya ha na ce ym nuihiat jei, ynbawlakhy yciya ha na, “Yn bawng atha mokhuat nyang cengkuːh kym jyak hluː bya hyam,” tila ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Yn hnguva, Pawluh ce yn ha cengkuːh y zet bua. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ycya khyang ha ce Pawluh lawnglyktih a thawn lu theila jummeitih a ym thawnlu. Yn ha duk kuːh Areopagus jung bawng Dionysius la Damaris mingnaw tih hngutaw vyng kuːhthuh ycya khyang ha khy ym pui.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Korin Luh A Pawluh Na Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Yn pynnyng, Pawluh ce Athen luh taw hnguːt theila Korin luh lyaamma y zet. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Yn luh a Pontus pe shaw, Aquila mingnaw tih Judah khyang pahuat y kawmmei. Yn ce y pihia Priscilla dy Italy pee kuːh y hngih phawlu. Ibawthawnnyngmatijyngcee Claudius syamphalyang na Judah khyang ha tomti Roma luh kuːh zet bya shyak khyang eyang bei khiannyng y si. Yn hnguva Pawluh ce yn ha dy kawmmei jy zet <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />theila, khuːtbi khyang huattei khiannyng, yn ha dy myi hah theila khuːtbi. Yn ha cee imm tiih nyakky shaw vuːn khoi khyang khuːtbi tih ha ym thawn. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Pawluh cee Jah hnguːp tyng ngyng sinakok ka sityang poai sumsa theila Judah khyang juː ha la Grik khyang juː ha jummei lu haija y hlawihliang ngei.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Silas la Timawte ce Macedonia pee ja ym lu bya hnguva, Pawluh ce susaih khyang jyang cai theila, Jesuh ce Messiah thawn tinyak khyang Judah ha eyng saksi khyam theila y susaih. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ynbawlakhy Judah ha na yn honyak khyaukhaw ym hyau khiannyng, Pawluh ce y suishyak kyng kuːh huːmhui kawk theila, “Nyangmi thii ce nyangmi huanna jyng cukaw seh. Kei ce yn ha eyng behbyang jonga. Tuh a kuːhthuh khyang juː cya ha cenga ky zet ty,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Yn pynnyng Pawluh ce sinakok kuːh lyt theila Nuatpaw jummeitih Titus, Justus tinyak khyang imm ma y zet. Yn imm ce sinakok cenga a myi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Sinakok mawh a thawntih Crispus ce yn immlawng ha dy Mawhpaw ym jummei. Ycya Korin luh shaw ha panukung khycee Pawluh susaih khyang jaw theila jummei lu awla baptisma ym lovei giah.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Juan huat hnguva Mawhpaw na lunghnguːn nyng Pawluh eyng y duan khyang cee, “Kyh kawh byih; jaadikzaw va myijei kawva, tha thyiv susaih byih. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Kei cee nyang dy ky myi hah. Nyang u na khy hleim lawh jo, Myn luh a kei khyang ha panu ym myi,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Yn khiannyng Pawluh ce yn luh a kum huat thua myi theila Nuatpaw khyaukhaw y cawkhyau.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ynbawlakhy Gallio syamphalyang ce Achaia luh khyang lianzaw va thawn hnguva, Korin na myi tih Judah ha na Pawluh huattyng muan awla junga ym zeh. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Yn khyang ha na, “Myn khyang naa, tala eyng cyppei tih kawva Nuatpaw khuːhbia vy khyang y hlawihliang,” ym tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Pawluh na hyau bya ey hnguva, Gallio syamphalyang na, “Judah khyang ha eyng, myn bawng cee khyang tuk khyang sikawvyngcee seetih pahuat thawn nyngcee, kei na myn bawng dynnei jy lawh. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ynbawlakhy myn bawng ce nyangmi khyaukhaw, ming la nym pumhngaw tala thumcian na thawn khiannyng, nym pumhngaw na jyang cijang byih jyt. Kei na ni byang bawng ha cijang jonga,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Yn ha tomti tala duːn kuːh y shyt zo. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Yn hnguva khyang puː tomti na sinakok mawh Sosthenes muan awla tala cijang nyak hngoaimaw va ym shawh; ynbaw hnguva Gallio myang na yn bawng ha thihli kawva y myijei.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antiawk Luh A Pawluh Lu bya Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pawluh ce Korin luh a khuhnguːp byangveih y myi pynnyng, jummeitih ha eyng kutshyaan pynnyng, Syria pe ja kithawlawng ngyng y joon. Priscilla la Aquila hyih khycee yn dy ym puijei. Pawluh ce juanpovei hnguːtkhiannyng kithawlawng joon hlawn na tuiikhyam luh a y lushaam viuhvei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">juanpovei hnguːt: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yn lusyam viuhvei khyang cee Judah thumcian ngyng juanpovei khyang mikhnguh khyang kuːmcei nyak a hyau hluː.</char></note> hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Yn ha cee Ephesus luh a ym phawlu hnguva, Pawluh na Priscilla la Aquila y tyak hnguːt. Y pumhngaw pyt sinakok ka voang theila Judah ha dy y sumsa. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Yn ha na hnguːp hngih thum myi jy kawhei awla khy, Pawluh na dynnei jo. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ynbawlakhy y zehtyak hnguva, “Nuatpaw luːnyak myi jyngcee nyangmi cenga ky lu bua tuː jy,” y tinyak. Yn pynnyng yn ha gataw theila Ephesus luh kuːh kithawlawng ngyng y joon.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Caesare luh y phaw hnguva, Jerusalem luh a zet theila jummeitihpuːpaw ha kuːtshyaan nei pynnyng, Antiawk luh lyamma y zet. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Pawluh ce Antiawk luh a acuːn byangveih myi pynnyng, Galilee pe, Phrygia pe tomti ja zetjok theila hngulawnglyktih ha cihngia shyak.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus La Korin Luh A Apollos Cawk Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Yn hnguva Alexandria luh shaw Apollos mingnawtih Judah khyang juː pahuat ce Ephesus luh a y lu. Yn ce susaih khyngtih pahuat thawn theila kutjokcaw vyng thiamvatih y si. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Mawhpaw Lyam duan nyak cawkshyang ngei theila, susaih nyak kyng lungeijei theila Jesuh bawng ha hngoantih a cawkshyang theila y myijei. Ynbawlakhy yn na Jawhan na baptisma bei khyang bawng jyang y hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Yn ce Judah ha sinakok dukka kyh kawva y susaih. Priscilla la Aquila na y susaih khyang ym jyak pynnyng, yn ce ym imm ma pannei theila Nuatpaw lyam ym hnguat nyak kakai jy tawk Apollos eyng yn ha na ym saih. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apollos ce Achaia pe ja zet ty luː khiannyng, Ephesus luh a kuːh jummeitih ha na yn tha bei theila Achaia pe ja myitih jummeitih ha na yn dynnei nyak ky tawk shin caw shan theila tha ym bei. Yn pee jaa phaw hnguva Nuatpaw khunkhyi khiannyng, jummei lu tih ha panukung phuihlawi tih a y thawnlu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee Jesuh ce Messiah si khyang talagamcaw vyng duan theila khyang puː ha hngoaimaw va Judah ha eyng poai poai y hyau bya.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Ephesus Luh A Pawluh Naa Susaih Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apollos ce Korin nga myi jei hnguva, Pawluh ce khoong lyaam zehtaw theila Ephesus luh a y komlu. Yn luh a yciya hngulawnglyktih ha y hnguh hnguva, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Pawluh na, “Nyangmi ce jummeitih a nym thawnlu hnguva, Muikhaw Cim nym dynnei lawh ei?” tila y hngii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Yn ha na, “Keimi na lawh jo awnga, Muikhaw Cim myi tinyak khyang kung keimi na jaw saijo awnga,” tila ym shyakkei bya.<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Pawluh na, “Ynbaw hngucee nyangmi ibyang baptisma na ym khyammei ma?” tila y hngi hnguva,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Yn ha na, “Jawhan na bei khyang baptisma kym khyammei,” ym tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1.4</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luk 3.4</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26">Jaw 1.26</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char>
    </note>Pawluh na, “Jawhan baptisma bei khyang ce jubaijei nyak kyng cyppei tih baptisma a si. Yn hnguva khyang ha eyng ynih pynnyng lu hai pahuat nym jummei lawh ey. Yn cee Jesuh y hyau hluː,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Yn ha ce Mawhpaw Jesuh ming ngyng baptisma ym khyammei. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pawluh na yn ha huanna y kuːt tyang hnguva, yn ha kunga Muikhaw Cim ce komlu theila, yn ha ce a juːjuː be hyau theila ym hngawpaw giah. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Yn ha tomti ce putaw pyt khulaihngih ym myi.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pawluh ce kkhaw thum zingling sinakok ka voang theila kyh kawva susaih theila Nuatpaw teengpee bawng susaih jei thong awla jummei lu haija hlawihliang ngei theila y myi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ynbawlakhy yciya ha ce jummei jy tawk dyn hluː joaw, khyang ha hngoaimaw va yn Jesuh tala ym hawdawh nyak. Yn khiannyng Pawluh ce hngulawnglyktih ha dy huattyng yn ha cengkuːh hlei bya theila Tyrannus caw cawk nyak ka hnguːp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Acya kutjokcawvyng bawngnei </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Angu 11 a.m. kuːhthuh. a muːlyam 4 p.m. cyp.</char></note> kut ym sumsa. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Yn bawva kum hngih susaih pynnyng, Asia pe ja myitih Judah la Grik khyang juː ha tomti ce Mawhpaw khyaukhaw ym jyak lawh.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sceva Na Y Zawpaw Ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nuatpaw na Pawluh summei theila a hlyija muːnnawseetih ha y duan. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Pawluh summei khyang hiahzaw sikawvyngcee khyy suishyak kuatih ha huanna y tyang hnguva, yn ha nehnyaang a kuːk. Yn ha duk kuːh muikhaw see ha khy ym lyt giah. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />A duːn tomti jaa zetjok tih Judah hlungtin sala ciya na Mawhpaw Jesuh ming summei theila muikhaw see ha ym shyt ty ym cai. Yn bawva ym cai hnguva yn ha na, “Pawluh susaih khyang Jesuh ming ngyng nyang lytlu tijyng kei na yang ky bei,” tila ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Yn bawva puhcai tih ha ce Judah Jahhenpaw Lian Sceva zawpaw syh ha ym si.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Yn hnguva muikhaw see na, “Jesuh ky hnguat, Pawluh khy ky hnguat, ynbawlakhy nyangmi cee u ha ma?” tila ym syakkei bya.<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Yn pynnyng muikhaw see bynnei khyammei lawh tih na yn ha huanna pyak theila y khoi nyak hnguva, yn ha ce nehngaw lawhei theila suishyak kawva imm kuːh ym zen lawh. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Yn sityang Ephesus luh a myitih ha Judah khyang juː la Grik kyang juː ha na ym jyak hnguva, yn ha na kyh awla Mawhpaw Jesuh ming ym kyhkhiat kakai. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Jummeitih ha khycee lu theila yn ha puhcai hnguːt khyang, khyang ha hngoaimaw va ym saih jei. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Mikphia summei tih ha panukung ce yn ha summei khyang cawuk ha huattyng luvei theila khyang ha hngoaimaw va mei jyng ym shi. Yn cawuk phu ce hiyanshaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">hiyanshaw: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyanshaw pahuat ce naam ma hnguːp huat khutbi kawh a si (to </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:2">Mat 20.2</ref></char>).</note> shawng pahngaw byang myi. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Yn bawva Mawhpaw khyaukhaw ce phungan nyng lian<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yn bawva Mawhpaw khyaukhaw ce phungan nyng lian; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">pynnyng hngucee, Mawhpaw phunggan ngyng, khyaukhaw.</char></note> theila y pungpau jok giah.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus Luh A Lingso Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Yn byang ha thawn pynnyng Pawluh ce muikhaw khiannyng Macedonia pe la Achaia pee tomti ja zet theila Jerusalem luh lyamma y zet ty y hnguːn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pawluh ce muikhaw khiannyng Macedonia pe la Achaia pee tomti ja zet theila Jerusalem luh lyamma y zet ty y hnguːn; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pawluh, Muikhaw Cim na lyam duan, khuːnkawh.</char></note> Yn pynnyng Pawluh na, “Yn luh a zet theila kei ce Roma luh lyamma khy ky hnguh lawh ey,” y tii. <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Yn ce y pumhngaw dy phuitih pahngih hyih, Timawte la Erastus ce Macedonia pe ja tuːh theila, Asia pee jaa byangveih zaw y myi hnguːt.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Yn hnguva tala lyam myng cyppei theila Ephesus luh a ym lingso. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Demetrius mingnawtih thisaptih pahuat ce Artemis nuatnu hiyanshaw imm com theila yn ce thisaptih ha na panukung y jyh lawh. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Yn na yn khuːtbi tih ha huattyng pannei theila, “Khuːtbi pui ha aw, myn khuːt khiannyng mymi my jyh lawh khyang nyangmi na nym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Ynbawlakhy Ephesus luh la Asia pe tomti jyang myitih yn ha eyng myn Pawluh tinyak khyang na khyang kuːt tyng com khyang nuat ha cee nuat si jo tila hnguhyam naw theila lyammau haija cai khyang nyangmi na khy nym hnguh nym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Yn bawva mymi khuːt cee ming pak nyn. Ynbaw ce khawm cyang la aliantih Artemis nuat biatimm thihli naw kawva Asia pee tomti la somdek kyng myitih ha na ym khuːhbia khyang yn nuat ming zong khyang khycee kuːk theila sawso nyak khy myi,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Yn sityang ym jyak hnguva, yn ha ce lungtyn theila, “Epheseus luh a kuːh Artemis nuatnu cee lian duː,” tila ym pang. <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Yn hnguva luh tomti ce lingso theila khyang ha na Pawluh dy zet hah pui y bawng ha thawn tih Macedonia pe shaw Gaius la Aristarchus tih muan awla pyi khawmnyak imm nu dukka ym zawn lu giah. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pawluh cee khyang puː ha cenga zet hluː lakhy hngulawnglyktih ha na kawkat. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Pawluh kyi tih ha thawn tih ha, Asia pee khyang lian zaw ciya ha na khy yn pyi khawmnyak imm nuu dukka voangngei haija ym khawhei. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Yn hnguva khyang dyn tih ha ce lingso awla a juːjuː a ym pang. Khyang ha na ikhiannyng kym dynnei tinyak khyang hnguat joaw. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Judah khyang ha na Alexander mingnawtih khyang pahuat lyt shyak theiawla, khyang puː dukkuːh ciya ha na khy ynih ym hluːei khiannyng, Alexander na y kuːt duan theila khyangpuː ha eyng jaadyam nyak ky tawk y hyau vy y lun. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ynbawlakhy yn ce Judah khyang pahuat thawn khyang, khyangpuː ha na sathih ym tyakkei hnguva, “Ephesus luh kuːh Artemis nuatnu cee lian duː,” tila acuːn pahngih byang thai pahuat pyt tyng ym pang.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ynbawlakhy luh cawlyang pyn tih ce khyang puː ha jadyam shyak theila, “Ephesus luh shaw ha aw, Ephesus luh ce lian duː tih Artemis nuatnu biatimm la huankhu kuːh kom lu tih luːpzaw sunghlyam nyak duːn thawn khyang hnguat tih kaw pahuat pahuat nym myi jei. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Yn khiannyng myn bawng ha ce, cahnyn kaw khyang bawng nga thawn khiannyng nyangmi ce jaadikdamdek ka myi theila thahli naw kawva cai tuan jo. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Mynija nym lu khyang, khyang hyih cee biatimm dukka voang awla, hutphaijei tih si tih ha bawva keimi nuatnu ming lian khyang siatnaw tih hyih khy si joaw. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Yn khiannyng Demetrius la y bawngpui thisaptih ha ce pahuat huat talacijang ngy myi jyngcee yn ha talacijang ngy jung ha la luh zong tih ha khyanglian ce ajyangjyi ym myi. Yn ha junga jyang tala baw tyng nga cijang seh. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ynbawlakhy nyangmi jyng aciya bawng ha ym hngi jy myi jyngcee tala voang tih dynnei nyak kyng, y cijang piat ty. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Tuːh hnguːp pa thawn hnguːt tih lingso tih ha ce mymi tawk kyhsee khyang sawso nyak ky myi. Cihngia tih saksi pahuat huat myi kaw khiannyng, mymi na myn bawva lingso nyak sumsa nyak bei nyn hai si jo,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Yn bawva hyau pynnyng, yn na khyang puː ha y tuːh bya.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Macedonia La Achaia Pee Ja Pawluh Zetnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Lingso tih ha pyih pynnyng, Pawluh na hngulawnglyktih ha pannei theila thabei khyaukhaw hyau theila kutshyan pynnyng, Macedonia pee lyamma y zet. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Yn pe tomti ja zetjok theila jummeitih ha eyng thabei khyaukhaw hyau pynnyng, Achaia pe ja y zet. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Yn luh a kkhaw thum myi theila Syria pe lyamma kitawlawng ngyng zet ty piangsa jei hnguva, Judah khyang juː ha na tukky adukka ym cijang khyang Pawluh na y jyak lawh. Yn khiannyng Pawluh ce Macedonia pee zet theila zet bua ey tawk y cijang. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Berea luh shaw va thawntih Pyrrhus zawpaw Sopater, Thessalonica luh shaw ha thawntih Aristarchus la Secundus, Derbe luh shaw thawntih Gaius, Lystra luh shaw a thawntih Timawte, Asia pe shaw ha thawntih Tychicus la Trophimus ha cee Pawluh dy huattyng ym puijei. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Yn ha ce zet maw theila Troas luh a mymi ym zong. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ynbawlakhy keimi na heenpui tih kaw pyi hnguːp cyng theila, khuhnguːp hnguːp pahngaw diev pynnyng, Philipi luh kuːh tuisyamphua dyang ngei theila, Troas luh a kym phaw. Yn luh a hnguːp syh kym myi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Troas Luh A Pawluh Akhuːnyak Lyng Khyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Jin hnguːp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jin hnguːp; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hngi hnguːp.</char></note> acuːk hnguːp pyng keimi ce phe iak haija huattyng kym lu. Pawluh ce atha hnguːp pyng yn luh kuːh zet bya ey khyang hnguːnnei khiannyng, khujuan diev cyp tala y susaih. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Keimi dynnei nyak a huanna khyn na meikuːp panukung myi. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Ynijaa Eutychus mingnaw tih compyang khyang pahuat y myi, yn ce Pawluh na a diev va susaih hnguva kyt tyng hngawngei theila y ipku pah. Yn ce ip theila shyyn pathum huan kuːh a dyanga khaw khiannyng, ym pyym hnguva byt khyang ym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Yn hnguva Pawluh ce a dyanga kommei theila yn compyang byang theila y pym pynnyng, “Sawso kawh eyt, myn dikzaw y syak myi hyam,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Yn pynnyng Pawluh ce a huanna zet bua thuːh theila phe iak theila yn ha dy y ei hah. Yn ce yn ha eyng khuthuaih lyam cyp khyau theila, y zet bya. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Khyang ha na syak hiyang tih yn dikzaw zehpui naw theila ahlyi ja lungshyaksa nyak ym lawh.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Troas Luh A Kuːhthuh Miletus Luh Cyp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Keimi ce tuisyamphua huanna khuai theila Pawluh dyangei nyak ky khyang Assos luh lyamma tuisyamphua eyng ym zet. Yn ce yn luh a kuːhthuh khoong lyam myng y zet dy tijyang y hnguːnnei khiannyng, yn bawva y cijang hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Yn bawva keimi dy Pawluh ce Assos luh a khawmmei theila yn cee tuisyamphua huanna duːan awla Mitylene luh lyamma thathyiv kym zet. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Yn luh kuːh kitawlawng ngyng zet theila atha hnguːp pa Chios khongphai ja kym phawei. Yn nyng kuːh hnguːp huat ym zet pynnyng, Samos khongphai voang theila atha hnguːp pyng Miletus luh a kym phawei. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Yn hnguva Pawluh cee Asia pee ja acuːn pyih hluː kaw khiannyng Ephesus luh zehtaw awla kym cun ny hnguːnnei theiawnga, athawn nyn nyngcee Pentecost pyi hnguːp hlawn na Jerusalem luh a kym phaw ey tawk yn ce y lung soksak nawva y myi.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesus kuːh Jummeitih Ha Eyng Pawluh Na Khin khyang Khyaukhaw Shin nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Yn khiannyng Pawluh ce Miletus luh a kuːhthuh Ephesus luh lyamma khyang tuːh theila jummeitihpuːpaw khyanglian ha na khawmmei lu haija y tuːh. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Yn ha ym phawlu hnguva, Pawluh na, “Kei ce Asia pee ja acuːk nyak ky phaw hnguːp pyng kuːhthuh, nyangmi dy my myih jok acuːn tyng ngyng ibaw ky myihcuh lupcap khyang ha nym hnguat giah. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Kei cee ahlyija lung hngiammei theila, ky mikki kyak hngyak kyng Judah ha na akhyng kawva ym tintaw khyang khyam lawh theinga, ym hlumhlik dukka, ky Mawhpaw khuːt ky bi hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ynbawva khyang puː mawva si seh imm huat kom imm huat khoi thawn seh ky cawkhyau hnguva, nyangmi tawk akhyng tih tawk susaih jy hngusup jonga. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Jubaijei awla Nuatpaw cenga nym lu bya ey la mymi na Mawhpaw Jesuh my jummei jy khyang Judah la Griik khyang juː ha eyng athukka ky susaih hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Tuh a kei ce Muikhaw Cim na y susaih shyak tyng ngyng, Jerusalem luh a ky zet ty. Yn luh a kei jyang ibawva athawnny tijyang hnguat jonga. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ynbawlakhy kei ce joii jyng khawnhiyan khyam lawh theila phehphaei khyam lawh ey khiannyng, Muikhaw Cim na luh tyng ngyng saksi eyng sathih y bei. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Tim 4.7</ref></char></note>Ynbaw hnguva Nuatpaw khunkhyi jyng behei tih sityang poai susaih jy tawk Mawhpaw Jesuh cengkuːh dyndyangei khyang cai jy khyang la khuːt cyng nynny hngucee, kei na ky syak kung khy pam jonga.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Tuh a kei susaih khyang Nuatpaw teengpee bawng jaw lawh tih nyangmi myitih tomti na, atha mok huat kei hngoai hnguh lawh bya tuː hai si jo tinyak khyang kei na hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Yn khiannyng, kei na khyang tomti thii jyng behbyang jonga tinyak khyang tuhnguːp pa nyangmi jyng saksi ky khyammei. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee Nuatpaw luːnyak khyang myitih tomti nyangmi jyng ky susaih khyang, kei na hngusung taw hnguːt jonga. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Yn khiannyng nyangmi cee nym pumhngaw khy si seh hluzaw tomti khy si seh totawh lupan naw byih jyt. Nuatpaw zawpaw thii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nuatpaw zawpaw thii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">or </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ynih zawpaw tangtyng huanna byt khyam khiannyng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">y pumhngaw thii khiannyng.</char></note> jyng y luihngyah ei hnguːt khyang Nuatpaw jummeitihpuːpaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nuatpaw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjokcawvyng </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mawhpaw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi.</char></note> ha lupan nyak khy tawk, yn hluzaw ha totawh tih ha Muikhaw Cim na nyangmi y yap hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Kei zet bya pynnyng, hluzaw ha pawng mansei kawva ei tih hngee bawng ha nyangmi dukka ym kuːm lu vy ky cyh nyak. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Yn hnguva nyangmi duk kyng khy hngulawnglyktih ha ym pumhngaw lyamma hlawihliang ngei theila lyammau lu haija hyautih aciya ha khy ym myi lu vy. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Yn khiannyng sathih eyng myi byih jyt! Kei dy khukum kumthum my myih, a hnguːp a juan mikki kyak jyak kyng nyangmi jyang thuːkthawn khyaukhaw ky shin hnguːt khyang khindyang byih jyt.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Yn nyng tuh a kei na nyangmi jyang Nuatpaw ceng cyp si seh, Mawhpaw khunkhyi jyng ky khyaukhaw lyamma khy si seh ky beh hnguːt. Yn tala na ce nyangmi ciciat nyak la cimcyang khyam lawh tih khyang ha dy huattyng nyangmi jyang hngei y bei nyn. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Kei na ce u hyaan, hngaa sikawvyngcee suishyak khy na hnguːt jonga. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Kei dy khuːt bi pui ha luːvei tomti tawkka ky pumhngaw na khuːtlup theinga puːhpum hnguːt khyang nyangmi na nym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ni ha tomti dukka khuːt poaija lupcap hnguːt theinga sanglai ngawgah ha eyng bei jy khyang kei na ky suduan hnguːt. Yn khiannyng Mawhpaw Jesuh kung na y shin hnguːt khyang ce ‘Ny bei thei khyang ce ny lawhei thyaak kyng khunkyi myi,’ tinyak khyang khyaukhaw hnguat thei byih jyt y tii hnguːt.”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Yn ha tomti susaih pynnyng, Pawluh ce khukdya theila yn ha tomti dy y hngihminnei. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Yn hnguva yn ha cee gap awla Pawluh pyang theila cimtih uthyiam khyang cai pynnyng ym ka. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Atha mok huat ynih hngoai hngu lawh ti jozaw tinyak khyang Pawluh khyaukhaw khiannyng, ym ngiamiang kyih. Yn pynnyng Pawluh tuisyamphua cyp ym thyaakei.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Ma Pawluh Zetnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Keimi ce yn ha dy ka pynnyng, tuiisamphua eyng Kos khongphai lyamma kym zet hlyi. Atha hnguːp pyng yn khongphai ja kuːhthuh Rhodes khongphai lyamma zet theila, yn nyng kuːhthuh Patara luh lyamma kitawlawng ngyng kym zet bya thuːh. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Yn nyng kuːhthuh keimi ce Phoenicia pee lyamma hlei bya hai, tuisamphua pahuat hngu theila yn tuisyamphua dyangei awnga kym joon. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Cyprus khongphai jaa suttei theila aping lyam zehtaw awnga, Syria lyamma tuisyamphua eyng kym zet bya thuːh. Tyre luh a lawkla ha kyak ky tawk tuisamphua yn luh a kym hap. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ynija keimi na hngulawnglyktih yciya ha khawmmei theila yn ha dy hnguːp syh kym myi. Yn ha na Muikaw na duan khiannyng Pawluh eyng Jerusalem luh a zet kaw haija ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Yn khiannyng zet bya ey acuːn phawlu hnguva, keimi ce lyam kym zet bya thuh. Yn ha tomti ce ym pihia la ym zaw ha dy keimi luh thua cyp ym thyaak lu, ynpynnyng tuiikhyam cyp kym phaw hnguva keimi ce khukdya theila kym hngihminnei. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Yn pynnyng pahuat la pahuat ga theila, keimi ce tuisyamphua huanna khuai theiawnga yn ha khycee ym imm hngaw a ym zet bya.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tyre luh kuːh Ptolemais luh a kym phaw hnguva, zeh nyak panglai lyam khy apyih. Yn luh a myitih jummeitih ha eyng tyammeijei tijyang hyau theila yn ha cenga hnguːp huat kym om. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Cee 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8.5</ref></char></note>Atha hnguːp huat tyng keimi ce yn luh a khuːh zet theila Caesare luh a kym phaw pynnyng, khyang syh dukkuːh sityang poai saih tih pahuat ta thawntih Philip imm ma voang theila kym awm. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Yn na putaw lawh hyamtih kaw hngawei nyntih nguakhnguzaw pahli y tyakkei. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Cee 11.28</ref></char></note>Yn imm ma khuhnguːp diev va kym awm hnguva, Agapus mingnawtih hngawpaw pahuat Judah pe ja khuːh y komlu. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Yn ce Keimi cenga y lyng lu, yn ce Pawluh ziang joii lovei theila y pumhngaw kuːt la khu vyng khawnn theila, “Muikhaw Cim na, Judah ha na myn ziang jooi mawh ce Jerusalem luh a ynbawva khawnn theila khyang juː ciya ha kuːt tyng ym yappy,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Yn kym jyak hnguva, keimi la ynija myitih khyang ha na Jerusalem luh a zet kaw haija Pawluh eyng khawhei awnga kym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Yn pynnyng Pawluh naa, “Nyangmi ce gap theila kei lungbawng ngiamiang nyak ky ibawthawnyng nym cai ma? Kei cee Jerusalem luh a phehimm kyak khyam my ce kawm cyang la Mawhpaw Jesuh ming tawk byt khyam my jyangjyai ky myi,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Keimi na Pawluh eyng khawhei jy lawh kaw hnguva, keimi na kawhlak theila, “Mawhpaw luː tyng si seh,” kym tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Yn pynnyng, keimi cee Jerusalem luh lyamma kym zet. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Caesare luh kuːh hngulawnglyktih acya ha ce keimi dy huattyng lyk lu theiawla, yn ha na hngulawnglyk pyam pahuat ta thawn tih Cyprus khongphai zaw Mnason<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mnason imm ma awm my tawk y zehpui nyak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yn khyang imm ma awm my tawk imm mawh dy keimi zehpui nyak.</char></note> imm ma awm my tawk y zehpui nyak.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">James cenga Pawluh Lyngei Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Keimi Jerusalem luh a kym phawlu hnguva, jummeitih ha na keimi poaija ym dovei. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Atha hnguːp pyng Pawluh cee keimi dy huattyng James khawmmei jy kym zet hnguva, jummeitihtpuːpaw khyanglian tomti khy ym kunglu. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Pawluh ce yn ha eyng tyammeijei tinyak pynnyng, y pumhngaw khuːtbi khyang, khyang juː cya ha huana Nuatpaw puhcai khyang pahuat pynnyng pahuat y susaih. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Yn ym jyak hnguva, yn ha na Nuatpaw ym khuːhbia nyak. Yn pynnyng Pawluh na, “Nau tih aw, Judah dukka myitih jummeitih ha a thawng shawng nga myi theila, yn ha tomti ce tala ym lung ngyng einawtih ha ym si. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Nyang ce khyang juː cya eyng myitih Judah tomti jyng Mosee tala dyyi zawla, yn ha dikzaw ha eyng vuːnnmonghleih cai kaw haija mymi thumcian tyng nga lyklyam kaw haija cawkhyau khyang yn ha na ym jyak pyn. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Mymi na ibaw my cai tuan ma? Nyang lu khyang yn ha na ym jyak tengteng ky, <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />yn khiannyng keimi na nyang ngyng hyau baw tyng nga cai byih. Keimi jyng setzaw tawtih khyang pahli ym myi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Yn khyang ha pannei theila, nyang khycee yn ha huattyng cimcyang nyak cai byih. Yn ha lu viuh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yn ha lu viuh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">To 18.18. </char></note> nyak ky khy apyih tih tomti khy nyang na bei byih. Ynbawva nyang kawng khy yn ha na ym hnguat khyang sityang cee ahngoan kawva nyang pumhngaw na jyang tala lyklyam khyang, khyang tomti na ym hnguat lu vy. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Cee 15.29</ref></char></note>Jummei lutih khyang juː cya ha tawk ce, yn ha ce luːpcom khyang ngyng hluhbawn nyak meh ei khyang, thii ei khyang, hngyaa hak theila tuk khyang hyangsei shawei khyang, la tala eyng cyppei tih kaw byiunyak khyang ha phenphaei jy, keimi na hnguːncap theila cawjok theiawnga kym bei pyn,” tila ym hyau.<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Atha hnguːp pyng Pawluh ce yn khyang pahli pannei theila yn ha dy huattyng cimcyang nyak y cai. Yn pynnyng biatimm ma zet theila, yn ha pahuat cuːm tawk, hluhbawn ny acuːn thawn khiannyng, cimcyang nyak cai khyang khuhnguːp pyih jy acuːn y hnguat jyak shyak.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biatimm Dukka Pawluh Muan Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Khuhnguːp hnguːp syh phawlu hnguva asia lyamma khuːh luutih Judah ciya ha na biatimm dukka Pawluh hngu theila khyang ha tomti vyng ym thukthawn. Ynpynnyng yn muan theiawla, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />“Israel khyang ha aw!” phuimaw paw. “Ni khyang ce mymi khyang juː ha khy si seh, tala la ni biatimm khycee khymka theila duːn tyng ngyng myitih khyang tomti eyng cawkhyau tih y si. Yn tuan kawva Greek khyangjuː ha biatimm dukka lu theila ni cimcaih tih duːn y coplap shyak,” tila pang theila ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Cee 20.4</ref></char></note>(Yn bawva ym hyau khyang cee yn ha na pawluh ce acuːkka Ephesus luh shaw Trophimus dy luh dukka pawluh ym hngu khiangnyng, pawluh ce yn ha biatimm dukka y zehpui nyak tila ym uːtnyak khiangnyng a si.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ynhnguva luh duk tomti lingso khiangnyng khyang ha ce ym lawh nyak lyamma ym zen. Yn khiannyng pawluh khy muan theiawla biatimm pumtua shyt awla shawt ha khy saisikung ym khah giah. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Yn ha na pawluh tuk ky ym cai hnguva, Jerusalem luh tomti lingso theila sityang ce Roma jaapuː uptih pahuat khyanglian cenga a phawei. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Jaapuː uptih na jaapuː khyanglian ha la jaapuː ha pan theila khyang puː ha cenga zon theila y kommei. Khyang puː ha na jaapuː uptih ym hnguh hnguva Pawluh ym shawhciau khyang ym duːmmei. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Ynhnguva jaapuː lian ce yn ha cenga lu theila pawluh ym muan khyang thijoii pahngih eyng khawnny y hyau. Yn pynnyng y na pawluh ce u ma tinyak khyang la i y cai hnguːt ma tila khyang puː ha eyng y hngi. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Ynbawlakhy khyangpuː dukkuːh pahuat juːhuat cija paang awla khuhlingkhucing thawn khiannyng, jaapuː lian na ahngoan tih hnguat nyn jo. Yn khiannyng pawluh jaapuː ha myih nawva zeh ey y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Yn hnguva Pawluh ce hlyak ceng y phaw hnguva, khyang puː lingso khyang ce khonglu khiannyng, jaapuː ha na Pawluh juːk awla ym zehei. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Ahnguva lyklu tih khyang puː ha na, “Yn tu vyt” tila ym pang.<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Na Khyangpuː ha eyng Khyau Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Jaapuː ha na Pawluh jung nga ym zehei hngyhtian hnguva, Pawluh na jaapuː lian nyng, “Nyang la kei khyau meihzaw hyau maw vy,” tila y bih. Jaapuː lian na, “Nyang na Griik be ny hyau tuattei?” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Cuːkka lingso tih ha sunnei tih khyang thawng pahli khongkhuca a zehpui naw tih Egypt khyang juː cee nyang si jo ti jei,” tila y hngii.<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pawluh na, “Kei ce Judah khyang juː ky si, Cilicia pee Tarsus luh shaw pahuat ky si. Khyang puː ha eyng khyauvei jy tawk kei na ky bih,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Jaapuː lian na khyauvei jy bei theila Pawluh cee hlyak huanna tung theila khyang puː ha duːmmei haija y kut duan. Khyang puː ha jaadyam hnguva Pawluh na Hebre be jyng khyau y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Ky benau la paw tih ha aw, tuːh a kei hyau bya ey khyang ngei jyt,” tila y phun.<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Yn ha eyng Hebre be ja y hyau khyang ym jyak hnguva, yn ha ce byakkhy tii kawva ym myi voih.<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Cee 5.34–39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pawluh na Cilicia pe Tarsus luh a myitih Judah ky si, ynbawlakhy ni luh ky lianlu. Mymi shyakai ha tala bawtyng nga Gamaliel cenga cawkei tih ky si. Tuhnguːp pa nyangmi tomti na Nuatpaw tawk lung na eijei nyak bawva, kei khycee ky lung na eijei. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Cee 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9–11</ref></char></note>Kei ce myn Nuatpaw Lyam lawnglyktih ha byt hnguna phehphaei theila hngutaw la putaw ha muan theinga phehimm dukka ky kyak hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Jahhenpaw Lian la kongci lian tomti na saksi ym duan nyn. Kei ce Damascus luh a myitih benau ha cenga jok khyang caw ha lovei theila ynija myitih yn ha khy khawnhyan theila Jerusalem luh a lu theinga pet bei jy tawk Damascus luh a ky zet.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Saksi Khyam Nyak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ceepaw 9.1–19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Kei ce Damascus luh ka a ky lu hnguva, Khusun nyng catnyaknawva kei kika huankhu kuːh ava anglu. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Kei ce dekkyng gu theila kei jyang hyau khyang thai pahuat ce, ‘Sawluh, Sawluh! Ibawthawnnyng kei ny phehphaei ma?’ y tii. <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />‘Kei na, Mawhpaw aw, nyang u ma?’ ky tinyak hnguva, ‘Kei ce nyang phehphaei khyang Nazareth luh zawpaw Jesuh ky si,’ tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Kei bawngpui ha na ava ym hnguh, yn bawlakhy kei jyng ynih hyau khyang thai ce yn ha na jaw joaw. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />‘Kei na, Mawhpaw aw, Kei na ibawva ky cai lawh ey ma?’ tila ky hngi. ‘Mawhpawe na, Thoo, Damascus luh dukka zet. Yn luh a nyang cai jy khyang ha nyang ngyng y saih jy,’ tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Ky bawngpui ha na ym kuːt tyng hyi theila Damascus luh lyaamma ym zehpui nyak, ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee yn eangtih ava khiannyng kei ce ky mik hung.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Yn hnguva Ananias mingnawtih khyang pahuat ce kei to haija kei cenga y lu. Yn ce tala kyhkhiat theila yn luh a myihtih Judah khyang tomti cenga kyhkhiat khyang y khyam lawh. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Yn khiannyng kei cenga y lu, kei ka tung theila, ‘Ky nau Sawluh aw, ny mik va seh!’ tila kei jyang hyau hnguva, yn kikawvyng kei ce yn ky hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Yn pynnyng yn na, ‘Mymi shyakai Nuatpaw ce y pumhngaw luː hnguat ty tawk, Puːnpoktih mawhpaw hnguh lawh ey tawk la y mong ngyng kuːh khyaukhaw jyak ky tawk nyang hngyahei hnguːt pyn. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Nyang ce ny hnguh lawh, ny jyak lawh khyang ha tawk khyang ha hngoaimawva yn mawhpawe tawk saksi a thawn lawh ey. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Tuh a khy nyang ce ibawthawnyng ny zong ma? Thooh, baptisma khyammei byih. Ynih ming pannei tila nyang pet ha pattei byih,’ tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang juː cya eyng Susaih haija Pawluh pan khyammei Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Kei Jerusalem luh kuːh zet bya theinga biatimm ma hngihminnei nyak ky cai hnguva lunghnguːn khyang ky hnguh. Yn lunghnguːn ngyng Nuatpaw na kei jyng, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />‘ni luh saw ha na kei bawng nyang ngyng saksi khyam khyang ym dynnei jy kaw khiannyng, nyang Jerusalem luh kuːh ajyanga zet,’ tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Kei na, ‘Mawhpaw aw, kei ce sinakok pahuat pynnyng pahuat zet theinga nyang jummeitih ha thawng khaw theinga phehphaei khyang yn ha na ym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Cee 7.58</ref></char></note>Nyang saksi khyamtih Stephen tuk khyammei lawh hnguva, kei khy ynija tung theinga y shawphawtu tih a thawn theinga yn tutih suishyak ha ky zong hnguːt,’ tila y hyau bya. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Ynhnguva Mawhpawaw na, ‘Zet; kei na nyang khyang juː cya ha cenga apan nawva ky tuːh ey,’ ” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Khyang puː ha na Pawluh hyau khyang cyp ym ngei. Pawluh susaih khyang ym jyak hnguva, ym thai jyau tih a pang theila, “Ni byang khyang, myn somdek huanna tukyiv paw! yn ce syak hiyang tuan jo,” tila ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Yn ha ce pang theila ym suishyak sut theila dyyi theila dek hnguːuːn ha ki huanna jawngpai jok, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />theila, yn hnguva jaapuː lian na Pawluh junga zeh ey khyau y shin. Yn na “Khyang puː ha ce ibawthawnnyng ynbawva luːvei kawva ym pang khyang hnguat ty tawk, yn jooi jyng shuat theila hngi byih,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Yn ha na ynih joii jyng ym khawnn hnguva, Pawluh na y ka tungtih khyang lianzaw eyng, “Nyangmi ce Roma pe shaw pahuat hngi kawva jooi jyng nym shawh khyang tala eyng cyppei jei,” tila y hngi.<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Yn khyang lian na y jyak hnguva, yn ce jaapuː uptih cenga zet theila y saih jei. “Ibawva ny puhcai jy ma? Ni khyang ce Roma luh shaw y si,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Yn hnguva jaapuː uptih ce Pawluh cenga zet theila, “Kei jyng hyau cyam, nyang ce Roma luh shaw vei,” tila y hngi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">“Yih ky si,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Jaapuː uptih na, “kei ce luh shaw ey tawk tangkaw panu ky bei lawh,” y tinyak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na, “kei cee Roma luh shaw a ky myi hnguːt,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Yn khiannyng Pawluh hngica hai ha khy yn cengkuːh ym gajyaang hlyi. Pawluh ce Roma luh shaw thawn khyang jaapuː uptih na y hnguat hnguva yn khawnhyan haija ky hyau khyang ky kyh.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kongci Hngoaimaw va Pawluh Phaw Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Jaapuː uptih na Pawluh ce ibawthawnnyng Judah ha na ym uːtnyak khyang hnguat ty y luː. Yn pynnyng atha hnguːp pyng Pawluh khawnhyan khyang sut theila Jahenpaw lian ha la kongci bawng ha na dynnei jy y hyau. Yn pynnyng Pawluh lu theila yn ha hngoaimaw va y tung shyak.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pawluh na jaapuː uptih bawng ha to sih theila, “Benau tih aw, kei ce hnguat nyak kyng Nuatpaw hngoaimaw va y khyngtih a syak ky hiyang,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Yn hnguva Jahhenpaw Lian Ananias na Pawluh kika tungtih ha eyng ynih mong ba haija y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mat 23.27</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:28">28</ref></char></note>Yn khiannyng Pawluh na Jahenpaw lian nyng, “Tala kawva puhcai theila khyang poai bawva syak hiyang tih ha aw, Nuatpaw na nyang y shawh ey! Nyang na tala tyng ngyng kei cijang ngy tawk ny ngoa hnguva, yn ny hyau khyang ny pumhngaw na simpak theila kei ny shawh shyak ky ny hyau,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Pawluh kika tungtih ha na, “Nyang ce Nuatpaw Jahhenpaw Lian ny hawdawh nyak,” tila ym hyau.<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pawluh naa, “Benau tih aw, yn ce Jahhenpaw Lian thawn khyang kei na hnguat jonga; talagamcaw vyng jokkeitih ce: ‘Nyang khyang juː uptih eyng a seetih hyau lawh jo,’ ” tila y shyakkei bya.<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Cee 26.5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Phil 3.5</ref></char>
    </note>Yn pynnyng yn ha dukka bawng huat ce Saddusee theila aciya ha ce Pharisee ha si khyang Pawluh na y hnguat hnguva, “Ky benau tih aw, kei ce Pharisee pahuat ky si bawva Pharisee zawpaw khy ky si. Kei hngica ky khyammei lawh khyang bawng ce byttih ha ym thoo bya ey tinyak khyang kei na ky uːtnyak khiannyng a si,” tila kongci hngoaimaw va pang theinga ky hyau.<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Yn bawva y hyau hnguva, Pharisee la Saddusee ha duk kyng khawngkau vei khyang myi theila dynneitih ha ce ym pakjyaang. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat 22.23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mar 12.18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luk 20.27</ref></char></note>(Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee Saddusee ha na byt nyak kuːh thoo bya khyang myi jo, huankhu ceepaw myi jo, muikhaw khy myi jo tila ym hyau. Ynbawlaakhy Pharisee ha na yn ha tomti myi khyang ym jummei.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ym vuipang khyang ha lianlu khiannyng Pharisee bawngpui tala hnguat tih sala ciya na thoo theila, “Myn khyang ngyng sengei theila ahngoan tih kaw pahuat khy hngu jonga. Muikhaw pahuat sikawvyngcee huankhu ceepaw pahuat na yn ngyng khyau hyau khyang khy si hngu si nyn,” tila saisikung ym cahei thawng.<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Cahei thawng khyang lian lu khiannyng, khyanglian na Pawluh a khuːn khyammei lawh ey khyang y cyh nyak. Yn khiannyng yn na, “Pawluh yn ha dukkuːh lawttei theila junga zehpui naw vyt,” tila jaapuː ha eyng y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Yn muː eyng Mawhpaw na Pawluh cenga tung theila, “Ny lung sawso kawh! Nyang ce kei bawng Jerusalem luh a susaih ny khyam hnguːt bawva Roma luh a khy susaih ny khyam lawh ey,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Ym Tukky Tawk Ym Cijang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Acya hnguːp angu va Judah ha ce huattyng khyammei theila ym cijang. Pawluh tuk lawh khaw sikhiang ikhy ou sikawvyngcee ei kawva myijei jy pahuat la pahuat jyanbo vei. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Yn bawva cijang khyang duk kyng khyang phikip thua ym pui. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Yn ha ce Jahenpaw lian la y lianzang ha cenga zet theila, “Keimi ce Pawluh kym tuk lawh kaw vyngcee ikhy ei kawva myijei jy tila kym jyanbo vei,” ym tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />“Yn khiannyng nyangmi cee kongci bawngpui ha dy Pawluh bawng sikhyang poai zawva ciceih hluː khyang shawngei theila, nyangmi cenga Pawluh lupui nawaw hai khyanglian cenga bih byih jyt. Keimi naakhy mynija kym phaw hluanna yn tuk ky kym zong ngy,” tila ym hyau.<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh thu na yn ha na khian khawng theila ym shawhciau vy khyang y jyak khiannyng junga voang theila Pawluh eyng y hyau vei. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Yn pynnyng Pawluh ce khyang lianzaw pahuat pannei theila, “Myn khyang thawizaw na jaapuː uptih eyng sityang bei jy myi khiannyng yn jaapuː uptih cenga zehpui nawh,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Yn khiannyng yn khyang lianzaw na thawizaw khyang, jaapuː uptih cenga zehpui naw theila, “Thawngkhaw tih Pawluh na kei panei theila myn thawizaw khyang na sityang saih lawh ey khiannyng yn jaapuː uptih cenga zehpui nyak ky tawk bih byih,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Jaapuː uptih na yn thawizaw khyang kuːt byn theila ahngaw va pannei, “Kei jyng ibyang sityang ny saih jy myi ma?,” tila y hngi.<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Yn thawizaw khyang naakhy: “Judah ha ce Pawluh cihngia tih a ciceih hluː tih bawva cai khiannyng, sangu jung hngoaimaw va lupui naw theila, khyang lianzaw cenga kym bih ey tila shawphawtu. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Yn khiannyng yn ha bih bawtyng nga lyklyam kawh byih, ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee yn ha duka khyang phikip thua na Pawluh khian theila tuk ky ym zong tinyak khyang y si. Yn ha ce Pawluh tuk lawh kaw sikhiang ou sikawvyngcee ei kawva myijei jy tawk ym jyanbovei. Tuh a yn ha cee y shyangtyang myi awla jaapuː uptih luː khyang ym zong,” tila y saih jei.<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Yn hnguva jaapuː uptih na, “kei jyng ni bawng ha sityang bei khyang uvyng khy saih kaw byih,” tila yn thawizaw vyng hyau theila y tuːh bya.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Caesarea luh A Thyaak nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Yn pynnyng jaapuː lian na jaapuː uptih pahngih pannei theila, “Muː cuːn gu vyng Caesare luh a zet ty jaapuː phawhngih, ssa dyangneitih jaapuː syhkip la kha bynneitih jaapuː phawhngih ha y shyangtyang cai byih jyt. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Pawluh dyangei nyak ky ssa ha khy thawjyai awla yn Felix myang cenga seekhaw myi kawva thyaak piat jyt byih,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Y bawngpui ha eyng cawcyang huat y shan: yn caw vyng a jokkei khyang ce.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Claudius Lysias na a liantih Felix myang ngyng ny tyaamei jei y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Myn khyang Judah ha na muan theila tukky ym cijang hnguva yn ce Roma pee shaw thawn khyang kei na jyak lawh khiannyng jaapuː ha dy huattyng zet theila yn kei na lilovei hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Judah khyang ha na ibyang pet tyng bungiang khyang kei na huat hluː khiannyng, yn ha kongci dynnei jaa kei na ky zehpui nyak. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Yn ce yn ha tala eyng cyppei tih hngi nyak ha eyng bungiang khyang khyam lawh, ynbawlaakhy yn nyng byt nyak, sikawvyngcee phehimm kyak khyam tuan tih y pet myi kaw khyang kei na ky hngu lawh. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Yn hnguva Judah khyang ha ce yn tukky tawk ajupzawva cijang khyang bawng kei na ky jyak hnguva, nyang cenga yn saisikung ky tuhlu. Bungiang tih ha khycee yn huanna bungiang khyang ha nyang cenga saih jy tawk ky shin hnguːt.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Yn khiannyng jaapuː ha khycee yn ha eyng shin hnguːt bawva Pawluh pannei theila amuː kunga Antipatris luh a ym thyaak. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Atha hnguːp pyng jaapuː ha ce Pawluh cee ssa dyangtih jaapuː ha dy zet theila yn ha ce junga ym zet bya. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ssa dyangeitih jaapuː ha ce Caesare luh a ym phaw hnguva caw Filex myang ngyng bei theila Pawluh khycee yn cenga ym yappei. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Samphalyang ce caw phuat theila Pawluh ce ibyang pe shaw y thawn khyang y hngi. Cilicia pe shaw thawn khyang y jyak hnguva, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />“Nyang bungiang tih ha ym phawlu hnguva nyang bawng kei na ky jyak shyak ky,” y tinyak. Yn pynnyng samphalyang na Pawluh ce Herod syamphalyang imm ma zongtih jaapuː ha na zong haija y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Pawluh Hngica Khyammei Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Hnguːp pahngaw diev pynnyng Jahhenpaw Lian Ananias cee Caesare luh a zet theila talatuat tih Tertullus la ycya aliancang ha lu theila Felix myang cenga Pawluh ym biatnyak. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Yn hnguva Pawluh pannei pynnyng, Tertullus na a liantih Felix myang ngyng y hyau khyang ce: “Keimi ce nyang mawhpaw hngoaimaw va hlyija jaadyam nyak kyng kym myijei lawh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Yn ce khawmcyang la mawhpaw hnguh hnguat lian khiannyng myn pee ja a hleijei tih ha khy podyang lu pyn. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Yn bawva puhcai khiannyng aduːn tyng nga ahlyija tyaknaw theila ym do vei. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ynbawlakhy Kei ce mawhpaw a diev va hlumhlik hluː kaw khiannyng a tawija biatnyak khyang duːppei tila ngei piat ty ky khawhei. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Myn khyang ce somdek tomti jyng myitih Judah ha lingso haija thukthawn theila thukthawn khyaammei tih pahuat thawn khyang kym hnguh pyn. Yn ce Nazareth luh zaw khyanglian pahuat y si. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Yn pynnyng biatimm khy bu haija puhcai khiannyng keimi na ynih kym muan hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" pubnumber="[7]" sid="ACT 24:7" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.6–8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciya kutjokcawvyng a dik 6b–8a: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kym pumhngaw tala bawva ynih kym cijang hnguːt, <char style="fv">7</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ynbawlakhy jaapuː lian Lysias lu theila, keimi cengkuːh hluːei kawva ynih y zehei. <char style="fv">8</char> </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ynpynnyng Lysias na ynih buːngiang tih ha nyang hngoaimawva lu haija y shin, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng bawngei.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Yn pynnyng yn bungiang tih ha eyng nyang cenga lu haija ky hyau hnguːt. Nyang pumhngaw kungna ny hngica eyngcee keimi na bungiang khyang bawng ha ny hnguh hnguat lu vy,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Yn hnguva yn duːn nyng myitih ycya judah ha na khy tala tuattih Terullus hyau tomti ce a hngoan tila ym hyau.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Felix Myang Hngoaimawva Pawluh Na Shyakkei Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Yn hnguva Felix myang na Pawluh eyng y hyau vy suduan theila Pawluh na,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Nyang ce myn teengpee khukum byangveih cijangtih thawn khyang ky hnguat khiannyng, kei bawng nyang ngyng jyjo tih a ky shyakkei bya vom. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Kei ce khuːhbia vy tawk Jerusalem luh a ky zet khyang ce hnguːp khulaihngih khy myi hyam kaw khyang, nyang na ny hngica nyn. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Kei ce biatimm ma khy si seh, Judah ha sinakok ka khy si seh pahuat huat dy cahei khyang khy siseh, khyang ha eyng lingso haija hyau khyang khy si seh yn ha na hngu joaw. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Kei jyng ny buːngiang khyang ha cee yn ha na saksi duan nyn joaw. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Yn hnguva a khaei tih lyaam tijyng nym uːtnyak khyang mymi shyakai tih Nuatpaw ky khuːhbia khyang ahngoan tijyng nyang ngyng ky hyau. Kei ce tala eyng suduan hnguːt khyang ha la hngawpaw ha jok hnguːt khyang ngyng phuitih tomti ky jum y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Puːnpoktih la thaaniav tih hyih ce byt nyak kuːh thoo bya ey tijyng yn ha na ym zong bawva, kei naakhy Nuatpaw uːmnaw theila uːtnyak kyng ky zong. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Yn khiannyng ky ce ky hnguat nyak kyng khyang la Nuatpaw hngoaimawva ahngoan nyak ky tawk ky cai shoi.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.17,18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Cee 21.17–28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Khukum byangveih diev pynnyng, khyang juː hngaw tih ha tawk kutpuan la henbawn nyak ha lu haija Jerusalem luh a ky phawlu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Kei ce cimcyang khuːhbia nyak cai pynnyng biatimm dukka hluhbawn nyak la bei khyang ha yn ha na kei ym hnguh hnguːt. Yn hnguva kei dy huattyng khyang puː ha khy myi jo, lingso khy myi jo. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Yn bawlakhy Asia pee kuːh Judah khyang cya ha ym myi. Yn ha ce kei jyng buːngiang ngy khyang myi jyngcee mynija lu theila nyang hngoaimawva buːngiang tuan. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Sikawvyngcee kei ce tuh a tala tuat tih hngoaimawva ky tung hnguva kei jyng ibyang pet khy hnguh lawh khyang myn duːn nyng myitih ha pumhngaw na suduan seh. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Cee 23.6</ref></char></note>Kei ce yn ha hngoaimawva tung theila, ‘Byttih ha thoo bya khyang cyppei theila kei hngica nyak ky khyammei lawh, tinyak khyang khyaukhaw pahuat pyt jyang pang theila ky hyau hnguːt,’ ” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ynbawlakhy Jesuh tala lyam poaija ky hnguat khiannyng Palestine uptih Felix myang naa, “nyangmi bawng jaapuː lian Lysias phawlu hnguva, kei na hngica theila ky cijang ngy,” tinaw theila yn bawng y khuːnkawh. <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Yn pynnyng yn na khyang lian nyng Pawluh to haija meihzaw shyaksa nyak bei theila y juːjawng ha na lupan lu nyak khyang kawkat kaw haija y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Ce Felix Myang la Drusilla Myang Hngoaimawva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Khuhnguːp meihzaw diev hnguva palestine uptih Felix myang ce y pihia thawntih Judah juː hngutaw Drusilla dy y lu. Yn pynnyng Pawluh pannei theila Pawluh susaih khyang Jesuh Khrit bawng y hngih ngei. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh ce puːnpok nyak tala bawng, y pumhngaw cuːmkyn nei khyang ha la thawnlu hai talacijang nyak ha y hyau hnguva, palestine uptih Felix myang na kyh theila, “Tuh a nyang zet bya. Atha mok huat cuːn myi hnguva ky pan bua ey,” y tinyak. <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ynhngu kunga y pumhngaw vyng Pawluh na kutpuan y bei jy tila uːtnyak khiannyng, yn diev kawva pannei theila khyau y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Kum hngih diev pynnyng Porcius Festus myang ce Palestine uptih Felix myang duːn y lovei bya. Felix myang na Judah ha cenga hngoai lawhei hluː khiannyng Pawluh phehimm dukka ym kyak.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Pawluh ce Festus Myang Hngoaimawva Hngica Khyam Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Festus myang ce yn pe ja phaw theila khuhnguːp hnguːp thum diev hnguva, Caesare luh kuːh Jerusalem luh a y zet. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Yn hnguva jahenpaw lian la Judah khyang lian ha ce Festus myang cenga Pawluh ym biatnyak. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Yn ha na luhngoai ym lawhei hluː khiannyng Festus myang ngyng Jerusalem luh a Pawluh tuːhlu haija ym bih. Ynbawva ym bih khyang ce yn ha na Pawluh lyam myng khiangvoi theila ynih tuk ky ym luː khiannyng a si. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Yn hnguva Festus myang na, “Pawluh ce Caesare luh a muan theila kei khycee yn luh a diev hlawn na kei pumhngaw ky zet bya ey. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Nyangmi dukkuːh khyanglianzaw tih ha ce kei dy huattyng lu theila yn khyang eyng a pet juːhuat huat myi jyngcee ynih biat nyak tyiv byih jyt,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festus myang ce yn ha cenga hnguːp shat sikawvyngcee hnguːp hngaa thua kawva myi pynnyng, Caesare luh a y zet. Atha hnguːp pyng tala duːn nyng ngoa theila Pawluh lu hai awva y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Pawluh lu hnguva, Jerusalem luh kuːh kom lutih Judah ha na ynih voidum theila ajyhtih biat nyak kyng ynih ym biat nyak, ynbawlaakhy yn ajyhtih biatnyak khyang yn ha na saksi duan nyn joaw. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na khy: “Kei ce Judah tala khy siseh, biatimm khy si seh Caesar syamphalyang khy si seh sunnei nyak pet pahuat huat khy cai hnguːt jonga,” tila y shyakkei bya.<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Yn hnguva Festus myang ce Judah ha luhngoai y lawh hluː khiannyng, Pawluh eyng, “Nyang ce Jerusalem luh a zet theila yn luh a kei hngoaimawva myn pet tyang khyang eyng cyppei theila hngica ny khyammei hluːei,?” tila y hngi.<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pawluh na, “Kei ce Caesar syamphalyang jung duːn nyng adyih khyam khiannyng mynija jyang hngica nyak ky khyammei duan. Nyang na a khyng nga ny hnguat bawva, Judah khyang ha eyng kei na ikhy sak hnguːt naw jonga. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Yn khiannyng kei ce kha theila byt khyam nyak tuan pet pahuat huat sak nyak hnguːt tyng ce byt khyammy khyang cah jonga. Ynbawlakhy kei huanna myn khyang ha a coihngiammei khyang ha pahuat khy sikawvyngcee kei yn ha kuːt tyng kuːh ym hluːh piat lawh ey, Caesar syamphalyang cenga kei adyih ky khyam,” tila y syakkei.<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Festus myang ce y pumhngaw hngica nyak khy khyang ha dy hngica theila, “Nyang ce Caesar syamphalyang cenga adyih ny khyam khiannyng yn cenga ny zet lawh ey,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Hngoaimawva Berince La Agrippa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Yn pynnyng khuhnguːp meihzaw diev pynnyng Agrippa syamphalyang la y pihia Barnis hyih cee Festus myang tovei haija Caesare luh a ym phawlu. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Yn luh a yn ha cee khuhnguːp byangveih myi khiannyng, Festus myang ce Pawluh bawng syamphalyang cenga y susaih. Festus myang na, “Palestine uptih Felix myang tyak hnguːt khyang thawngshaw pahuat y myi. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Kei Jerusalem ma ky zet hnguva, jahenpaw lian ha la Judah khyang lian ha na a coihngiammei tyang theila ynih pet bei jy ym bih. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ynbawlakhy Kei na yn ha eyng, coihngianmei khyammei lawh tih pahuat ce coihngianmei tih dy hngoai cyppei theila coihngianmei khyang y pumhngaw na shyakkei bua khyang lawh hlawn na ynih yap khyang ce Roma thumcian si jo tinyak khyang, ky syakkei bua hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Mynija yn ha ce kei dy myn luh a kym hnguva, kei ce diev kawva atha hnguːp pyng tala duːn na ngoa theila yn khyang lu haija ky hyau. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Yn hnguva ynih a coihngiammei tih ha ym thoo hnguva, kei uːtnyak hawh seetih pet ha suduan hnguːt joaw. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Yn ha cahei thong khyang bawng ha ce yn ha pumhngaw jummei nyak la byttih Jesuh bawng a si. Yn Jesuh cee byt pyn lakhy syak hiyang tila Pawluh na y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Kei ce myn cahei tong khyang ha eyng cyppei theila ibawva hngica ey tinyak khyang khindyang nyn kawva thawn khiannyng Pawluh eyng, Jerusalem luh a zet tila myn a coihngiammei khyang ha tawk hngi khyang ny khyammei hluːei, tila y hngi. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na Caesar syamphalyang cijang khyang y khyam hluː khiannyng, y pumhngaw thawng dukka jyng tyak ky y hngihei khiannyng, yn Caesar syamphalyang cenga thyak cyp tyak hai mawvy kei na ynih ky hyau,” y tinyak.<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Yn hnguva Agrippa myang na Festus myang ngyng, “Kei pumhngaw na yn hyau khyang ky jyak kyy ky luː,” tila y hyau.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festus myang na khy, “Sangu va nyang na ynih khyaukhaw ny jyak lawh ey,” tila y shyakkei bua.<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Yn khiannyng atha hnguːp pyng Agrippa myang la y pihia Barnis hyih cee poailem nuva jaapuː lian ha la luh a ming liantih khyanglian ha dy huattyng dynnei nyak ka ym phawlu. Yn hnguva Festus myang na Pawluh lupui nyak ky y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festus syamphalyang na, “Agrippa myang dy huattyng kunglu tih ha tomti vo, myn khyang nym hnguhei! Judah khyang tomti na Jerusalem luh a khy si seh, Caesarea luh a khy si seh, myn khyang ce syak hiyang tuan jo tila pang theiawla ym bih. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ynbawlakhy yn ce byt nyak khyam tuan khyang pet pahuat khy pet hnguːt nyak kaw khyang kei na ky hnguat. Y pumhngaw kung Caesar syamphalyang cenga adyih khyammei jy y kawhei khiannyng yn ce Roma luh a thyak ky kei na ky khuːnkawh. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ynbawlakhy yn nyng behei tih caw Caesare syamphalyang cenga jok ky kei jyng ahngoan tih bawng pahuat khy myi jo. Yn khiannyng myn hngica khyang pyih hnguva kei ce kawhei khyang bawng pahuat huat jok nyn ny tawk ynih mawhpaw tomti hngoaimawva la Agrippa myang hngoaimawva kei na ky lytlu shyak. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee thawngshaw pahuat a coihngiammei khyang bawng pahuat huat duan kawva thyak khyang ce tuannei jo tila kei ce ky uːtnyak,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Agrippa Myang Hngoaimawva Pawluh Pumhngaw Na Hyaubya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Yn hnguva Agrippa myang na Pawluh eyng, “Nyang bawng ny pumhngaw na ny hyau nyn,” y tinyak. Pawluh na kuːt tau theila hyaubua khyang cee:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Agrippa syamphalyang na, kei jyng Judah ha na a coihngiammei khyang ha eyng cyppei theila nyang cenga tuhhnguːp hyau bya ey khyang ce khunkhyi pahuat tijyng kei na ky uːtnyak. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee nyang ce Judah ha thumcian la cahei thawng khyang ha eyng poaija hnguat tih a ny thawn. Yn khiannyng kei shyakkei bua khyang lungshau duːppei theila ngeishyam piat ty ky khawhei.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Kei ce acuːk kyng ky pumhngaw myi hnguːt nyak kyng khy si seh, yn pynnyng Jerusalem luh a khy si seh, ky dikzaw hnguva kuːhthuh ibawva puhcai myi hnguːt khyang Judah khyang juː tomti na ym hnguat giah. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Cee 23.6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Phil 3.5</ref></char></note>Kei ce keimi jummei nyak kyng lyklyammy khyang ciatmuat tih bawng Pharisee bawng pahuat ta myi hnguːt khyang, yn ha na ym hnguat khyang diev pyn. Yn ha na ym lung nyng luː nyak myi jyngcee saksi ym khyam nyn. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nuatpaw na keimi shyakai ha eyng bei hnguːt khyang setzaw khindyang uːmnyak khiannyng, tuh a kei ce ciceih ky khyammei lawh. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Keimi juːjawng khulaihngih cee Nuatpaw hnguːp la juan khuːhbia theila, yn setzaw bawva kuːmcei nyak ky ym zong uːmmei. Agrippa syamphalyang vo, kei ce yn bawva zongei khiannyng Judah ha a coihngiammei khyang ky khyammei lawh. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Nuatpaw na byttih ha y thoo shyak pyn hngucee, ibawthawnyng nyangmi na jum nyn kaw khyang tijyng nym uːtnyak ma?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.9–11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Cee 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22.4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref></char>
    </note>“Kei pumhngaw na khy Nazareth luh zawpaw Jesuh ming ngyng tuat nyn hawh phehphaei jy tila ky uːtnyak hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Yn khiannyng Jerusalem luh eyng khy ynbaw tyng nga ky cai hnguːt. Kei ce jahenpaw lian ha uːtyang ngyng jummeitih ha panukung phehimm kyak ce khawmcyang la yn ha byt ty cijang khyam lawh hngu na ky puijei hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Khuːhbia nyak sinakok ka khy yn ha diev kawva pet bei theila, Nuatpaw ym siatnyak khyang tha eyng ky cai shyak hnguːt. Yn cee khawm cyang la yn ha huanna dekkhuːt hnguva lungtyn hngudyam theila aciya pe luh ha cyp yn ha tym jok theinga ky phehphaei hnguːt.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Na Y Hleijei Khyang Saihnyak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ceepaw 9.1–19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Ynbawva kei ce jahenpaw lian uːtyang ha summei theila Damascus luh a ky zet. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Agrippa syamphalyang vo, khusun nyng ynbawva lyaam myng ky zet hnguva, huankhu kuːh angtih ava ce kei la ky bawngpui ha kika a anglu khyang ky hnguh. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Keimi tomti dek kyng gu giah theila Hebre be ja kei na thai ky jyak, ‘Sawluh, Sawluh, ibawthawnyng kei ny phehphaei maa? a humhat ny shot jyngcee nyang na jyng ny nehei jy,’ tila hyau khyang thai ky jyak. <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Yn hnguva kei na, ‘Mawhpaw aw, Nyang u ma?’ tila ky hngi. ‘Mawhpaw na, kei ce nyang phehphaei khyang Jesuh ky si. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nyang ce thoo theila ny khu vyng tung. Kei ce nyang hngoaimawva podyang lu khyang ce nyang ce kei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Acya kutjokcawvyng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jyng tinyak khyang myi jo.</char></note> maapaw va thawn haija ky yap pyn. Ynbaw ce ja nyang hnguh hnguːt khyang la nyang ngyng kei suduan ny khyang bawng ha aciya ha eyng saksi ny khyammei lawh ey. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Kei na Judah kuːt duk kuːh khy si seh, khyang juː ciya kuːt duk kuːh khy si seh, kei na nyang ky hluːh ey. Ynpynnyng nyang yn ha cenga ky tuh ey. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Yn ha ahung ngyng kuːh ava lyaamma khy si seh, khawkhawng phungan duk kuːh Nuatpaw cenga hleijei lu haija nyang ce yn ha mik ha ny hngawn lawh ey. Ynbaw hnguva jyng yn ha ce ym pet ha tawk hluːh nyak khyammei lawh ey. Yn pynnyng ce kei jummei khiannyng Nuatpaw na cimcaih shyak khyang, khyang duːn na ym pui lawh ey,’ tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Na Y Khuːtbi Khyang Y saih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Yn khiannyng Agrippa syamphalyang na, kei ce huankhu kuːh ky lawh khyang yn lunghnguːn ce lyklyam kawva myi jonga. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Cee 9.20</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref></char></note>Acuːk kyng Damascus luh shaw haa, yn pynnyng Jerusalem luh shaw ha, Judah pe shaw ha la khyang juː ciya ha eyng, nyangmi ce jubaijei theila Nuatpaw cenga nym lubya lawh ey. Yn pynnyng jubaijei nyak kyng cyppei tih puhcai khyang nym puhcai lawh ey, tila ky susaih hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Yn bawva ky susaih khiannyng ycya Judah khyang ha na kei biatimm dukka muan theila kei tukky ym khiangvoi hnguːt. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ynbawlakhy kei ce Nuatpaw puijei nyak ky khyam lawh khiannyng, hnguːp tyng, tungoa theila khyang hluːng la niam ha cenga saksi ky khyammei. Yn bawva ky susaih hnguva, hngawpaw ha la Mosee susaih hnguːt khyang samawlyam ma thawnlu hai ha jyang ky susaih. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Kor 15.20</ref></char></note>Yn ky susaih hnguːt bawva Messiah ce phehphaei khyam lawh ey. Yn pynnyng ce byttih ha duk kyng acuːk hiyang theila thoo bya khyang Judah khyang juː ha la khyang ciya juː ha cenga ava tih khyaukhaw jaw shyak theila ky susaih,” tila y hyau bya.<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Yn bawva Pawluh na hyau bya hnguva Festus myang na, “Pawluh ny gungoak pyn, ny cawkshyang ngei khyang caw na nyang a gungoak shyak,” tila thai jyau vyng y pang.<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Yn hnguva, “Pawluh na, a hlyija poaitih Festus myang aw, kei gungoak jonga, hngoan theila tuannei tih khyaukhaw jyang ky hyau. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Myn byang bawng ha Agrippa syamphalyang na y hnguat khiannyng, nyang hngoaimawva kei na kyh kawva ky hyau. Yn bawng ha ce jaadik duːn nyng thawn hnguːt tih bawng si kaw khiannyng, nyang na hnguat kawva myi jo tijyng kei na ky uːtnyak. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Agrippa syamphalyang aw, hngawpaw ha ny jummei? Nyang na ny jum khyang kei na ky hnguat,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Yn hnguva Agrippa syamphalyang na Pawluh eyng, “Nyang na acuːn toi zawva kei Khritjian pahuat ta thawn haija ny hliang ngei nyn ny tijyng ny tawvei,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pawluh na, “Acuːn toi sikawvyngcee shau va khy thawn seh, nyang ce khawmcyang la tuhhnguːp kei khyaukhaw ngeitih tomti ce myn thijoii khyammei thua, kei baw ce ja ym thawnlu vy tawk, Nuatpaw cenga ky hngihminnei,” tila y shyakkei bya.<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Yn hnguva Agrippa syamphalyang ce thoo theila, luh uptih la y pihia Barnis pyng kuːhthuh yn ha dy ym ngoa hah tih tomti khy ym thoo giah. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Yn ha tomti ym zet bya pynnyng pahuat la pahuat ym hyau vy ym phun, “Myn khyang y byt tuan nyak, sikawvyngcee phehimm kyak khyam tuan khyang ikhy cai hnguːt jo,” tila ym hyau. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agrippa myang na, “Myn khyang ce Caesar syamphalyang cenga adyih khyam hnguːt kawvyng ce hluːh nyn tila Festus myang nyng,” y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pawluh Ce Roma lyamma Tuisyamphua Eyng Y Zunnyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Festus myang na keimi Italy ja kitawlawng ngyng thyak ky hnguːn pynnyng, yn ha na Pawluh la aciya thawngshaw ha la ciya Regiment jaapuː eyng sengei tih jaapuː uptih Julius mingnawtih cenga ym bek. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Keimi ce Asia pe tuikhyam tomti jyng myitih tuikhyam luh a zun hngyh hai Adramyttium tuisyamphua huanna khoi awla kym cun. Macedonia pe shaw Thessalonica luh shaw Aristarchus khy ce keimi dy y lyklu. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Atha hnguːp pyng Sidon lyangkhyam ma kym happei. Julius na Pawluh eyng khiat nyak kyng hyau theila y kyi ha cenga zet theila lupan nyak y cai shyak. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Ynija kuːhthuh keimi panglai lyamma kym cun hnguva, ki ce a lipsi lyamma lu khiannyng, Cyprus khongphai ki hup nyak lyamma kym cun. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Keimi ce Cilicia pee la Pamphylia pee kuːh panglai pek theila cun pynnyng, keimi ha Lycia pe ja myitih Myra luh a kym phaw. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Yn luh a Italy lyamma cun hai Alexandria tuisamphua pahuat khyanglian na hngu theila keimi yn tuisyamphua huanna y koi shyak.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Keimi ce khuhnguːp byangveih gigiang nga cun pynnyng, Cnidus luh ka a kaeitih a kym phawei. Ki ce lipsi lyamma lu khiannyng Salmone zehtaw theila Crete khongphai kuːh ki hup nyak lyamma kym cun. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Yn bawva tuiikhyam tomti kaei tih a kym cun lu pynnyng, Lasea luh eyng lawijei tih Lyangkawm Poai nyak duːn na kym phaw.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Acuːn byangveih diev theila, Pet Hluːh Hnguːp<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Pet Hluːh Hnguːp: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yn ce Hkham kkhaw pyih la Khaamtyang kkhaw acuːk hnguva ym cai khyang, khuhngoai see cuːn nyng cun khyang seekhaw va thawn hnguːt.</char></note> byih pynnyng, panglai lyam zet tuan kaw khyang khuhngoai khyng kaw khiannyng, Pawluh na, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Khyang ha aw, myn lyam myng lawkla la tuisyamphua khawmcyang mymi syak ha la cimpak hai lian thawn lu vy tijyng ky hnguh,” tila sathih y bei. <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ynbawlakhy jaapuː uptih na Pawluh khyaukhaw thyaak ka tuisyamphua mawh la tuisyamphua moktih ha khyaukhaw jyang y ngei. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Yn lawng hapnyak ce khusik khyaam nyak ky, khyng kaw khiannyng, thawn nyn nyngcee yn duːn ngyng kuːh ga theila Phoenix luh a phaw nyn nyngcee, Phoenix luh a lawng hap nyak khyng theila khusik khyam nyn ny tawk khyang panukung na ym hyau. Yn lawng hap nyak ce Crete khongphai lawng hapnyak thawn theila a khawkyak ping la khawkyak pyang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khawkyak ping la khawkyak pyang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sikawvyngcee </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hngilu ping la hngilu pyang.</char></note> kikawvyng hngoai myangei.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Panglai Jyng Kilian Lunyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Pyang lyam kuːh ki ce hehe zawva a lu hnguva, yn ha na ym pumhngaw khindyang khyang awngtyang tijyng khin theila lunghum jyh tih buːk theila Crete khongphai lyaamma tyng kym cun. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ynbawlakhy diev kawva mawlyam pyang kuːh hariking tijyng ym hyau khyang ki lian ce khong lyaamma kuːh a lu. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Tuisyamphua ce ki khawm theila ki lu thuːuː nyn kaw khiannyng, keimi khycee tawlak theila ki zeh nyak tyng kym cun lawh. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Ynbawlakhy keimi ce Cauda ym tinyak khyang khongphai dik ki hup nawva by theila syakdolawng khy kaei tih a kym hyap nyn. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Yn lawng dik tuisyamphua huanna tyang pynnyng, tuisyamphua pianpyak theila joii jyng kym khawnhyan. Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee Syrtis bahinpyy vyng tyang ngei jy khy cyh nyak khiannyng tuisyamphua dyap ha khym bua theila ki lu nyak tyng ym jawn. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Keimi ce byibu ki lian khawm khiannyng atha hnguːp pyng yn ha na lawkla ha tuisyamphua huan kuːh ym dyyi giah. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Hnguːp thum nyak kyng, yn ha ce tuisyamphua duk kuːh summei khyang ha loo theila ym dyyi bua tuh. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Keimi ce khuhngi la arsi ha khy khuhnguːp diev va hngu lawh jo awnga. Ki ce tha eyng lu hyam. A pyih nyak kyng keimi ce khawmsiat duk kuːh lytnyak ky uːtnyak khyang myi ti jo.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Yn ha ce acuːn diev va eiou kawva myi theila, Pawluh na yn ha duːduːm myng tung theila, “Khyang ha aw, nyangmi ce kei hyau khyang dynnei theila Crete khongphai lyamma my cun kaw vyngcee, myn cimpak nyak la ciliau nyak khawm lawh hai sijo paw. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ynbawlakhy nyangmi jyng ky kawhei, tuh a tha lovei byih jyt. Nyangmi u khy byt tya jo, tuisyamphua pyt jyng ciliau vy tya. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee kei pyng theila kei khuːhbia khyang Nuatpaw huankhu ceepaw ce jyantuː muː juan na kei cenga lu theila, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />‘Pawluh aw, kyh kawh, nyang ce Caesar syamphalyang hngoaimawva ny voang lawh ey. Yn pynnyng Nuatpaw ce nyang dy huattyng cun hahtih tomti syak khawmsiat dukkuːh lytnyak y bei hnguːt,’ tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Yn khiannyng, khyang ha aw, tha lovei byih jyt. Kei hyau hnguːt bawva tynga thawn ny tijyng Nuatpaw ky jummei. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ynbawlakhy mymi ce acya khongphai pahuat huanna my tyangei voih jy,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Hnguːp khulaipahli juan phaw hnguva, ki na Adriatic panglai huanna jawnnei jok theila, khujuan duːduːm myng tuiisamphua moktih ha na khonga ngyng lawijei hngyh tila ym uːtnyak. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Yn khiannyng tuiithook khyang ym cyam hnguva lyaam kua a thook. Yn pynnyng mawlyam meihzaw ym zet bya tuː theila atha ym cyam bua tuːh hnguva a lyam kulaipahngaw a thook tijyng ym hnguat lawh. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Yn tuisyamphua lung ngyng ym thokkei jy ym kyh, yn khiannyng tuisyamphua moktih ha na tuisyamphua hngu khunnyak pahli khaw theila khuva lu vy jyang ym hngihminnei. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ynbawlakhy tuisyamphua shaw ha na tuisyamphua eyng kuːh ym lytnyak ky cai awla, tuisyamphua mok lyaamma zet theiawla tuisyamphua khunnyak khaw hai bawva thawn theila syakdolawng tuii jyng ym kyak. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Yn hnguva Pawluh na jaapuː la jaapuː lianzaw ha eyng, “Myn khyang ha ce tuisyamphua huanna ym myi kaw vyngcee, nyangmi khy khawmsiat lyt nyn jo,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Yn khiannyng jaapuː ha na lawng joii khuːn theila syakdolawng ym hawn tit.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Khuthawi lu tian hnguva, Pawluh na yn ha tomti jyng juːhuat huat eiou vy y khawhei. “Nyangmi cee ikhy eiou kawva nym zong khyang hnguːp khulaipahli cup hngyh. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Yn khiannyng eiou vy tawk nyangmi jyng ky khawhei. Nyangmi eiou hngu jyng tha luih theila nyangmi shyak hyang nyn ny. Nyangmi lukee kuːh lusam samhuat khy kuːk hai si jo,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Yn bawva y hyau pynnyng, yn na phe loo theila khyang ha hngoaimawva Nuatpaw khunkhyi shyhpuah theila yn iak theila y ei. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Yn ha tomti khy tha lawhei theila eiawk ym ei. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Tuisyamphua huanna kuːh khyang tomti ce 276<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">276; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aciya kutjokcawvyng </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">275; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi; aciya eyng </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">76 byang, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng myi.</char></note> kym myi. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Yn ha na eiawk ym luː hawh eiou pynnyng, tuncaang tomti ce panglai dukka dyyi awla tuisyamphua ce a hyaang bya.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuisyamphua Paknyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Khuthawi lu hnguva, ibyang a duːn tijyng tuisyamphua shaw na hnguat kaw lakhy, panglai tuikhyam myitih panglai kep pahuat tinyak khyang sathih ym tyakkei. Yn khiannyng thawn nyn hngucee tuisyamphua yn konga cenga happei nyn ny tijyng ym hnguːn. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Yn pynnyng lawng khunnyak ha sat awla panglai dukka ym kyak, mokhuat pyt tyng tyakpaih joii ha shut pynnyng, tuisyamphua hlang theila kong lyamma ym bek. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ynbawlakhy panglai tuii khawmmei nyak pahinpyy huanna tuisyamphua hap theila tuisyamphua mok cee khong ngyng tyangei theila hluːnhlawk nyn tijo, apaih lyam khy tuiileng ha na ba theila akhuːn khuːn na a pak.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Jaapuː ha ce thawngshaw ha khong lyaamma tuiijo theila ym zen ny khyang cyh nyak khiannyng, ym tukky ym cijang. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ynbawlakhy jaapuː mawh ce Pawluh syak hluːh piat hluː khiannyng, yn ha lungkhin khyang kawkat theila tuiijo nyn tih ha khy tuisyamphua huan kuːh alang mawva shoi theila kong lyamma ym joo. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Myi hnguːt tih ha ce pianlap la tuisyamphua pak akuːn ha eyng ym joo vy y hyau. Yn bawva keimi ha tomti ce kong huanna khawmsee kawva kym phaw giah.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Malta Khongphai Ja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Keimi ce khongphai ja khawmsiat kawva kym hap hnguva, yn khongphai ce Malta khong tijyng ym hyau khyang kym hnguat. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Kongphai shaw ha na keimi kunga hlyi ja ym mannei. Khuaw theila kym jawng ngei khiannyng, yn ha ce mei phuːpiat theila keimi tomti ym do vei. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Yn pynnyng Pawluh ce haausawm pahuat kua theila mei huanna y phum hnguva, phuakuːm pahuat ce a ling khiannyng haausawm duk kuːh lyt lu theila Pawluh kuːt a cuhei. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Kongphai shaw ha na Pawluh kuːt tyng kuːh buattei tih phua ym hnguh hnguva, “Myn khyang cee khyang tutih y si jy; yn ce panglai ja kuːh lyt lu lakhy nuatnu na khy ynih syak kangsa shyak hai si jo,” tila pahuat la pahuat ym pyiu vei. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ynbawlakhy Pawluh na phua mei dukka tuːngset theila neh khawm kawva y lyt. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Pawluh kuːt khycee phing lu theila yn ha na byangveih zawvyng sikawvyngcee cacatnuva hngyng theila y byt lu vy tila ym zong. Ynbawlakhy acuːn diev va zong lakhy Pawluh ce ibawkhy thawn lu khyang ym hnguh hnguva, yn ha uːtnyak khyang bawva sikaw khiannyng, “Myn khyang ce nuat pahuat jyang y thawn nyn,” tila ym hyau.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Yn lingliang tomti jyng khongphai khyanglian Publius dek ha panukung a myi. Yn ce keimi ha do lu theila hnguːp thum y khiin nyak piat. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Publius paw ce kua theila hngyannu nehei theila ip nyak duːn na y hngyng ngei. Pawluh ce yn cenga zet theila y hngihminnei piat pynnyng, ynih huanna y kuːt tyang theila yn ce kaangsa bya. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Yn bawva thawn pynnyng, yn khongphai huanna kuːh aciya kuanaw tih ha khy lu awla Pawluh na yn ha y kangsa shyak. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Yn ha na ce keimi ha eyng kuːtpuan ha ym bei. Yn pynnyng keimi zet bya ey acuːn phawlu hnguva, yn ha na keimi luːei khyang lawkla ha khy tuiisamphua huanna ym duan lu piat.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Roma Luh A Pawluh Phawlu Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Kkhaw thum diev pynnyng, keimi ce yn kongphai ja khusik hnguva kuːhthuh duːmtih tuisyamphua eyng ym cun bya. Yn tuisyamphua ce Alexander luh kuːh lu theila tuisyamphua mok kyng nuat luːp phy pahngih apui. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Yn pynnyg keimi ce Syracuse luh a hap theila yn luh a hnguːp thum ym awm. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Yn luh a kuːh atha cun bya thuːh hnguva Rhegium luh a kym phaw. Atha hnguːp pyng apyang ki lu theila a hngih hnguːp pyng Puteoli luh a kym phaw. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Yn luh a jummeitih ha khawmmei theila yn ha na hnguːp shyh awm my ym khawhei bawva awm theiawnga keimi ce Roma luh lyamma kym zet. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Roma luh a kuːh jummeitih ha na keimi lu khyang ym jyak hnguva, aciya ha na ce Appius tukjyh nyak luh duːn cyp si seh, acya ha na ce khiin awm nyak imm pathum tijyng mingnawtih duːn cyp si seh, lu awla ym do lu. Pawluh na yn ha y khawmmei hnguva Nuatpaw tyaknaw theila tha y lawhie.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Roma Luh A Pawluh Khuːtbi Nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Roma luh a kym phaw hnguva, Pawluh ce y pumhngaw myi theila ynih zongtih jaapuː pahuat khy yn dy myi hah.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Hnguːp thum diev pynnyng Pawluh na Judah khyanglian ha huattyng y dynnei shyak. Yn ha ym phawlu hnguva Pawluh na, “Benau tih ha aw, kei ce my khyang juː ha eyng khy si seh, my shyakai thumcian nyng khy siseh, cypkap tih kaw juːhuat pyt khy cai hnguːt kaw nga khy Jerusalem luh a muan khyammei lawh theinga Roma khyang ha kuːt dukka yap ky khyammei lawh. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Roma khyang ha na kei ym hngi hnguva byt nyakky tuan tih shoisak ym hnguh kaw khiannyng, kei ym hluːh hluː bua. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Cee 25.11</ref></char></note>Yn hnguva Judah khyang ha na ym kauh hnguva, kei na Caesar syamphalyang cenga ky lyt kaw khiannyng adyih ky khyam lawh. Yn baw adyih ky khyam lawh khyang cee ky khyang hngaw ha buːnhlian ny khyang bawng myi jyng si jo. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Myn khiannyng kei ce nyangmi dy khawmmei theila besaijei jy ky bih khyang a si. A hngoan na kei ce Isreal khyang juː ha uːtnyak khyang Messiah kom lu vy khyang jum khiannyng, myn thijoii jyng khawnhyan ky khyammei lawh,” tila y hyau.<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Yn hnguva yn ha na, “Keimi na Judah pe kuːh nyang bawng joktih caw ha lawh jo awnga. Yn pee ja phawlu tih Judah benau ha dukka khy nyang bawng seetih a kawva hyau tih pahuat khy myi joaw. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ynbawlakhy nyangmi taw khyang keimi na kym jyak hluː, ibawthawnnyngmatijyngcee aduːn tyng kuːh khyang ha na myn bawng hawdawh nyak khyaukhaw keimi na kym khindang,” tila ym hyau.<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Yn pynnyng yn ha na Pawluh dy khyammei jy khuhnguːp ym hngyah. Ym hngyah hnguːp phawlu hnguva yn ha ce khyang panukung dy khiin myi nyak duːn cyp ym lu. Pawluh na ngutyh eyng kuːhthuh khumuː cyp yn ha eyng Nuatpaw teengpee bawng susaih theila saksi y khyammei. Mosee tala la hngawpaw tala ha khy lo theila Jesuh bawng jummei lu haija tha lovei theila y susaih. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Aciya ha ce Pawluh susaih khyang ym dynnei awla ym jummei, aciya ha na ce jummei joaw. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Yn khiannyng yn ha ce pahuat la pahuat ym lung khongkauvei. Yn pynnyng yn ha ce ym zet bya ey ym thawn hnguva Pawluh na, “Hngawpaw Isaiah eyng Muikhaw Cim na nyangmi shyakai ha eyng ahngoan na y hyau khyang ce: <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Nyangmi cee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“ ‘Kei hyau khyang khyaukhaw nym jyak hngyak kyng jawcu jozaw;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Kei puhcai khyang ha nym hnguh hngyak kyng jawcu nyn jozaw; tila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">yn khyang ha cenga zet,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ibawthawnnyngma tijyngcee ni khyang ha lung ce bit theila;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ym hngaw khy pyang;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ym mik khy puːmmei awla ym myi jei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ynbaw kaw vyngcee ym mik kyng hngu theila;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ym hngaw vyng jaw theila;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ym lungbawng ngyng jawcu theila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Yn ha ce hlaijei lu awla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kei na yn ha ky kangsa shyak ky tila hyau vei byih jyt,’ tijyng a si.<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />“Yn khiannyng Nuatpaw bei khyang myn lilovei nyak khyangjuː ciya ha cenga ky thyaak jok pyn, yn khiannyng yn ha na yn tala dynnei theila ym jummei jy khyang nyangmi na hnguat byih jyt,” tila y hyau. <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" pubnumber="[29]" sid="ACT 28:29" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aciya kutjokcawvyng a diktih 29: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pawluh na yn hyau pynnyng, Judah ha ym zet bya, ym kikawvyng ym khongkauvei, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tijyng bawngei.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Yn Roma luh a Pawluh ce y pumhngaw haw khyang imm myng kum hngih myi theila ynih cenga lutih khiin tomti lungjy nyak kyng y dodyang ngei. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Pawluh na Nuatpaw teengpee bawng la Mawhpaw Jesuh Khrist bawng kyh nyak la kawkat nyak myi kawva y susaih.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>